(455597, 42949, 7504, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I think I''d like it better if the glass were a little clearer, it seems dirty or smoky or something.  The filament is clear and crisp, and I know how hard it is to capture light like this.  You''ve got your settings perfect, it seems to me.  Doesn''t really say WOW but definately says "light".</td>', 'Nice image, I think I''d like it better if the glass were a little clearer, it seems dirty or smoky or something.  The filament is clear and crisp, and I know how hard it is to capture light like this.  You''ve got your settings perfect, it seems to me.  Doesn''t really say WOW but definately says "light".', '2003-10-20 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
