(455609, 42843, 6870, '<td valign="top">...take me home...to the place...I belong...Well, well, well. Nice model, and I feel the light here serves to bring focus to her and to her somewhat pensive emotions. She sticks out because of her different tones (black and blue of clothing), and the light amplifies your communication of what she is feeling. I think.</td>', '...take me home...to the place...I belong...Well, well, well. Nice model, and I feel the light here serves to bring focus to her and to her somewhat pensive emotions. She sticks out because of her different tones (black and blue of clothing), and the light amplifies your communication of what she is feeling. I think.', '2003-10-20 01:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
