(455616, 42843, 9932, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. <br/> <br/>I love the lighting. It''s to bad you did not have more room to work with. By this I mean bringing the subject further from the tree line and blur more of the background out.<br/> <br/>I definately woud have cropped the rocks/road out of the foreground and maybe a little more off the left side.<br/> <br/>Great work.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I love the lighting. It''s to bad you did not have more room to work with. By this I mean bringing the subject further from the tree line and blur more of the background out. I definately woud have cropped the rocks/road out of the foreground and maybe a little more off the left side. Great work.', '2003-10-20 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(455617, 43002, 9932, '<td valign="top">Real nice. Just a little to much glare on the vase.</td>', 'Real nice. Just a little to much glare on the vase.', '2003-10-20 02:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(455619, 42949, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really cool idea. Edison at his best! ''twould be nice if the bulb itself were nearly invisible so we could focus on the cool mechanics inside it. Try this: using Selective Color, add black to the Neutral colors, and fiddle with that for a while.</td>', 'Really cool idea. Edison at his best! ''twould be nice if the bulb itself were nearly invisible so we could focus on the cool mechanics inside it. Try this: using Selective Color, add black to the Neutral colors, and fiddle with that for a while.', '2003-10-20 02:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(455624, 42685, 259, '<td valign="top">very sexy.  i like the grain too.  two things that would improve the shot are moving just a bit to avoid the plug, and to rotate the pic a tad to level the floor.  dispite those two things its still a great shot.  its got a nice artistic feel that not many shot here have, and i like that about it.</td>', 'very sexy.  i like the grain too.  two things that would improve the shot are moving just a bit to avoid the plug, and to rotate the pic a tad to level the floor.  dispite those two things its still a great shot.  its got a nice artistic feel that not many shot here have, and i like that about it.', '2003-10-20 02:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(455626, 42960, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice.  one of the best shots this week.</td>', 'very nice.  one of the best shots this week.', '2003-10-20 02:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(455627, 42770, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice <br/>What is that distraction in the lower left corner?<br/>Just a little to much glare on the pumpkin.<br/>I don''t like the frame it is tacky looking. <br/>Frames are hard to go with in the challenges.</td>', 'Very nice What is that distraction in the lower left corner?Just a little to much glare on the pumpkin.I don''t like the frame it is tacky looking. Frames are hard to go with in the challenges.', '2003-10-20 02:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
