(455644, 42607, 9932, '<td valign="top">Good title and nice idea. But I do not get the feeling of midnight blues?<br/>It looks like it is on a kitchen counter? <br/>On a nightstand or etc would have boosted the shot.<br/>Did your also try to blur the second hand (Time exposure)?</td>', 'Good title and nice idea. But I do not get the feeling of midnight blues?It looks like it is on a kitchen counter? On a nightstand or etc would have boosted the shot.Did your also try to blur the second hand (Time exposure)?', '2003-10-20 02:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(455645, 42815, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice work.<br/>It is to bad the front row of bottles couldn''t have had the same amount of light as the top row. Would have given it so much more punch? Still a nice vote.</td>', 'Nice work.It is to bad the front row of bottles couldn''t have had the same amount of light as the top row. Would have given it so much more punch? Still a nice vote.', '2003-10-20 02:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(455646, 42685, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love the grainy effect here and the photo overall.  One small thing that niggles me though is the power outlet, I found it distracting.  Obviously can''t photoshop it out, but the girl to the left might have avoided it ..... unless of course there is something else to the left.  Nice work though :)</td>', 'Love the grainy effect here and the photo overall.  One small thing that niggles me though is the power outlet, I found it distracting.  Obviously can''t photoshop it out, but the girl to the left might have avoided it ..... unless of course there is something else to the left.  Nice work though :)', '2003-10-20 02:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
