(455705, 42895, 9441, '<td valign="top">very good!  Nice color choices, wonderful soft lighting...good composition!  10.</td>', 'very good!  Nice color choices, wonderful soft lighting...good composition!  10.', '2003-10-20 03:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(455708, 42207, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image.  The terra cotta goes well with your choice of background and lighting.  The coral/peach color along the horizon brings out the color in the vase.  I also like the way the light plays on the surface - it gives me an impression of a sunset viewed through a cloud layer so the light and color is diffused.  I do find the white light a bit harsh where it is centered in the background.  It looks as though there is a barrier between it and the subject, but its still a little bright especially compared to the soft color along the image''s horizon.  Focus is great, nice and crisp.  6</td>', 'This is a nice image.  The terra cotta goes well with your choice of background and lighting.  The coral/peach color along the horizon brings out the color in the vase.  I also like the way the light plays on the surface - it gives me an impression of a sunset viewed through a cloud layer so the light and color is diffused.  I do find the white light a bit harsh where it is centered in the background.  It looks as though there is a barrier between it and the subject, but its still a little bright especially compared to the soft color along the image''s horizon.  Focus is great, nice and crisp.  6', '2003-10-20 03:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(455710, 42895, 12902, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Good choice on the colours. I like the combination of lights and shadows.</td>', 'Great picture. Good choice on the colours. I like the combination of lights and shadows.', '2003-10-20 03:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
