(455717, 42969, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. I wish a deer would pose for me long enough as to take a picture of it.</td>', 'Excellent picture. I wish a deer would pose for me long enough as to take a picture of it.', '2003-10-20 03:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(455718, 42876, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice picture that evokes both autumn and harvest for me.  The colors look like they were brilliant, though I think the evening? light doesn''t do them justice.  I do like how the machinery is highlighted slightly by light, but since that looks to be the focus of the image, I wish the highlighting was more pronounced, stronger lighting, etc.  So it seemed lighter like the two pumpkins at the front, instead of starting to blend in the darkness of the background.  All said, a strong image.  7</td>', 'A nice picture that evokes both autumn and harvest for me.  The colors look like they were brilliant, though I think the evening? light doesn''t do them justice.  I do like how the machinery is highlighted slightly by light, but since that looks to be the focus of the image, I wish the highlighting was more pronounced, stronger lighting, etc.  So it seemed lighter like the two pumpkins at the front, instead of starting to blend in the darkness of the background.  All said, a strong image.  7', '2003-10-20 03:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(455719, 42855, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful warm hues!  Terrific lighting!!</td>', 'wonderful warm hues!  Terrific lighting!!', '2003-10-20 03:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(455722, 43015, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what mood you are going for with this image, the title says to me tired and worn.  The lighting is good, though I think its a bit bright on the left side - that said, I do like how the shoe mostly contains that bright light to the one side giving a nice tonal difference.  Great focus but the image doesn''t speak to me much - perhaps it would have a bit more drama in b&amp;w?  5</td>', 'I''m not sure what mood you are going for with this image, the title says to me tired and worn.  The lighting is good, though I think its a bit bright on the left side - that said, I do like how the shoe mostly contains that bright light to the one side giving a nice tonal difference.  Great focus but the image doesn''t speak to me much - perhaps it would have a bit more drama in b&w?  5', '2003-10-20 03:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(455724, 42960, 11923, '<td valign="top">An arresting photo.  I like the b&amp;w choice.  I like the rigid lines of the window panes playing background to the more organic curves of the bottle and glasses.  I do find the smidges of glare a little distracting but overly much.  What actual grabs my attention negatively is the window looks streaked.  Weird huh??  Also, this is just curiousity - is that bottle bent at the top or is that just perspective and lighting playing tricks on me?  The filled glass has good focus, but I wish the other one and the bottle wasn''t quite as soft focused.  Great framing and overall presentation.  7</td>', 'An arresting photo.  I like the b&w choice.  I like the rigid lines of the window panes playing background to the more organic curves of the bottle and glasses.  I do find the smidges of glare a little distracting but overly much.  What actual grabs my attention negatively is the window looks streaked.  Weird huh??  Also, this is just curiousity - is that bottle bent at the top or is that just perspective and lighting playing tricks on me?  The filled glass has good focus, but I wish the other one and the bottle wasn''t quite as soft focused.  Great framing and overall presentation.  7', '2003-10-20 04:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(455725, 42674, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I love the colors and the way you captured the light on just the front of the cat''s face. The jack-o-lantern is great.</td>', 'Great shot! I love the colors and the way you captured the light on just the front of the cat''s face. The jack-o-lantern is great.', '2003-10-20 04:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
