(455728, 43008, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest and say I''m not following the title, Hoplites were a type of warrior yes?  Regardless, I find this a nice powerful photo.  The simple lines are great, as is the use of b&amp;w and the organic feel to it.  Nice use of space and the lighting really adds a nice drama to it, imo.  9</td>', 'I''ll be honest and say I''m not following the title, Hoplites were a type of warrior yes?  Regardless, I find this a nice powerful photo.  The simple lines are great, as is the use of b&w and the organic feel to it.  Nice use of space and the lighting really adds a nice drama to it, imo.  9', '2003-10-20 04:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
