(455812, 43014, 11570, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait - looking at the reflection in the glass the light source looks unusual.  Ah!!! think I just realised it''s candles.</td>', 'Interesting portrait - looking at the reflection in the glass the light source looks unusual.  Ah!!! think I just realised it''s candles.', '2003-10-20 09:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(455813, 42483, 11570, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette - personally I would have cropped the right hand side but by how much?</td>', 'Great silhouette - personally I would have cropped the right hand side but by how much?', '2003-10-20 09:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(455815, 42685, 7485, '<td valign="top">A strange combination of effects. I''m not sure the grainyness adds anything, but the straight model with tilted floor-line is kinda interesting. Biggest problem for me is how her back almost blends with the background on the left.</td>', 'A strange combination of effects. I''m not sure the grainyness adds anything, but the straight model with tilted floor-line is kinda interesting. Biggest problem for me is how her back almost blends with the background on the left.', '2003-10-20 09:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(455817, 42846, 472, '<td valign="top">would have been better if you had lit the bg or backlit the win to give the liquid ''glow'' and ''sparkle''</td>', 'would have been better if you had lit the bg or backlit the win to give the liquid ''glow'' and ''sparkle''', '2003-10-20 09:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(455818, 42985, 7485, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but maybe more interesting if the beam had been narrower, just on the arms and head?</td>', 'Neat idea, but maybe more interesting if the beam had been narrower, just on the arms and head?', '2003-10-20 09:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(455819, 42693, 11570, '<td valign="top">A nice exposure, just look at those star trails.<br/> <br/>The brick blocks of the building have a too heavy a presence - I would have cropped the low area to remove them.</td>', 'A nice exposure, just look at those star trails. The brick blocks of the building have a too heavy a presence - I would have cropped the low area to remove them.', '2003-10-20 09:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(455820, 42773, 472, '<td valign="top">an 8, only because the one with the butterfly was better :P</td>', 'an 8, only because the one with the butterfly was better :P', '2003-10-20 09:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(455821, 43014, 7485, '<td valign="top">The blurred eyes (eyelids?) are just strange</td>', 'The blurred eyes (eyelids?) are just strange', '2003-10-20 09:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(455822, 42985, 11570, '<td valign="top">I must get one of these models - fun for all I see.<br/> <br/>Nicely set up and done.</td>', 'I must get one of these models - fun for all I see. Nicely set up and done.', '2003-10-20 09:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(455823, 42983, 472, '<td valign="top">i bet i know who took this. it has that style to it. we''ll see in the end ;0)</td>', 'i bet i know who took this. it has that style to it. we''ll see in the end ;0)', '2003-10-20 09:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(455824, 42666, 11570, '<td valign="top">Good idea well executed.  But IMO the bottome needs a good cropping, I find the red lit chrome stand distracts for the beautifully lit mic shield.</td>', 'Good idea well executed.  But IMO the bottome needs a good cropping, I find the red lit chrome stand distracts for the beautifully lit mic shield.', '2003-10-20 09:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(455826, 42161, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nice hi lite portrait tightly cropped to advantage.</td>', 'Nice hi lite portrait tightly cropped to advantage.', '2003-10-20 09:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(455828, 42947, 7485, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I particularly like the contrast between the hard metal and the soft cat. But the green cast is distracting, warmer brown/orange or less color would have been better.</td>', 'Nice composition, I particularly like the contrast between the hard metal and the soft cat. But the green cast is distracting, warmer brown/orange or less color would have been better.', '2003-10-20 09:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(455829, 42925, 11570, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is surreal - where is that incredible "floor".<br/> <br/>The compostion is very busy, I would like to think that there are other views that might have worked better.  A crop does not seem to give much but good all the same.</td>', 'Wow, that is surreal - where is that incredible "floor". The compostion is very busy, I would like to think that there are other views that might have worked better.  A crop does not seem to give much but good all the same.', '2003-10-20 09:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(455831, 43012, 11570, '<td valign="top">A smile maker here.<br/> <br/>Nicely setup and done and a very interesting take on the Challenge</td>', 'A smile maker here. Nicely setup and done and a very interesting take on the Challenge', '2003-10-20 09:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(455833, 42700, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good pose, great underwear, and lovely hand-tinted-like color. The lighting is fine, but not really the key element. Great photo all the same!</td>', 'Good pose, great underwear, and lovely hand-tinted-like color. The lighting is fine, but not really the key element. Great photo all the same!', '2003-10-20 09:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(455834, 42954, 11570, '<td valign="top">Now there is a judgement call - just when to take the picture that best expresses the mood.<br/> <br/>Nicely seen and exposed.</td>', 'Now there is a judgement call - just when to take the picture that best expresses the mood. Nicely seen and exposed.', '2003-10-20 09:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455838, 42759, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the devil is in the details: feather isn''t sharp enough, shadow isn''t dark enough, composition is too forced (with both feather and shadow just touching the same edge of the frame)</td>', 'Good idea, but the devil is in the details: feather isn''t sharp enough, shadow isn''t dark enough, composition is too forced (with both feather and shadow just touching the same edge of the frame)', '2003-10-20 09:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(455839, 42666, 11155, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Focus is just right and the lighting is prefectly moody.  This is the first image I''ve looked at, but I think this is a winner.  Love the background, too.  Good luck!</td>', 'Love this.  Focus is just right and the lighting is prefectly moody.  This is the first image I''ve looked at, but I think this is a winner.  Love the background, too.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 09:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(455841, 42286, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and lighting.  This image could easily grace the cover of a magazine.  Background is great too.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful color and lighting.  This image could easily grace the cover of a magazine.  Background is great too.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 09:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(455842, 42948, 11570, '<td valign="top">Well seen but IMO you should have removed the coats from the left hand wall.<br/> <br/>But I like the idea and the exposure etc is good.  Looks like a high ISO number because of the noise.</td>', 'Well seen but IMO you should have removed the coats from the left hand wall. But I like the idea and the exposure etc is good.  Looks like a high ISO number because of the noise.', '2003-10-20 09:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(455843, 42719, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose and composition. Just a little more light on her right eye and a little less on her cheek and back would have made it a great photo.</td>', 'Excellent pose and composition. Just a little more light on her right eye and a little less on her cheek and back would have made it a great photo.', '2003-10-20 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(455844, 42814, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, light and composition !</td>', 'Beautiful color, light and composition !', '2003-10-20 09:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(455845, 42984, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but too much light in the background distracts from the flame</td>', 'Good idea, but too much light in the background distracts from the flame', '2003-10-20 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(455846, 42607, 92, '<td valign="top">Great use of thirds. The color and time work well together. Finally a photo that doesn''t need a title to save it !</td>', 'Great use of thirds. The color and time work well together. Finally a photo that doesn''t need a title to save it !', '2003-10-20 09:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(455848, 42981, 7485, '<td valign="top">Composition would be much better if you cropped off all the distracting stuff in the bottom third</td>', 'Composition would be much better if you cropped off all the distracting stuff in the bottom third', '2003-10-20 09:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(455849, 42743, 11155, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.  Lighting on the vehicle is nicely highlighted - I like that it is almost a "spotlight" effect.  Nice patterns on the bricks as well.</td>', 'Very cool image.  Lighting on the vehicle is nicely highlighted - I like that it is almost a "spotlight" effect.  Nice patterns on the bricks as well.', '2003-10-20 09:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(455850, 42925, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors. Perfect exposure. Looks like a scene from the movie "Tron" with the neon grids. The autumn colors are great when accented with the blue hue. Very cool shot.</td>', 'Very nice colors. Perfect exposure. Looks like a scene from the movie "Tron" with the neon grids. The autumn colors are great when accented with the blue hue. Very cool shot.', '2003-10-20 09:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(455851, 42991, 472, '<td valign="top">my opinion : would have been more effective with water in the glasses</td>', 'my opinion : would have been more effective with water in the glasses', '2003-10-20 09:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(455852, 42788, 92, '<td valign="top">This is my fav so far. The lighting is perfect and not over blown. The simple frame works great ! VERY nice ! 10</td>', 'This is my fav so far. The lighting is perfect and not over blown. The simple frame works great ! VERY nice ! 10', '2003-10-20 09:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(455853, 42693, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful exposure.  Be sure to post details about this shot after the challenge.  Would love to know what the structure is (fancy outhouse?), exposure time, settings, etc.  Very moody, in my opinion.</td>', 'Wonderful exposure.  Be sure to post details about this shot after the challenge.  Would love to know what the structure is (fancy outhouse?), exposure time, settings, etc.  Very moody, in my opinion.', '2003-10-20 09:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(455854, 42947, 92, '<td valign="top">This is just too cute. My only issue with it, which I''m sure you will/or have heard is the white blowout on the shade. I know it''s hard to reshoot and catch a moment such as this but maybe try to crop out the top area.</td>', 'This is just too cute. My only issue with it, which I''m sure you will/or have heard is the white blowout on the shade. I know it''s hard to reshoot and catch a moment such as this but maybe try to crop out the top area.', '2003-10-20 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(455855, 43002, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich color. The only flaw I see is the white area where the handle meets the vase. I love the compostion of this !</td>', 'Beautiful rich color. The only flaw I see is the white area where the handle meets the vase. I love the compostion of this !', '2003-10-20 09:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(455856, 42434, 10084, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful sunrise/sunset.  Great colors in the sky. The fluffy clouds really help to add interest to the shot.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful sunrise/sunset.  Great colors in the sky. The fluffy clouds really help to add interest to the shot.', '2003-10-20 09:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(455859, 42815, 92, '<td valign="top">Superb ! I love the color and back light !</td>', 'Superb ! I love the color and back light !', '2003-10-20 09:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(455860, 42871, 11155, '<td valign="top">Very moody lighting - sort of spacey, I like!  Be sure to post what this structure is after the challenge!  It''s pretty cool!  Good luck!</td>', 'Very moody lighting - sort of spacey, I like!  Be sure to post what this structure is after the challenge!  It''s pretty cool!  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 09:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(455862, 42993, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting to emphasize the texture.  Well done.</td>', 'Great use of lighting to emphasize the texture.  Well done.', '2003-10-20 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(455863, 42884, 92, '<td valign="top">just...WOW !<br/>This is one of the best night photos I''ve seen in a long time. The lighting does make the photo. The reflections and angle/composition are perfect ! 10</td>', 'just...WOW !This is one of the best night photos I''ve seen in a long time. The lighting does make the photo. The reflections and angle/composition are perfect ! 10', '2003-10-20 09:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(455864, 42948, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  At first I thought the blowdryer cord was a distraction, but I think it adds to the scene of being in a bathroom.  This has almost a Close Encounters type of feel to it.  Creepy ind intriguing at the same time.  God luck!</td>', 'Great concept.  At first I thought the blowdryer cord was a distraction, but I think it adds to the scene of being in a bathroom.  This has almost a Close Encounters type of feel to it.  Creepy ind intriguing at the same time.  God luck!', '2003-10-20 09:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(455865, 42958, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice job creating the silhouette.  Sometimes in longer exposures, it''s hard to conceal the face etc.  The red light and Rage title work well together.  Very creepy.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice job creating the silhouette.  Sometimes in longer exposures, it''s hard to conceal the face etc.  The red light and Rage title work well together.  Very creepy.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 09:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(455866, 42922, 11155, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Looks very peaceful/relaxing.  I like the fact that this is natural, rather than composed or manipulated lighting.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice.  Looks very peaceful/relaxing.  I like the fact that this is natural, rather than composed or manipulated lighting.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 09:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455867, 42485, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color.  Perhaps a bit overshaprened as the subject and leaves look a little jagged.  Would prefer to have a clearer view of the head (it sort of blends in with the dark area at the top), even if it meant losing some of the legs...  Overall, wonderful image, just a few nitpicks is all.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful color.  Perhaps a bit overshaprened as the subject and leaves look a little jagged.  Would prefer to have a clearer view of the head (it sort of blends in with the dark area at the top), even if it meant losing some of the legs...  Overall, wonderful image, just a few nitpicks is all.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 10:00:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(455868, 43002, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and texture.  Background is great too.  I like that you picked a different perspective, but not sure the 45 degree angle thing works for me...  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and texture.  Background is great too.  I like that you picked a different perspective, but not sure the 45 degree angle thing works for me...  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 10:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(455870, 42925, 11155, '<td valign="top">What the...  Looks like something out of TRON.  Very cool!  Be sure to post your details after the challenge!  This is a great photo.  I like the human element that you included.</td>', 'What the...  Looks like something out of TRON.  Very cool!  Be sure to post your details after the challenge!  This is a great photo.  I like the human element that you included.', '2003-10-20 10:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(455873, 42954, 2223, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love the symetry of this. Great job! 10</td>', 'Great capture. I love the symetry of this. Great job! 10', '2003-10-20 10:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(455874, 42969, 8130, '<td valign="top">I''m predicting a winner here!  10</td>', 'I''m predicting a winner here!  10', '2003-10-20 10:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(455876, 42600, 11155, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow on the left of the face.  Well lit - very subtle.  Reflection on nose is a bit of a distraction, but not much.  Attractive subject and a moody feel to this.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the shadow on the left of the face.  Well lit - very subtle.  Reflection on nose is a bit of a distraction, but not much.  Attractive subject and a moody feel to this.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 10:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(455878, 42916, 2223, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better in the ''All Alone'' challenge.</td>', 'This would have worked better in the ''All Alone'' challenge.', '2003-10-20 10:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(455879, 42916, 8522, '<td valign="top">Is this in the wrong challenge? How has light really set the mood here? 2</td>', 'Is this in the wrong challenge? How has light really set the mood here? 2', '2003-10-20 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(455883, 42185, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like this! The grass in the foreground really adds a nice layer dimension to the shot, the water/reflection is nicely still, the fog really adds the atmosphere. It definiately captures the early morning light/feel. Dare I say it''s a shame about the background? I like the tall structure, esp as the top is lost to the fog, the rest with the power lines and the industrial factory is not something you usually see in a very moody and pretty shot like this, but for the exact reason that''s what makes it different.</td>', 'I like this! The grass in the foreground really adds a nice layer dimension to the shot, the water/reflection is nicely still, the fog really adds the atmosphere. It definiately captures the early morning light/feel. Dare I say it''s a shame about the background? I like the tall structure, esp as the top is lost to the fog, the rest with the power lines and the industrial factory is not something you usually see in a very moody and pretty shot like this, but for the exact reason that''s what makes it different.', '2003-10-20 10:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(455897, 42969, 7687, '<td valign="top">Patience must be a virtue you have in abundance, either that or luck :).  I feel that the silhouette of the deer and trees are emphasized by the muted use of color.  They aren''t the normal "in your face" sunset colors, they''re very subtle...beautiful.  This is a fantastic shot and I hope it wins!</td>', 'Patience must be a virtue you have in abundance, either that or luck :).  I feel that the silhouette of the deer and trees are emphasized by the muted use of color.  They aren''t the normal "in your face" sunset colors, they''re very subtle...beautiful.  This is a fantastic shot and I hope it wins!', '2003-10-20 10:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(455901, 42992, 7687, '<td valign="top">Although this angle is a rather typical one, I feel that it captures the essence of the bridge quite nicely.  The exposure on the road/walkway as well as the bridge itself is superb, and the colors, just enough to add another facet to the image without overpowering it.  Wonderful job.</td>', 'Although this angle is a rather typical one, I feel that it captures the essence of the bridge quite nicely.  The exposure on the road/walkway as well as the bridge itself is superb, and the colors, just enough to add another facet to the image without overpowering it.  Wonderful job.', '2003-10-20 10:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(455904, 42921, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Love the subject placement.  Very moody and timely!  Good luck!</td>', 'Great image.  Love the subject placement.  Very moody and timely!  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 10:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(455905, 42558, 7687, '<td valign="top">This image stands out for me.  The reason it stands out has to do with the mans nose being the only part of him that is lit.  The vortex, to me, is a neutral entity in the image, while the man adds a powerful dynamic, both in silhouette and in a tiny part of him being lit.  Very interesting image, I like it!</td>', 'This image stands out for me.  The reason it stands out has to do with the mans nose being the only part of him that is lit.  The vortex, to me, is a neutral entity in the image, while the man adds a powerful dynamic, both in silhouette and in a tiny part of him being lit.  Very interesting image, I like it!', '2003-10-20 10:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(455906, 42743, 7687, '<td valign="top">I love the graphic quality to this shot.  I could see it being a poster for the Volkswagen company.  Black and white was obviously the correct choice and the negative space at the bottom gives this image a wonderfully strong anchor upon which to feature the car.  Excellent job.</td>', 'I love the graphic quality to this shot.  I could see it being a poster for the Volkswagen company.  Black and white was obviously the correct choice and the negative space at the bottom gives this image a wonderfully strong anchor upon which to feature the car.  Excellent job.', '2003-10-20 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(455908, 42550, 11155, '<td valign="top">I''m not clear on the meaning of this photo in regards to the title.  Some interesting blues and reds, but really just looks like a cluttered desk to me.</td>', 'I''m not clear on the meaning of this photo in regards to the title.  Some interesting blues and reds, but really just looks like a cluttered desk to me.', '2003-10-20 10:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(455910, 42325, 11155, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t titled this, I wouldn''t have guessed.  Cool abstract and color, but the image is really too small to see well.</td>', 'If you hadn''t titled this, I wouldn''t have guessed.  Cool abstract and color, but the image is really too small to see well.', '2003-10-20 10:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(455911, 42946, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very simple yet effective. The blue glow is very appealing. The slight opening between the blinds is almost teasing, trying to see what''s out there.</td>', 'Very simple yet effective. The blue glow is very appealing. The slight opening between the blinds is almost teasing, trying to see what''s out there.', '2003-10-20 10:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(455912, 42840, 11155, '<td valign="top">Love the candles, but there seems to be some sort of structure in the middle obscuring a couple of them.  Lighting and mood is very nice here, I just wish that obstruction wasn''t there.</td>', 'Love the candles, but there seems to be some sort of structure in the middle obscuring a couple of them.  Lighting and mood is very nice here, I just wish that obstruction wasn''t there.', '2003-10-20 11:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(455914, 42815, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great!  I''ve been considering a hot like this for some time now - you did a great job with the colors and silhouettes.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great!  I''ve been considering a hot like this for some time now - you did a great job with the colors and silhouettes.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 11:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(455915, 42759, 11155, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrasts.  Great setup - I imagine this took some time.  Very creative.</td>', 'Awesome contrasts.  Great setup - I imagine this took some time.  Very creative.', '2003-10-20 11:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455916, 42607, 7687, '<td valign="top">I''m diggin'' the shadow off to the upper left hand corner and the reflection off to the right.  The color is perfect for this shot as well as the lighting.  It reminds me of a clock on a nightstand with the moon shining in through the window...which I''m sure you were shooting for (I hope :-) ).  Nice work.</td>', 'I''m diggin'' the shadow off to the upper left hand corner and the reflection off to the right.  The color is perfect for this shot as well as the lighting.  It reminds me of a clock on a nightstand with the moon shining in through the window...which I''m sure you were shooting for (I hope :-) ).  Nice work.', '2003-10-20 11:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(455917, 42969, 2223, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!! I love the sillouette of the trees against the soft gradient sky. The deer is a perfect addition. Good luck. 10</td>', 'AWESOME!! I love the sillouette of the trees against the soft gradient sky. The deer is a perfect addition. Good luck. 10', '2003-10-20 11:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(455919, 42884, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very clear image, the water is good, the soft reflection is a nice touch. The glow of the lights on the bridge is a good highlight, and the shadows at the top contrast nicely. The ''star'' lights are minimal enough to add something and not distract. Compositionally it''s good. A well-executed bridge at night shot.</td>', 'Very clear image, the water is good, the soft reflection is a nice touch. The glow of the lights on the bridge is a good highlight, and the shadows at the top contrast nicely. The ''star'' lights are minimal enough to add something and not distract. Compositionally it''s good. A well-executed bridge at night shot.', '2003-10-20 11:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(455920, 42842, 11155, '<td valign="top">Sort of a busy image for me.  I do like the motion blur and the expression on the blonde haired woman, but too many distracting things in the image, liek the orange parachute thingy at the top.</td>', 'Sort of a busy image for me.  I do like the motion blur and the expression on the blonde haired woman, but too many distracting things in the image, liek the orange parachute thingy at the top.', '2003-10-20 11:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(455921, 42907, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I would have liked to have seen a black background.  Fairly simplistic.</td>', 'Nice image, but I would have liked to have seen a black background.  Fairly simplistic.', '2003-10-20 11:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(455922, 42918, 11155, '<td valign="top">Very crisp image.  I especially like the tree on the right and the flare.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very crisp image.  I especially like the tree on the right and the flare.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 11:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(455923, 42815, 6008, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s the mix of colors and light, but I really like this. The tone is good, it sets the mood perfectly, my own personal experience also enhances this as it''s a sight I''m use to seeing and thus in my mind I see this as a slice of the bigger bar. I could see this as both a print hanging on a wall and used in advertising. A very pretty shot.</td>', 'Maybe it''s the mix of colors and light, but I really like this. The tone is good, it sets the mood perfectly, my own personal experience also enhances this as it''s a sight I''m use to seeing and thus in my mind I see this as a slice of the bigger bar. I could see this as both a print hanging on a wall and used in advertising. A very pretty shot.', '2003-10-20 11:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(455924, 42950, 12733, '<td valign="top">I especially like the catch lights on her hair.</td>', 'I especially like the catch lights on her hair.', '2003-10-20 11:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(455925, 42918, 6008, '<td valign="top">The trees are very sharp and contrast nicely against the blue sky. The ground is not just the usual straight line so it holds some interest as well, esp as it seems to dip just below the sun as it breaks through the clouds. The three shafts or light flare, which in other shots can be annoying actually works very well in this image. The mood is set and it''s a very uplifting photograph. Nicely spotted and taken.</td>', 'The trees are very sharp and contrast nicely against the blue sky. The ground is not just the usual straight line so it holds some interest as well, esp as it seems to dip just below the sun as it breaks through the clouds. The three shafts or light flare, which in other shots can be annoying actually works very well in this image. The mood is set and it''s a very uplifting photograph. Nicely spotted and taken.', '2003-10-20 11:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(455926, 42840, 7687, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept, I especially like the way you have the candles burned down to the point where we aren''t being overpowered by having to look at the flames.  <br/> <br/>A couple of suggestions if I may?  I wonder how this would look with candles of uniform size and shape, rather than different heights and types?  The translucent candles (lighter colored ones) seem to be transmitting the light through the wax much better than the darker/thicker candles do.  The candle holder in the middle is covering up the candles in the back, which helps block the flames, and that''s good, it kind of breaks up the continuity of the image.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps,<br/>Quad</td>', 'This is a great concept, I especially like the way you have the candles burned down to the point where we aren''t being overpowered by having to look at the flames.   A couple of suggestions if I may?  I wonder how this would look with candles of uniform size and shape, rather than different heights and types?  The translucent candles (lighter colored ones) seem to be transmitting the light through the wax much better than the darker/thicker candles do.  The candle holder in the middle is covering up the candles in the back, which helps block the flames, and that''s good, it kind of breaks up the continuity of the image. I hope this helps,Quad', '2003-10-20 11:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(455927, 42946, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and shadows.  The blue light is very cool (no pun intended).<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Nice lighting and shadows.  The blue light is very cool (no pun intended).Good luck!', '2003-10-20 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(455928, 42815, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the lights and the transluscent colored liquids.</td>', 'Nice capture of the lights and the transluscent colored liquids.', '2003-10-20 11:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(455929, 42969, 11155, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful capture.  Colors on the horizon are great.  Silhouettes are awesome.  Must have been hard to carry that deer statue and place it there (just kidding).  Good luck!</td>', 'What a wonderful capture.  Colors on the horizon are great.  Silhouettes are awesome.  Must have been hard to carry that deer statue and place it there (just kidding).  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 11:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(455930, 42816, 7687, '<td valign="top">I like how it appears as if you''re shooting with a film camera.  I''m not sure I like the flash going off though.  It is absolutely screaming at me and makes it hard for me to look at the rest of the image.</td>', 'I like how it appears as if you''re shooting with a film camera.  I''m not sure I like the flash going off though.  It is absolutely screaming at me and makes it hard for me to look at the rest of the image.', '2003-10-20 11:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(455931, 42483, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a fan of the big blurry sun in a picture, but I think in this particular image it works well, and without it I dont think it would have had the same impact. The tone is wonderful, the fact that you can see the details in the surrounding environment is great, it looks perfectly exposed. The silver-like reflection of the sand is good. I also like that they are in silhouette so that you dont have to spend too long looking at the detail of them but just enjoy the entire scene. The lighting certainly sets the mood here, and the title reflects that mood well.</td>', 'I''m not usually a fan of the big blurry sun in a picture, but I think in this particular image it works well, and without it I dont think it would have had the same impact. The tone is wonderful, the fact that you can see the details in the surrounding environment is great, it looks perfectly exposed. The silver-like reflection of the sand is good. I also like that they are in silhouette so that you dont have to spend too long looking at the detail of them but just enjoy the entire scene. The lighting certainly sets the mood here, and the title reflects that mood well.', '2003-10-20 11:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(455933, 42607, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and shadow.  I especially like the blue color - works great with the title.</td>', 'Nice colors and shadow.  I especially like the blue color - works great with the title.', '2003-10-20 11:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(455934, 42989, 11155, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Almost a fashion style shot, but the lighting is dramatic and creates a nice texture on the jacket.  Great pose, too.  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Almost a fashion style shot, but the lighting is dramatic and creates a nice texture on the jacket.  Great pose, too.  Good luck!', '2003-10-20 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(455935, 42876, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but the lighting is a bit too subtle.  Looks a little overshaprened as well.  A wonderful Autumn image.  Subject is well placed.</td>', 'Great colors, but the lighting is a bit too subtle.  Looks a little overshaprened as well.  A wonderful Autumn image.  Subject is well placed.', '2003-10-20 11:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(455936, 42372, 7687, '<td valign="top">I like how the fence stays lit, while the road has a shadow on it.  I guess I''m not quite sure what type of mood you''re trying to convey with the lighting in this shot.</td>', 'I like how the fence stays lit, while the road has a shadow on it.  I guess I''m not quite sure what type of mood you''re trying to convey with the lighting in this shot.', '2003-10-20 11:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(455937, 42839, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has such a wonderfully soft feel to it. The texture and light of the leaves is amazing. It also seems very sharp where it needs to be, and the shadows enhance the lighting wonderfully. The one negative thing that does stand out is the highlight in the lower right that seems to be a little too bright, but it doesnt pull away from the enjoyment of the photograph. Nicely shot.</td>', 'This has such a wonderfully soft feel to it. The texture and light of the leaves is amazing. It also seems very sharp where it needs to be, and the shadows enhance the lighting wonderfully. The one negative thing that does stand out is the highlight in the lower right that seems to be a little too bright, but it doesnt pull away from the enjoyment of the photograph. Nicely shot.', '2003-10-20 11:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455938, 43011, 11155, '<td valign="top">Subject isn''t very interesting to me and the fact that it is dead center takes away from it.  Perhaps shooting from a different angle would have made this more appealing.  Some fairly interesting wrinkles in the material - so I think you are on to something here, but just not interesting enough, at least for me.</td>', 'Subject isn''t very interesting to me and the fact that it is dead center takes away from it.  Perhaps shooting from a different angle would have made this more appealing.  Some fairly interesting wrinkles in the material - so I think you are on to something here, but just not interesting enough, at least for me.', '2003-10-20 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(455939, 42954, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very breathtaking! The title sums up this photograph pretty well. It certainly sets a mood. Slighly over dark on the right, but nothing too horrid, the water and its reflection is good. Well captured!</td>', 'Very breathtaking! The title sums up this photograph pretty well. It certainly sets a mood. Slighly over dark on the right, but nothing too horrid, the water and its reflection is good. Well captured!', '2003-10-20 11:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(455940, 42519, 8522, '<td valign="top">A great picture, almost amazing.<br/>I really wish that the plane was flying INTO the negative space, rather than out of it. Then it would be a sure winner and one of my favourite pictures on the site. However, because it is flying away from the negative space, score: 7<br/>Fantastic sillhouette, great colours, good use of light. I love the propellers.</td>', 'A great picture, almost amazing.I really wish that the plane was flying INTO the negative space, rather than out of it. Then it would be a sure winner and one of my favourite pictures on the site. However, because it is flying away from the negative space, score: 7Fantastic sillhouette, great colours, good use of light. I love the propellers.', '2003-10-20 11:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(455941, 42685, 11738, '<td valign="top">The grainyness works for this shot.  I also like the off-center subject.  Too bad the light source was so high.  I would have preferred seeing the light coming from a bit lower and more to the right to see a more pronounced shadow cast on the wall to the left.  Please tell your model that she looks nice, quite nice ;)</td>', 'The grainyness works for this shot.  I also like the off-center subject.  Too bad the light source was so high.  I would have preferred seeing the light coming from a bit lower and more to the right to see a more pronounced shadow cast on the wall to the left.  Please tell your model that she looks nice, quite nice ;)', '2003-10-20 11:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(455942, 42855, 6008, '<td valign="top">The orange/golden tones of the sunset is great. Both the sunset enhances the silhouettes and the silhouettes enhance the sunset. Power lines are not a usual setting for a sunset shot but it works. Nicely captured.</td>', 'The orange/golden tones of the sunset is great. Both the sunset enhances the silhouettes and the silhouettes enhance the sunset. Power lines are not a usual setting for a sunset shot but it works. Nicely captured.', '2003-10-20 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(455943, 43009, 11155, '<td valign="top">One of the better "plane" photos I''ve seen.  I can''t decide whether the flag is a nice touch or distracting, same as the contrail.  I like the sun behind the nose.  To me, this is a fun, colorful image.  Well done.</td>', 'One of the better "plane" photos I''ve seen.  I can''t decide whether the flag is a nice touch or distracting, same as the contrail.  I like the sun behind the nose.  To me, this is a fun, colorful image.  Well done.', '2003-10-20 11:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(455945, 42948, 11738, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... this looks familiar.  Sitting on the john?  Gotta love multi-tasking :P</td>', 'Hmmm... this looks familiar.  Sitting on the john?  Gotta love multi-tasking :P', '2003-10-20 11:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(455946, 42882, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful and scenic. The warm tones are nice, the stillness of the water is good, the way it fades into shadow is also appealing. It''s a subtle sunset, but has the sun flares that make it stand out a little more.</td>', 'Very peaceful and scenic. The warm tones are nice, the stillness of the water is good, the way it fades into shadow is also appealing. It''s a subtle sunset, but has the sun flares that make it stand out a little more.', '2003-10-20 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
