(455951, 42685, 11155, '<td valign="top">The shadows and grain of this make for a somewhat "noir" feel about it, at least to me.  I like the placement of the model, but the pose looks a little uncomfortable or stressful for her.</td>', 'The shadows and grain of this make for a somewhat "noir" feel about it, at least to me.  I like the placement of the model, but the pose looks a little uncomfortable or stressful for her.', '2003-10-20 11:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
