(455964, 42989, 11738, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  The redness behind the thumbnail takes away from this picture, even though I realize that the title is Crestfallen.  Coat lapel on model''s right side seems to be out of focus.  I like how you framed your subject.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Not bad.  The redness behind the thumbnail takes away from this picture, even though I realize that the title is Crestfallen.  Coat lapel on model''s right side seems to be out of focus.  I like how you framed your subject.  Good lighting.', '2003-10-20 11:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
