(455971, 42700, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, but the colours are too washed out.  There is also a definite green cast to the image that makes her look sickly and does not let us enjoy her beautiful hair.  The lingerie selected could have been better as well: looks like she''s growing mauve pubic hair.  The angle of her neck is exagerated, looks like she broke it.  I scored this picture lower for these factors, not for the fact that she isn''t wearing much.  This is a good idea, but I suggest you keep working at it.</td>', 'This is interesting, but the colours are too washed out.  There is also a definite green cast to the image that makes her look sickly and does not let us enjoy her beautiful hair.  The lingerie selected could have been better as well: looks like she''s growing mauve pubic hair.  The angle of her neck is exagerated, looks like she broke it.  I scored this picture lower for these factors, not for the fact that she isn''t wearing much.  This is a good idea, but I suggest you keep working at it.', '2003-10-20 11:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
