(456097, 42700, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:wow! what a pose! Fills the frame perfectly, love the grain (although many will prbably complain about it) and the desaturated look, exactly what I like in body shots.<br/>Bad Points: Whilst ribs sticking out isn''t nice - I knid of think it adds to the image, a bit kooki. The same goes for the creases in her neck. So I guess that''s not really a bad point at all.<br/>Overall Score: 10! (and looking forward to see who took it)</td>', 'Good Points:wow! what a pose! Fills the frame perfectly, love the grain (although many will prbably complain about it) and the desaturated look, exactly what I like in body shots.Bad Points: Whilst ribs sticking out isn''t nice - I knid of think it adds to the image, a bit kooki. The same goes for the creases in her neck. So I guess that''s not really a bad point at all.Overall Score: 10! (and looking forward to see who took it)', '2003-10-20 13:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
