(456112, 42921, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great Lighting, you''ve nailed this one. Ive never before seen a pumpkin with so much emotion and expression accross it ! Im almost refering to it here as a person - and the way you have shot this image WOW ! If theres only one thing that spoils it a little bit for me ( which no one can fix easily ) is that the Lid ( top of the pumpkin ) dosn''t quite line up to where it was before cutting it off, I know thats being pinky but... AWESOME PICTURE ! ( I dont normally tell people what I''m scoring them but this is a 10 ) ;0)</td>', 'Great Lighting, you''ve nailed this one. Ive never before seen a pumpkin with so much emotion and expression accross it ! Im almost refering to it here as a person - and the way you have shot this image WOW ! If theres only one thing that spoils it a little bit for me ( which no one can fix easily ) is that the Lid ( top of the pumpkin ) dosn''t quite line up to where it was before cutting it off, I know thats being pinky but... AWESOME PICTURE ! ( I dont normally tell people what I''m scoring them but this is a 10 ) ;0)', '2003-10-20 14:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
