(456146, 42993, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the title..lol. Very interesting subject, so different. I like this. Nice color.</td>', 'Love the title..lol. Very interesting subject, so different. I like this. Nice color.', '2003-10-20 14:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(456147, 42805, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.</td>', 'Love this shot.', '2003-10-20 14:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(456151, 42916, 772, '<td valign="top">I think your camera missed the focus point on this one.  The boy is a bit soft while the rocks in the background are in focus.  You can overcome that by prefocusing with your subject in the center of the frame, then recompose the shot before pressing the button the rest of the way.  I''m struggling to understand the reasoning for the selective color in this photo.  It does help, somewhat, draw my attention to the boy, because the overall scene has a lot of high contrast.</td>', 'I think your camera missed the focus point on this one.  The boy is a bit soft while the rocks in the background are in focus.  You can overcome that by prefocusing with your subject in the center of the frame, then recompose the shot before pressing the button the rest of the way.  I''m struggling to understand the reasoning for the selective color in this photo.  It does help, somewhat, draw my attention to the boy, because the overall scene has a lot of high contrast.', '2003-10-20 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(456153, 42537, 10869, '<td valign="top">the small bubbles in the glass are a bit too distracting; nice colors though</td>', 'the small bubbles in the glass are a bit too distracting; nice colors though', '2003-10-20 14:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(456154, 42800, 675, '<td valign="top">seek help</td>', 'seek help', '2003-10-20 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(456180, 42161, 12049, '<td valign="top">Overexposed unfortunately, unless of course you were going for a ''high key'' portrait. If not, this can be easily corrected in post-processing.</td>', 'Overexposed unfortunately, unless of course you were going for a ''high key'' portrait. If not, this can be easily corrected in post-processing.', '2003-10-20 15:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(456184, 42952, 12049, '<td valign="top">A well executed shot, though I get a feeling that there must be loads of detail  and texture in the girl''s clothing. Maybe a little more light on the figure (but not too much) would be an interesting alternative?</td>', 'A well executed shot, though I get a feeling that there must be loads of detail  and texture in the girl''s clothing. Maybe a little more light on the figure (but not too much) would be an interesting alternative?', '2003-10-20 15:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(456185, 42855, 12049, '<td valign="top">You''ve unfortunately been a victim of flare here. Even though it''s ''de rigeur'' these days, it doesn''t really help your shot. The colors are wonderful though, but the horizon isn''t very attractive. With these great conditions, another vantage point may have given you a better composition.</td>', 'You''ve unfortunately been a victim of flare here. Even though it''s ''de rigeur'' these days, it doesn''t really help your shot. The colors are wonderful though, but the horizon isn''t very attractive. With these great conditions, another vantage point may have given you a better composition.', '2003-10-20 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(456188, 42383, 12049, '<td valign="top">Very much in the mould of Edward Hopper. I think you could probably crop off part of the bottom where there''s no detail and not lose any compositional value. Maybe a bit more sharpness in the lighthouse to bring out more detail (which should be available given the side lighting) would be good as well.</td>', 'Very much in the mould of Edward Hopper. I think you could probably crop off part of the bottom where there''s no detail and not lose any compositional value. Maybe a bit more sharpness in the lighthouse to bring out more detail (which should be available given the side lighting) would be good as well.', '2003-10-20 15:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(456210, 42884, 9906, '<td valign="top">Why can''t I get my night shots to look like this?  I need a better camera UGGHH!  Beautiful shot!  Love the focus and detail!</td>', 'Why can''t I get my night shots to look like this?  I need a better camera UGGHH!  Beautiful shot!  Love the focus and detail!', '2003-10-20 16:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
