(456805, 42591, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice work; the light through the leaves and opposing patterns are great here.   I think it might be interesting to try it without the right non-translucent side; whereas the overall pattern makes a nice picture, the dynamics are strong enough on the left.</td>', 'Nice work; the light through the leaves and opposing patterns are great here.   I think it might be interesting to try it without the right non-translucent side; whereas the overall pattern makes a nice picture, the dynamics are strong enough on the left.', '2003-10-21 13:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
