(456875, 42770, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the colour of the pumpkin, and the black background.  IMHO the border doesn''t work well with the picture :)  The top right and bottom left corners also could be cropped, maybe the picture could be a rectangle (1/3 background, 2/3 pumpkin)?  Something to try.  Gave it a 4</td>', 'I like the colour of the pumpkin, and the black background.  IMHO the border doesn''t work well with the picture :)  The top right and bottom left corners also could be cropped, maybe the picture could be a rectangle (1/3 background, 2/3 pumpkin)?  Something to try.  Gave it a 4', '2003-10-21 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(456881, 43009, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image, particularly the juxtoposition of the plane trail in the sky behind the grounded plane.  Use of light is great, diffuses through the flag nicely adding a great bright bit of color.  Nice focus.  The plane does seem to hover between a bit too dark and just right, but I don''t think its a huge issue.  7</td>', 'I like the composition of this image, particularly the juxtoposition of the plane trail in the sky behind the grounded plane.  Use of light is great, diffuses through the flag nicely adding a great bright bit of color.  Nice focus.  The plane does seem to hover between a bit too dark and just right, but I don''t think its a huge issue.  7', '2003-10-21 14:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(456886, 42916, 3102, '<td valign="top">This photo should be DQ''d immediately!  It''s obviously impossible to achieve this effect legally!  Just kidding... calm down... I just thought it would be fun to ruffle your feathers based on what I was reading in the forums :)</td>', 'This photo should be DQ''d immediately!  It''s obviously impossible to achieve this effect legally!  Just kidding... calm down... I just thought it would be fun to ruffle your feathers based on what I was reading in the forums :)', '2003-10-21 14:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(456887, 43016, 11923, '<td valign="top">The sunlight lights this beauty up well.  I really like the cloud reflections on the hood.  I think the subject is good, and the lighting is good, but I do find the composition a little flat, perhaps its the angle, wonder how it would look straight on at the headlights and grill - just a personal preference though.  The people reflections are a little distracting but those could be fixed post challenge.  Nice solid shot.  7</td>', 'The sunlight lights this beauty up well.  I really like the cloud reflections on the hood.  I think the subject is good, and the lighting is good, but I do find the composition a little flat, perhaps its the angle, wonder how it would look straight on at the headlights and grill - just a personal preference though.  The people reflections are a little distracting but those could be fixed post challenge.  Nice solid shot.  7', '2003-10-21 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(456890, 42893, 11923, '<td valign="top">Though I do think that shadows and light are separated by the thinnest line imaginable, your title brings me to the conclusion that the focus is on the shadow, not the lighting (I could be wrong).  I like the concept over all, the lighting is good for getting what you were going for, but because the shadow is central, I''d prefer it to either be a recognizable shape, or have an inherent oddity to it that grabs the attention.  This didn''t work for me, but I''ve tried capturing shadows and it was dang hard so I gave a 6 for the fine effort and vision.</td>', 'Though I do think that shadows and light are separated by the thinnest line imaginable, your title brings me to the conclusion that the focus is on the shadow, not the lighting (I could be wrong).  I like the concept over all, the lighting is good for getting what you were going for, but because the shadow is central, I''d prefer it to either be a recognizable shape, or have an inherent oddity to it that grabs the attention.  This didn''t work for me, but I''ve tried capturing shadows and it was dang hard so I gave a 6 for the fine effort and vision.', '2003-10-21 15:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(456901, 42916, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  The background is beautiful, well focused.  The boy is in a nice pose, he looks rather lonely, I like the b&amp;w choice and leaving the shirt colored gives just the right amount of color pop.  I''m finding a bit of soft focus on the child though, who I think should be completely in focus since he is a major part of the scene.  A thoroughly lovely photo.  All that said, with the lighting looking pretty evenly distributed, I don''t know how much of it is really affecting the mood (as mentioned in challenge details), most of the mood seems to be from the posing of the boy.  When I first saw this I wasn''t sure if it was put in the right challenge, but I''m going to guess it was submitted on purpose.  I knocked off a point because though the lighting works well in the photo I didn''t see how it created the mood, I think its a fantastic image though.  9</td>', 'This is a great photo.  The background is beautiful, well focused.  The boy is in a nice pose, he looks rather lonely, I like the b&w choice and leaving the shirt colored gives just the right amount of color pop.  I''m finding a bit of soft focus on the child though, who I think should be completely in focus since he is a major part of the scene.  A thoroughly lovely photo.  All that said, with the lighting looking pretty evenly distributed, I don''t know how much of it is really affecting the mood (as mentioned in challenge details), most of the mood seems to be from the posing of the boy.  When I first saw this I wasn''t sure if it was put in the right challenge, but I''m going to guess it was submitted on purpose.  I knocked off a point because though the lighting works well in the photo I didn''t see how it created the mood, I think its a fantastic image though.  9', '2003-10-21 15:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(456906, 42952, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I like the simplicity of the lines and the two color usage.  Lighting is great, though I think trying it backlit directly behind (from this view) the girl might be worth a shot.  The reason I say that is she starts to slightly blend into the shadows on the left, and I think her silhouette should be as sharp as possible.  Definately brings back memories of that great 80''s movie, Karate Kid.  :)  7</td>', 'Great image!  I like the simplicity of the lines and the two color usage.  Lighting is great, though I think trying it backlit directly behind (from this view) the girl might be worth a shot.  The reason I say that is she starts to slightly blend into the shadows on the left, and I think her silhouette should be as sharp as possible.  Definately brings back memories of that great 80''s movie, Karate Kid.  :)  7', '2003-10-21 15:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(456909, 42922, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I love the ray through the tree look, always adds a bit of magic to a scene.  This one is great because it gives a bit of a lonely road being transformed just a bit by beauty.  The cool blue &amp; greens in the horizon are wonderful, particularly with the lit up reds of the fallen leaves.  I would suggest a different title though - I think a title caps a piece and should enhance the image shown.  I wouldn''t take off points for that though so don''t worry!  Would like a smidge sharper image of the trees on the left.  Sound photo, great job! 7</td>', 'Nice image, I love the ray through the tree look, always adds a bit of magic to a scene.  This one is great because it gives a bit of a lonely road being transformed just a bit by beauty.  The cool blue & greens in the horizon are wonderful, particularly with the lit up reds of the fallen leaves.  I would suggest a different title though - I think a title caps a piece and should enhance the image shown.  I wouldn''t take off points for that though so don''t worry!  Would like a smidge sharper image of the trees on the left.  Sound photo, great job! 7', '2003-10-21 15:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(456912, 42672, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a keen perspective!  The lighting is great for this image, the feeling of a cave is kept as is the deliniation of where outside begins.  The focus looks like it could be sharper, and though the lighting is good, the glare on the wet ground is a little harsh.  I like the almost pseudo b&amp;w feel of this with inside the cave and low to no color vs outside with the vivid green.  Well done.  7</td>', 'What a keen perspective!  The lighting is great for this image, the feeling of a cave is kept as is the deliniation of where outside begins.  The focus looks like it could be sharper, and though the lighting is good, the glare on the wet ground is a little harsh.  I like the almost pseudo b&w feel of this with inside the cave and low to no color vs outside with the vivid green.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-21 15:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(456914, 42438, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the candlelight.</td>', 'Very nice use of the candlelight.', '2003-10-21 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(456917, 42666, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting. How do you get the variety of color - the various blue highlights in what looks like red lights.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting. How do you get the variety of color - the various blue highlights in what looks like red lights.', '2003-10-21 15:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(456919, 42904, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting. You get that one bright patch in the midst of shadow, and it makes your subject really stand out.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting. You get that one bright patch in the midst of shadow, and it makes your subject really stand out.', '2003-10-21 15:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(456920, 42677, 11923, '<td valign="top">I bet this one is a cutie.  I like the concept behind the image, but I think the close crop erases much of what is being described by the title and that lowers the interest factor for me.  I''d like to see more of the cat''s body and thus more of the rays its copping.  Focus is marvelous.  I''m flipflopping on whether the light in the eyes is good or bad, it gives a bit of spark but it also looks a little odd to me.  I think the subject works for the challenge and light usage is good.  6</td>', 'I bet this one is a cutie.  I like the concept behind the image, but I think the close crop erases much of what is being described by the title and that lowers the interest factor for me.  I''d like to see more of the cat''s body and thus more of the rays its copping.  Focus is marvelous.  I''m flipflopping on whether the light in the eyes is good or bad, it gives a bit of spark but it also looks a little odd to me.  I think the subject works for the challenge and light usage is good.  6', '2003-10-21 15:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(456921, 42770, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color, vivid just how I like it.  I like the offcenter positioning.  The very round aspect of the pumpkin draws my eyes in and keeps it there for the most part.  Black background really makes the color shine, excellent use of light.  My only distraction is that line of..glare? reflection? in the bottom left.  Very solid image.  8</td>', 'Gorgeous color, vivid just how I like it.  I like the offcenter positioning.  The very round aspect of the pumpkin draws my eyes in and keeps it there for the most part.  Black background really makes the color shine, excellent use of light.  My only distraction is that line of..glare? reflection? in the bottom left.  Very solid image.  8', '2003-10-21 15:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(456923, 42566, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting; that makes the picture.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting; that makes the picture.', '2003-10-21 15:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(456925, 42998, 11923, '<td valign="top">Mmm drool on the keyboard!  ;)   I like the set-up of this image, very realistic.  The use of light is excellent in my opinion, there isn''t that yellowy hue that I always get when shooting indoors, everything looks crisp with just the right amount of focus.  The colors are a little bland, but I don''t think that''s a big deal.  My only real change suggestion would be to somehow highlight the face just a bit so you can see his resting expression more clearly.  Very well done.  8</td>', 'Mmm drool on the keyboard!  ;)   I like the set-up of this image, very realistic.  The use of light is excellent in my opinion, there isn''t that yellowy hue that I always get when shooting indoors, everything looks crisp with just the right amount of focus.  The colors are a little bland, but I don''t think that''s a big deal.  My only real change suggestion would be to somehow highlight the face just a bit so you can see his resting expression more clearly.  Very well done.  8', '2003-10-21 15:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(456926, 42677, 12733, '<td valign="top">Fantastic closeup, and the lighting really brings out the detail.</td>', 'Fantastic closeup, and the lighting really brings out the detail.', '2003-10-21 15:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(456927, 43014, 12733, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light to pick out some details and hide others. A very mysterious looking shot.</td>', 'Excellent use of light to pick out some details and hide others. A very mysterious looking shot.', '2003-10-21 15:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(456928, 43014, 11923, '<td valign="top">Yikes, scary!  Great mood to this piece, I like the flesh on black tones.  Very dark subject and photo, I like how the head and hands seem to float in space so to speak.  I''m not sure if she''s wearing conacts, though the blurring around the eyes (particularly the right eye) makes me think something was manipulated.   I could be wrong. Would try for a little bit more focus on the face since her eyes are the arresting part of the image her face, to me, should be sharper.   This image really has a story and a mood behind it. 7</td>', 'Yikes, scary!  Great mood to this piece, I like the flesh on black tones.  Very dark subject and photo, I like how the head and hands seem to float in space so to speak.  I''m not sure if she''s wearing conacts, though the blurring around the eyes (particularly the right eye) makes me think something was manipulated.   I could be wrong. Would try for a little bit more focus on the face since her eyes are the arresting part of the image her face, to me, should be sharper.   This image really has a story and a mood behind it. 7', '2003-10-21 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(456930, 42672, 12733, '<td valign="top">A Picasso bear? The lighting and the subject create an interesting puzzle.</td>', 'A Picasso bear? The lighting and the subject create an interesting puzzle.', '2003-10-21 15:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(456932, 42871, 12733, '<td valign="top">Spectacular lighting - is it from the spotlights in the foreground? It seems to come from within the shapes - what are they?</td>', 'Spectacular lighting - is it from the spotlights in the foreground? It seems to come from within the shapes - what are they?', '2003-10-21 15:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(456938, 42921, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting for an object, but don''t Jack o''lanterns really cry out for interior lighting - possibly in addition to the outside  lighting that shows the shape.</td>', 'Interesting lighting for an object, but don''t Jack o''lanterns really cry out for interior lighting - possibly in addition to the outside  lighting that shows the shape.', '2003-10-21 15:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(456942, 42607, 12733, '<td valign="top">The light is great, but the shadows really make the picture.</td>', 'The light is great, but the shadows really make the picture.', '2003-10-21 15:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(456943, 42843, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice back lighting and highlights.</td>', 'Nice back lighting and highlights.', '2003-10-21 15:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(456950, 42960, 12733, '<td valign="top">Catching the reflections on glass is hard, and you did a really nice job. The window makes a nice background, but the view through it is very distracting.</td>', 'Catching the reflections on glass is hard, and you did a really nice job. The window makes a nice background, but the view through it is very distracting.', '2003-10-21 16:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(456953, 42993, 12733, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of light to bring out shape and texture. The lighting turns a mundane closeup of corn into an outstanding image.</td>', 'Fantastic use of light to bring out shape and texture. The lighting turns a mundane closeup of corn into an outstanding image.', '2003-10-21 16:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(456954, 42087, 12733, '<td valign="top">A good demonstration of how light and shadow can completely obscure an object''s shape.</td>', 'A good demonstration of how light and shadow can completely obscure an object''s shape.', '2003-10-21 16:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(456956, 42435, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting would be perfect if the distracting background could be dropped out.</td>', 'The lighting would be perfect if the distracting background could be dropped out.', '2003-10-21 16:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(456958, 42485, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of silhouette.</td>', 'Nice use of silhouette.', '2003-10-21 16:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(456959, 43016, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting and choice of closeup really make the features that make a Jaguar a Jaguar stand out.</td>', 'The lighting and choice of closeup really make the features that make a Jaguar a Jaguar stand out.', '2003-10-21 16:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(456972, 42693, 13346, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this photo.</td>', 'I really enjoy this photo.', '2003-10-21 16:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(457033, 42895, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think there''s just a little too much. Is the focal point the glass, the background or the runes? Judging from the title I''d have guessed at the runes but judging by the image they are just dark blobs that happen to be on the table and the glass and background are key. Nice image just not sure there is a strong enough focus for me.</td>', 'I like this but I think there''s just a little too much. Is the focal point the glass, the background or the runes? Judging from the title I''d have guessed at the runes but judging by the image they are just dark blobs that happen to be on the table and the glass and background are key. Nice image just not sure there is a strong enough focus for me.', '2003-10-21 17:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
