(457066, 42759, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this idea very much and am sure it will score highly. The double meaning of light is witty without being the sole purpose of the image. I love the detail in the feather compared with the softness of the shadow. I do find it too tightly cropped at the left side, both to the feather and to it''s shadow.</td>', 'I like this idea very much and am sure it will score highly. The double meaning of light is witty without being the sole purpose of the image. I love the detail in the feather compared with the softness of the shadow. I do find it too tightly cropped at the left side, both to the feather and to it''s shadow.', '2003-10-21 17:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
