(457078, 43008, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what this is but I like the image. It reminds me a lot of the work of someone whose name is escaping me right now (it''s really driving me crazy). He does/ did images of his own temporary works of art out in a nature landscape setting - such as an egg shape made of stones in the middle of a river. Anyway I can''t remember the name and it''s driving me nuts. But this kind of reminds me of that. Great composition and I love the grainy gritty texture and the high contrast also.<br/> <br/>NOTE: A friend helped jog my memory. It''s Andy Goldsworthy I was thinking of.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what this is but I like the image. It reminds me a lot of the work of someone whose name is escaping me right now (it''s really driving me crazy). He does/ did images of his own temporary works of art out in a nature landscape setting - such as an egg shape made of stones in the middle of a river. Anyway I can''t remember the name and it''s driving me nuts. But this kind of reminds me of that. Great composition and I love the grainy gritty texture and the high contrast also. NOTE: A friend helped jog my memory. It''s Andy Goldsworthy I was thinking of.', '2003-10-21 18:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
