(457108, 43017, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice use of thirds, I think the tightness of the crop helps a lot.  Unfortuantely the image looks a little noisy, I guess because you had to keep the room fairly dark to cast a reasonable ring of light.  Reducing the ISO may help (if you didn''t already) and also using a wider aperture.</td>', 'Nice use of thirds, I think the tightness of the crop helps a lot.  Unfortuantely the image looks a little noisy, I guess because you had to keep the room fairly dark to cast a reasonable ring of light.  Reducing the ISO may help (if you didn''t already) and also using a wider aperture.', '2003-10-21 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
