(457507, 43016, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice capture of all the reflections....good use of the lighting..nice cropping and composition.</td>', 'nice capture of all the reflections....good use of the lighting..nice cropping and composition.', '2003-10-22 02:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(457508, 42981, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and the color.  Those two made the biggest impact on me.  The use of light is good, I do like the backlighting, but as with many ''people'' images, I wish I could see the face better.  Also, I think removing the branches at the top would enhance the image bring out the blue aspect all the more.  The focus looks good as does the overall composition.  6</td>', 'I love the perspective and the color.  Those two made the biggest impact on me.  The use of light is good, I do like the backlighting, but as with many ''people'' images, I wish I could see the face better.  Also, I think removing the branches at the top would enhance the image bring out the blue aspect all the more.  The focus looks good as does the overall composition.  6', '2003-10-22 02:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(457509, 42286, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, great detail.  I''ll be honest and say I wish the prominent leaf was completely in sharp focus, but I don''t think it detracts, more of a personal preference.  Your light usage is very upfront, set off nicely by the shadows in the background, and so fits the challenge wonderfully.   A very good image.  8</td>', 'Beautiful color, great detail.  I''ll be honest and say I wish the prominent leaf was completely in sharp focus, but I don''t think it detracts, more of a personal preference.  Your light usage is very upfront, set off nicely by the shadows in the background, and so fits the challenge wonderfully.   A very good image.  8', '2003-10-22 02:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(457511, 42949, 11923, '<td valign="top">The light bulb stands out well against the background - good focus - how did you get it so the background wasn''t lit up by the bulb?  Compositionally I don''t find the image very interesting, but I do think it is well-executed and fits both its title and the challenge.  7</td>', 'The light bulb stands out well against the background - good focus - how did you get it so the background wasn''t lit up by the bulb?  Compositionally I don''t find the image very interesting, but I do think it is well-executed and fits both its title and the challenge.  7', '2003-10-22 02:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(457515, 42954, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  The use of light is tantamount here - it really makes the piece.  The image feels crisp to me, I wish I could be there and see it in person.  This may be strange, but I think this would be perfect for one of those motivational posters, they always use awe-inspiring images.  There seems to be a bit of discoloration in the sky but I think its either due to resizing or my computer, so I didn''t hold it against you.  A wonderful capture.  9</td>', 'Lovely!  The use of light is tantamount here - it really makes the piece.  The image feels crisp to me, I wish I could be there and see it in person.  This may be strange, but I think this would be perfect for one of those motivational posters, they always use awe-inspiring images.  There seems to be a bit of discoloration in the sky but I think its either due to resizing or my computer, so I didn''t hold it against you.  A wonderful capture.  9', '2003-10-22 02:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(457528, 42995, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic light usage, I love images with mist/fog in them.  The scene itself is a little commonplace, but the lighting and mist really take it to another level.  Excellent eye.  7</td>', 'Fantastic light usage, I love images with mist/fog in them.  The scene itself is a little commonplace, but the lighting and mist really take it to another level.  Excellent eye.  7', '2003-10-22 03:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(457535, 43017, 11923, '<td valign="top">I was very curious when I saw this in the thumbnails, and I find it even more interesting once opened fully.  I enjoy this image - the composition is unique, I find an odd juxtoposition with my perception, in that the fairy looks more concrete and real while the crystal has the mystical and fantasy aura to it.  I think that and the technical execution is why the image captures my attention so much.  Nice.  7</td>', 'I was very curious when I saw this in the thumbnails, and I find it even more interesting once opened fully.  I enjoy this image - the composition is unique, I find an odd juxtoposition with my perception, in that the fairy looks more concrete and real while the crystal has the mystical and fantasy aura to it.  I think that and the technical execution is why the image captures my attention so much.  Nice.  7', '2003-10-22 03:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(457542, 42435, 11923, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this image appealing personally because of the darkness of it, the way the darkness is playing on the bones makes them lose detail and so interest for me.  I think capturing an angle where the lights highlight the head and teeth of the animal was a good choice, gives it a nice focal point for the eyes.  I think its been framed in the shot well, but the overall tone seems a little flat/dull.  All in all I gave it a 5.</td>', 'I don''t find this image appealing personally because of the darkness of it, the way the darkness is playing on the bones makes them lose detail and so interest for me.  I think capturing an angle where the lights highlight the head and teeth of the animal was a good choice, gives it a nice focal point for the eyes.  I think its been framed in the shot well, but the overall tone seems a little flat/dull.  All in all I gave it a 5.', '2003-10-22 03:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(457545, 42985, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The lighting is excellent, the posture of the puppet man plays off of the light well adding depth and story to the image.  A fine photo.  7</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The lighting is excellent, the posture of the puppet man plays off of the light well adding depth and story to the image.  A fine photo.  7', '2003-10-22 03:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(457547, 42890, 11923, '<td valign="top">Oh I like this a lot!  Very abstract feel to it, wonderful color.  The shape really draws my eyes in.  Lighting is great, use of space is too.  This has a very alien feel to it for me, even the title goes with that feeling (though I could be interpreting it differently than meant).  Well done. 8</td>', 'Oh I like this a lot!  Very abstract feel to it, wonderful color.  The shape really draws my eyes in.  Lighting is great, use of space is too.  This has a very alien feel to it for me, even the title goes with that feeling (though I could be interpreting it differently than meant).  Well done. 8', '2003-10-22 03:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(457551, 42759, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I like all of the contrasts at play.  The focus is great and of course, the lighting is perfect.  I am curious whether the feather is being held or if you caught it at just the right time in decent.   I''m guessing held since part of the shaft is out of the picture, but it has a feeling of movement to me.  Regardless, a wonderful shot.  9</td>', 'Great image!  I like all of the contrasts at play.  The focus is great and of course, the lighting is perfect.  I am curious whether the feather is being held or if you caught it at just the right time in decent.   I''m guessing held since part of the shaft is out of the picture, but it has a feeling of movement to me.  Regardless, a wonderful shot.  9', '2003-10-22 03:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(457555, 42558, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, obviously well thought out and executed nicely.  The color fits the mood well and I like the human aspect of it too.  7</td>', 'An interesting image, obviously well thought out and executed nicely.  The color fits the mood well and I like the human aspect of it too.  7', '2003-10-22 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(457557, 42685, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of image texture, the grainy look really works here.  The lighting is good, composition is as well.  I like the use of space.  Only a couple nitpicky things - I''d rather she wasn''t wearing the watch or bracelet, so it was a continuous length of flesh going up, it (the watch) breaks up the fluid line for me and the other is the plug in.. just two little things, but there they are.  Still a very provocative photo.  8</td>', 'Interesting choice of image texture, the grainy look really works here.  The lighting is good, composition is as well.  I like the use of space.  Only a couple nitpicky things - I''d rather she wasn''t wearing the watch or bracelet, so it was a continuous length of flesh going up, it (the watch) breaks up the fluid line for me and the other is the plug in.. just two little things, but there they are.  Still a very provocative photo.  8', '2003-10-22 03:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(457559, 42701, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a rather unique image.  Honestly, I''m not sure if I like it or not.  The colors are vivid, seems like good focus and the use of light is pretty blatant and incorporated into the image.  I like the uniqueness of the image but I''m not sure about it as a whole.  Gave a 5 while I think about it.</td>', 'This is a rather unique image.  Honestly, I''m not sure if I like it or not.  The colors are vivid, seems like good focus and the use of light is pretty blatant and incorporated into the image.  I like the uniqueness of the image but I''m not sure about it as a whole.  Gave a 5 while I think about it.', '2003-10-22 03:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(457562, 42884, 11923, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  Perfect focus, lights abound.  The composition and choice of subject are great.  I don''t think there''s anything I would suggest changing.  10</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  Perfect focus, lights abound.  The composition and choice of subject are great.  I don''t think there''s anything I would suggest changing.  10', '2003-10-22 03:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(457566, 42719, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a darling.  Perspective is fantastic, lighting is great  The composition is wonderful.  Her pose does look a little stiff, but not so much it detracts and there looks like some mottling on the skin of her back and arm, but that might either be from resizing or just my monitor.  No idea.  Excellent work, nonetheless.  9</td>', 'What a darling.  Perspective is fantastic, lighting is great  The composition is wonderful.  Her pose does look a little stiff, but not so much it detracts and there looks like some mottling on the skin of her back and arm, but that might either be from resizing or just my monitor.  No idea.  Excellent work, nonetheless.  9', '2003-10-22 03:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(457568, 42983, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  There''s a nice feeling of energy in this shot, helped along by the green lights.  I think the lighting on his face is just right for the image, focus is great as is the perspective.  Excellent.  8</td>', 'Great capture!  There''s a nice feeling of energy in this shot, helped along by the green lights.  I think the lighting on his face is just right for the image, focus is great as is the perspective.  Excellent.  8', '2003-10-22 03:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(457569, 42700, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. I can''t be sure if this is a poke at American beauty standards or something to be taken at face value.  Either way it makes an impact.  I''ll be upfront and say that she looks to thin too me, which if you''re going for my former guess, works well.  At face value, the model looks like one you''d find in one of the haute couture mags.  All that aside, I think the image is beautifully taken.  The light is just right, it fairly glows on her lower body and highlights her face and hair just right.  The posing is good, though the way her head is tilted is just a wee bit disconcerting.  All in all a great shot, though the ribs kind of take away from it for me (no offense to your model who I think is beauitful).  9</td>', 'Hmm.. I can''t be sure if this is a poke at American beauty standards or something to be taken at face value.  Either way it makes an impact.  I''ll be upfront and say that she looks to thin too me, which if you''re going for my former guess, works well.  At face value, the model looks like one you''d find in one of the haute couture mags.  All that aside, I think the image is beautifully taken.  The light is just right, it fairly glows on her lower body and highlights her face and hair just right.  The posing is good, though the way her head is tilted is just a wee bit disconcerting.  All in all a great shot, though the ribs kind of take away from it for me (no offense to your model who I think is beauitful).  9', '2003-10-22 03:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(457575, 42871, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Love the colors, the shapes look very pod-like to me.  I''d be interested in finding out what these are.  The lighting is just right, nice subject and composition, high interest factor for me.  8</td>', 'Great image!  Love the colors, the shapes look very pod-like to me.  I''d be interested in finding out what these are.  The lighting is just right, nice subject and composition, high interest factor for me.  8', '2003-10-22 03:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(457580, 42846, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good composition, the arrangement of items isn''t too busy or crammed together, though I do find the table a little bland.  Lighting is good, wish it was a smidge darker so the candelight effect was more prominent, but I''ve found candlelight a pain to photograph without getting unwanted colors so this looks great.  Being its a romantic scene, I think the softer focus works well.  A solid photo.  7</td>', 'Good composition, the arrangement of items isn''t too busy or crammed together, though I do find the table a little bland.  Lighting is good, wish it was a smidge darker so the candelight effect was more prominent, but I''ve found candlelight a pain to photograph without getting unwanted colors so this looks great.  Being its a romantic scene, I think the softer focus works well.  A solid photo.  7', '2003-10-22 03:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(457582, 42814, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the riot of colors, and I''m always fond of nature shots, but the overall darker tone of this photo dampens my interest.  I think it would have more appeal if the colors really popped, by having a more noticeable light influence on them.  5</td>', 'I love the riot of colors, and I''m always fond of nature shots, but the overall darker tone of this photo dampens my interest.  I think it would have more appeal if the colors really popped, by having a more noticeable light influence on them.  5', '2003-10-22 03:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(457585, 42842, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fun family shot.  Lots of energy, clearly people are having fun.  I''m not really fond of the action though, because it is all over the image and so my attention is jumping from one point to another erratically.  Plus the action of it, makes portions blurred and because so many areas are blurred my attention then starts to wander.  Had there been just one hula hooper, hulahooping, I think the balance wouldn''t have tipped.  Still it looks like a jumpin'' time!  5</td>', 'I think this is a fun family shot.  Lots of energy, clearly people are having fun.  I''m not really fond of the action though, because it is all over the image and so my attention is jumping from one point to another erratically.  Plus the action of it, makes portions blurred and because so many areas are blurred my attention then starts to wander.  Had there been just one hula hooper, hulahooping, I think the balance wouldn''t have tipped.  Still it looks like a jumpin'' time!  5', '2003-10-22 03:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(457590, 43018, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the luminosity of the colors and I find the composition interesting.  I wish more of the balloons were in the shot though.  That said, it clearly is highlighting the light usage and does so in a clear and lovely way.  Good focus and nice subject matter.  7</td>', 'I like the luminosity of the colors and I find the composition interesting.  I wish more of the balloons were in the shot though.  That said, it clearly is highlighting the light usage and does so in a clear and lovely way.  Good focus and nice subject matter.  7', '2003-10-22 04:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(457593, 42986, 11923, '<td valign="top">Woah!  We need an old priest and a young priest..  I love the vibrant colors and who can say no to a jack o'' lantern?  The vision behind the image is good, but I find the choice of manifestation pretty distracting.  Mostly because the colors in the image *are* so vivid.  A brave strike out into being a little different though!  6</td>', 'Woah!  We need an old priest and a young priest..  I love the vibrant colors and who can say no to a jack o'' lantern?  The vision behind the image is good, but I find the choice of manifestation pretty distracting.  Mostly because the colors in the image *are* so vivid.  A brave strike out into being a little different though!  6', '2003-10-22 04:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(457596, 42925, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, where is this??  The colors are outstanding, so are the lights.  Great focus, wonderful detail.  Everything is crisp and bright.  I don''t see anything I would suggest changing.  Great image!  10</td>', 'Wow, where is this??  The colors are outstanding, so are the lights.  Great focus, wonderful detail.  Everything is crisp and bright.  I don''t see anything I would suggest changing.  Great image!  10', '2003-10-22 04:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(457600, 42989, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where the title comes in play, though it looks kind of like he may be pouting? or sticking out of the tongue.... the crop may have removed that aspect.  Great lighting on the jacket, marvelous detail.  To be honest, I would suggest cropping out more of the left side, so that pout/tongue whatever isn''t in the shot, just the jaw.  I am finding my attention is captured very well by the detail of the jacket and his hands - a strong masculine image.  7</td>', 'I''m not sure where the title comes in play, though it looks kind of like he may be pouting? or sticking out of the tongue.... the crop may have removed that aspect.  Great lighting on the jacket, marvelous detail.  To be honest, I would suggest cropping out more of the left side, so that pout/tongue whatever isn''t in the shot, just the jaw.  I am finding my attention is captured very well by the detail of the jacket and his hands - a strong masculine image.  7', '2003-10-22 04:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(457652, 42693, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good use of light, I like the rays coming over the building.  The difference in colors with the warm orange against the cooler grey/blue adds interest, as does the perspective.  There does however seem to be some glare, flares or something.. little white bits in the sky, they don''t look like stars (though they may be) but it is rather distracting and detracts from the image. 5  Revising my vote after due to further info from photographer, they are stars and knowing how they came about made a difference.  Upgrading to a 6 because I now understand why they look as they do but still find them distracting .</td>', 'Good use of light, I like the rays coming over the building.  The difference in colors with the warm orange against the cooler grey/blue adds interest, as does the perspective.  There does however seem to be some glare, flares or something.. little white bits in the sky, they don''t look like stars (though they may be) but it is rather distracting and detracts from the image. 5  Revising my vote after due to further info from photographer, they are stars and knowing how they came about made a difference.  Upgrading to a 6 because I now understand why they look as they do but still find them distracting .', '2003-10-22 05:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(457665, 42818, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, a little sharper would have brought more detail out on he rocks, but saying that, would have made the sand look a little oversharpened. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice picture, a little sharper would have brought more detail out on he rocks, but saying that, would have made the sand look a little oversharpened. Well done.', '2003-10-22 05:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(457669, 42685, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice, the lighing here makes her right arm look as if it doesn''t have an edge.  The grainy look is good.  The cable going along the floor and the socket on the wall distracts me a little, very good though.</td>', 'Nice, the lighing here makes her right arm look as if it doesn''t have an edge.  The grainy look is good.  The cable going along the floor and the socket on the wall distracts me a little, very good though.', '2003-10-22 05:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(457695, 42992, 12802, '<td valign="top">A touch sharper would have brought out the rail on the right hand side so that my eyes would have been sent right into the distance.   Very nice photo though, good DOF.</td>', 'A touch sharper would have brought out the rail on the right hand side so that my eyes would have been sent right into the distance.   Very nice photo though, good DOF.', '2003-10-22 05:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(457697, 42597, 12802, '<td valign="top">MIght have scored it a bit higher without the sun at the top of this picture.  I like the beams of sunlight coming through.</td>', 'MIght have scored it a bit higher without the sun at the top of this picture.  I like the beams of sunlight coming through.', '2003-10-22 05:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(457739, 42759, 12900, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Very simple with big impact.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Very simple with big impact.', '2003-10-22 06:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(457798, 42916, 5728, '<td valign="top">This would have been good for the "alone" challenge too, actually it would probably have done better there than here. Personally I like this a lot. The desaturation effect is fitting and the composition is good, maybe except for cropping a little too tightly to the boy''s foot. I would have left just a tad more breathing space there. (7)</td>', 'This would have been good for the "alone" challenge too, actually it would probably have done better there than here. Personally I like this a lot. The desaturation effect is fitting and the composition is good, maybe except for cropping a little too tightly to the boy''s foot. I would have left just a tad more breathing space there. (7)', '2003-10-22 08:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(457822, 42846, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The composition is too static. I like the richness of the colors.</td>', 'Good idea. The composition is too static. I like the richness of the colors.', '2003-10-22 08:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(457825, 42578, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent capture. I like how the shadow has the same shape as the rock.</td>', 'This is an excellent capture. I like how the shadow has the same shape as the rock.', '2003-10-22 08:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(457832, 43017, 11800, '<td valign="top">The idea is good. The light on the wall might have been more dramatic if it was moved more toward her head to form a halo. I think it would be more pleasing if there was less noise.</td>', 'The idea is good. The light on the wall might have been more dramatic if it was moved more toward her head to form a halo. I think it would be more pleasing if there was less noise.', '2003-10-22 08:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(457838, 42087, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is one of the more interesting apple shots I have seen. Did you think about turning the apple a little. The stem is too perfectly aligned with the shadows. That makes it blend in to much. Might improve the dynamics. Excellent use of light.</td>', 'This is one of the more interesting apple shots I have seen. Did you think about turning the apple a little. The stem is too perfectly aligned with the shadows. That makes it blend in to much. Might improve the dynamics. Excellent use of light.', '2003-10-22 08:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(457866, 42995, 7014, '<td valign="top">Well seen and captured, good composition.</td>', 'Well seen and captured, good composition.', '2003-10-22 09:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(457944, 42818, 4540, '<td valign="top">very nice. Flynn</td>', 'very nice. Flynn', '2003-10-22 10:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458365, 42960, 10978, '<td valign="top">WOW this would have been great for the shadow challenge. Nice shot 8</td>', 'WOW this would have been great for the shadow challenge. Nice shot 8', '2003-10-22 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(458390, 42161, 13395, '<td valign="top">pretty eyes<br/></td>', 'pretty eyes', '2003-10-22 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(458410, 42600, 2279, '<td valign="top">A little underexposed for my taste.</td>', 'A little underexposed for my taste.', '2003-10-22 14:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(458445, 42770, 2279, '<td valign="top">I would have given you a 9 but that border ruined it for me. Now you get a 7.</td>', 'I would have given you a 9 but that border ruined it for me. Now you get a 7.', '2003-10-22 14:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458494, 42942, 11923, '<td valign="top">I always like photos of eyes, they are one of the most expressive subjects.  I am curious about your choice of title, only because I don''t see a correlation with the picture and it - I wasn''t sure if you were going for a reflection of a rainy day window in her eyes and that''s where it came from, because without the title I wouldn''t think ''daydream'' mainly because of the tight focus.  BUT, I think this is a solid image.  The lighting is good, focus is clear, particularly on the left (and well-lit) eye.  Her freckles are adorable, gives the features a bit of precociousness.  If the window reflection idea was correct, I think it needs to be a bit more evident, if not then ignore that part.  ;)  Well done.  6</td>', 'I always like photos of eyes, they are one of the most expressive subjects.  I am curious about your choice of title, only because I don''t see a correlation with the picture and it - I wasn''t sure if you were going for a reflection of a rainy day window in her eyes and that''s where it came from, because without the title I wouldn''t think ''daydream'' mainly because of the tight focus.  BUT, I think this is a solid image.  The lighting is good, focus is clear, particularly on the left (and well-lit) eye.  Her freckles are adorable, gives the features a bit of precociousness.  If the window reflection idea was correct, I think it needs to be a bit more evident, if not then ignore that part.  ;)  Well done.  6', '2003-10-22 15:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(458501, 42483, 11923, '<td valign="top">The child certainly looks carefree!  I like the silhouette look and I always enjoy seascapes.  Great use of space and light is what helps make this image,  though the sun''s rays are harsh and slightly unappealing.  I definitely get a happy go lucky feeling from the image.  Well portrayed.  7</td>', 'The child certainly looks carefree!  I like the silhouette look and I always enjoy seascapes.  Great use of space and light is what helps make this image,  though the sun''s rays are harsh and slightly unappealing.  I definitely get a happy go lucky feeling from the image.  Well portrayed.  7', '2003-10-22 15:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(458507, 43011, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a rather different subject.  I see its connection to light and the light usage is good, makes use of the nature of the tarp.  Colors have a nice contrast (wish they were a bit more vivid) and the focus is good.  Unfortunately, I don''t find the subject very interesting and that lack of influence does affect my voting.  I think its a technically sound image, but a little boring.  6</td>', 'This is a rather different subject.  I see its connection to light and the light usage is good, makes use of the nature of the tarp.  Colors have a nice contrast (wish they were a bit more vivid) and the focus is good.  Unfortunately, I don''t find the subject very interesting and that lack of influence does affect my voting.  I think its a technically sound image, but a little boring.  6', '2003-10-22 15:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(458513, 42992, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful choice for interesting shapes and dynamics.  The lighting is okay, I like how it is just barely lighting up the bridge''s upper workings, though I wish it was stronger.  The perspective is good, gives the bridge depth and breadth.  I think the color could be richer, which would give the contrasting nature of the orangey brown and white a boost.  A nice shot.  6</td>', 'Wonderful choice for interesting shapes and dynamics.  The lighting is okay, I like how it is just barely lighting up the bridge''s upper workings, though I wish it was stronger.  The perspective is good, gives the bridge depth and breadth.  I think the color could be richer, which would give the contrasting nature of the orangey brown and white a boost.  A nice shot.  6', '2003-10-22 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458518, 42855, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and the light display is gorgeous.  I like the contrast with the colors and the nature vs machine.  The border keeps my eyes from wandering out.  I do wish the light rays didn''t extend onto the buildings on the left so much so they''d be a crisp black, but its hard to tell the sun what to do.  ;)  A very striking image.  7</td>', 'Beautiful colors and the light display is gorgeous.  I like the contrast with the colors and the nature vs machine.  The border keeps my eyes from wandering out.  I do wish the light rays didn''t extend onto the buildings on the left so much so they''d be a crisp black, but its hard to tell the sun what to do.  ;)  A very striking image.  7', '2003-10-22 15:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458527, 42578, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m obtuse sometimes and in this case I don''t get the title, but I don''t hold that against the piece.  I''m very intrigued by this image.  The lighting is excellent, I love the warm neutrals against the black.  The detail and focus are perfect - the grain is very evident and that texture really adds to the photo for me.  Its got very simple lines which lend its rough nature a bit of elegance.  Wonderful image, very well accomplished.  9</td>', 'I''m obtuse sometimes and in this case I don''t get the title, but I don''t hold that against the piece.  I''m very intrigued by this image.  The lighting is excellent, I love the warm neutrals against the black.  The detail and focus are perfect - the grain is very evident and that texture really adds to the photo for me.  Its got very simple lines which lend its rough nature a bit of elegance.  Wonderful image, very well accomplished.  9', '2003-10-22 15:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458532, 42434, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise.  The colors are rich and contrast each other well.  I love how sharp the clouds look and the fact that there isn''t any significant glare to be seen.  Very peaceful mood, excellent capture.  8</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise.  The colors are rich and contrast each other well.  I love how sharp the clouds look and the fact that there isn''t any significant glare to be seen.  Very peaceful mood, excellent capture.  8', '2003-10-22 15:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(458534, 42997, 11923, '<td valign="top">The joys of camping!  I like this image, it has a nice story/mood to it.  The campfire gives a great glow to the children and helps make the lighting look how my mind envisions a night of camping.  I do wish there was a little more focus on both of the girls though.  Also, the empty chair is a little distracting because its color is so vivid it draws my eyes away from the two girls (who I think are the focal point of the piece).  Nice job!  6</td>', 'The joys of camping!  I like this image, it has a nice story/mood to it.  The campfire gives a great glow to the children and helps make the lighting look how my mind envisions a night of camping.  I do wish there was a little more focus on both of the girls though.  Also, the empty chair is a little distracting because its color is so vivid it draws my eyes away from the two girls (who I think are the focal point of the piece).  Nice job!  6', '2003-10-22 15:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(458540, 43001, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset.  I love the play of light on the clouds, though I wish there was a little more focus to them, giving them a clear line.  The colors are spectacular.  The overall image is crisp, no haze or unpleasant light rays/glare.  I wish I could see sunsets like this from my backyard.  Solid photo.  7</td>', 'Very nice sunset.  I love the play of light on the clouds, though I wish there was a little more focus to them, giving them a clear line.  The colors are spectacular.  The overall image is crisp, no haze or unpleasant light rays/glare.  I wish I could see sunsets like this from my backyard.  Solid photo.  7', '2003-10-22 15:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(458545, 42504, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow the change in color tone is great!  I like the fact that the colors are vivid and not washed out.  The difference in inherent textures, mountain vs, tree-lined cliffs etc adds to the interest of the photo.  Its a very dramatic image particularly with the bright light and deep shadows.  I do wish the focus was a little more spread out, but its not anything that impacts negatively.  Where was this taken?  8</td>', 'Wow the change in color tone is great!  I like the fact that the colors are vivid and not washed out.  The difference in inherent textures, mountain vs, tree-lined cliffs etc adds to the interest of the photo.  Its a very dramatic image particularly with the bright light and deep shadows.  I do wish the focus was a little more spread out, but its not anything that impacts negatively.  Where was this taken?  8', '2003-10-22 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458547, 42503, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  I wish the lighting was a little less harsh on the right, but I''m not sure that would be possible without losing clarity on the left.  I like the way you captured the storm line.  The rich greens are great, focus is a little softer than I would prefer, but the range of light may have made that hard to get.  Nice job!  6</td>', 'Interesting!  I wish the lighting was a little less harsh on the right, but I''m not sure that would be possible without losing clarity on the left.  I like the way you captured the storm line.  The rich greens are great, focus is a little softer than I would prefer, but the range of light may have made that hard to get.  Nice job!  6', '2003-10-22 15:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(458549, 42513, 11923, '<td valign="top">The colors are vivid, and I like the way the light looks like its throwing rays out around the bottom of the image.  Candlelight has always been very hard for me to get right so I''m impressed with how this came out.  I do find the subject itself to detract though, the interest level of the floating candle isn''t high for me, I''m much more attracted to the effect the light is having on the glass and surroundings.  5</td>', 'The colors are vivid, and I like the way the light looks like its throwing rays out around the bottom of the image.  Candlelight has always been very hard for me to get right so I''m impressed with how this came out.  I do find the subject itself to detract though, the interest level of the floating candle isn''t high for me, I''m much more attracted to the effect the light is having on the glass and surroundings.  5', '2003-10-22 15:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(458552, 42485, 11923, '<td valign="top">Striking image.  Draws and keeps my attention.  I like the cool blue/purple choice in coloring.  Silhouettes tend to add interest in most photo situations.   I''m not sure if I like the trees framing the statue(?).  It all works together, but I''m wondering if it might be better with a more open feel with no trees.  Great lines, great photo.  8</td>', 'Striking image.  Draws and keeps my attention.  I like the cool blue/purple choice in coloring.  Silhouettes tend to add interest in most photo situations.   I''m not sure if I like the trees framing the statue(?).  It all works together, but I''m wondering if it might be better with a more open feel with no trees.  Great lines, great photo.  8', '2003-10-22 15:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(458559, 42840, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the concept behind the image, but I''m not quite drawn in by the composition as much as I could be.  I think the candleholder thingie in the middle obstructs too much of the back candles.  I also think it might have had a bigger impact if all of the candles had that translucent quality of light through wax like the front two do.  Still the soft focus works great here, enhancing the aspect of the light.  The warm colors and soft light almost floating in darkness says quiet/hushed feeling or mood.  Calm and contemplative.  5</td>', 'I like the concept behind the image, but I''m not quite drawn in by the composition as much as I could be.  I think the candleholder thingie in the middle obstructs too much of the back candles.  I also think it might have had a bigger impact if all of the candles had that translucent quality of light through wax like the front two do.  Still the soft focus works great here, enhancing the aspect of the light.  The warm colors and soft light almost floating in darkness says quiet/hushed feeling or mood.  Calm and contemplative.  5', '2003-10-22 16:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(458567, 42666, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great focus, lighting is warm and not harsh like I''d expect from a spot light.  I think it works better this way though.  There seems to be a light haze or heat from lights in the air, this gives a nice subtle depth to the image.  I get a sense of a concert getting ready to start, or having just finished.   Nice photo.  7</td>', 'Great focus, lighting is warm and not harsh like I''d expect from a spot light.  I think it works better this way though.  There seems to be a light haze or heat from lights in the air, this gives a nice subtle depth to the image.  I get a sense of a concert getting ready to start, or having just finished.   Nice photo.  7', '2003-10-22 16:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(458574, 42717, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the contrasting textures in this image.  The vase has a real organic, sensuous feel while the background is more structured.   The lighting looks great to me.  As a personal preference I''d rathered one of the blooms be facing me the viewer.  The red against the neutral is just the right amount of color to draw the eye to the flowers, doesn''t over power the simplicity of the image.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Wow, I love the contrasting textures in this image.  The vase has a real organic, sensuous feel while the background is more structured.   The lighting looks great to me.  As a personal preference I''d rathered one of the blooms be facing me the viewer.  The red against the neutral is just the right amount of color to draw the eye to the flowers, doesn''t over power the simplicity of the image.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-22 16:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(458584, 42852, 11923, '<td valign="top">This has a rather abstract look to it which I tend to like, but I find this image too dark.  The colors which look like they are fantastic are too muted by the darkness, they barely get a chance to shine.  The focal point, where the light is showing in the bottom corner does highlight that wonderful bluish green well.  The focus looks good as is the use of space.  I just find the overall composition a little bland because of the darkness.  4</td>', 'This has a rather abstract look to it which I tend to like, but I find this image too dark.  The colors which look like they are fantastic are too muted by the darkness, they barely get a chance to shine.  The focal point, where the light is showing in the bottom corner does highlight that wonderful bluish green well.  The focus looks good as is the use of space.  I just find the overall composition a little bland because of the darkness.  4', '2003-10-22 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458601, 42984, 11923, '<td valign="top">Mmm creme brulee.  I''ve always liked this part.  As a whole, I find the image a little flat - the eye is definitely drawn to the blowtorch thing, and that light blue really gives the image some pop.  The overall color though is a tad too dull for my tastes.  I like the perspective, and the close up nature is good, very crisp image.  Would like to see it with a little more light on it.  5</td>', 'Mmm creme brulee.  I''ve always liked this part.  As a whole, I find the image a little flat - the eye is definitely drawn to the blowtorch thing, and that light blue really gives the image some pop.  The overall color though is a tad too dull for my tastes.  I like the perspective, and the close up nature is good, very crisp image.  Would like to see it with a little more light on it.  5', '2003-10-22 16:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458609, 42994, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color combinations.  The colors are very well defined and play off of each other nicely.  I wish the lighting aspect of this was a little more vivid - the light seems muted, maybe by a polarizing filter?  Keeps out the glare but I think it dulls out the tones just a tad.  Still, great focus and the colors are nice.  Composition is tight, but I think it works.  6, would''ve been higher had the brightness been there.</td>', 'Great color combinations.  The colors are very well defined and play off of each other nicely.  I wish the lighting aspect of this was a little more vivid - the light seems muted, maybe by a polarizing filter?  Keeps out the glare but I think it dulls out the tones just a tad.  Still, great focus and the colors are nice.  Composition is tight, but I think it works.  6, would''ve been higher had the brightness been there.', '2003-10-22 16:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458614, 43012, 4536, '<td valign="top">Good play with light. Very original.</td>', 'Good play with light. Very original.', '2003-10-22 16:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(458618, 42546, 11923, '<td valign="top">The crystal does indeed look golden.  Great lighting to get that effect!  (Or did it have an irridescent layer on the glass?)  Focus is crisp, I''m not sure I like the dark liquid.  Would be interested in seeing it with a clear one.  Also, I don''t like the close crop.  The image needs to breath a bit in my opinion, so a little bit of open space on the side would help, also give it an off-centered orientation which helps the composition.  A lovely shot.  6</td>', 'The crystal does indeed look golden.  Great lighting to get that effect!  (Or did it have an irridescent layer on the glass?)  Focus is crisp, I''m not sure I like the dark liquid.  Would be interested in seeing it with a clear one.  Also, I don''t like the close crop.  The image needs to breath a bit in my opinion, so a little bit of open space on the side would help, also give it an off-centered orientation which helps the composition.  A lovely shot.  6', '2003-10-22 16:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458627, 42864, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very different.  Fits lighting well.  I like the colors, and while normally I''d find the level of brightness/harsh color to be a detractant, this works.  I especially like the pale pink trails.  Nice abstract image, well done. 6</td>', 'Very different.  Fits lighting well.  I like the colors, and while normally I''d find the level of brightness/harsh color to be a detractant, this works.  I especially like the pale pink trails.  Nice abstract image, well done. 6', '2003-10-22 16:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(458629, 42762, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a mundane object and transforming it into something very interesting.  The lighting really helps the transformation.  The title fits the piece wonderfully which always helps.  Could use a little more crispness.  I also wonder if a different color underlay may have made for better contrast.  Still I like the vision behind this image and the execution.  Well done. 7</td>', 'Nice use of a mundane object and transforming it into something very interesting.  The lighting really helps the transformation.  The title fits the piece wonderfully which always helps.  Could use a little more crispness.  I also wonder if a different color underlay may have made for better contrast.  Still I like the vision behind this image and the execution.  Well done. 7', '2003-10-22 16:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(458637, 42161, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject, her eyes are wonderful.  The lighting is okay, but I''m torn on whether I like it.  On one hand I find it a bit detracting because I want more tonal play from the skin and deliniation of all the features.  On the other hand I love how it really brings out the eyes and creates a nice foil for the hair (which in turn also highlight the eyes).  Beyond that the only other thing that draw my eye negatively was an odd discoloration on her right eyebrow (possibly weird light glare?), doesn''t take away from the image, but it did catch my attention.  Excellent photo.  9</td>', 'Beautiful subject, her eyes are wonderful.  The lighting is okay, but I''m torn on whether I like it.  On one hand I find it a bit detracting because I want more tonal play from the skin and deliniation of all the features.  On the other hand I love how it really brings out the eyes and creates a nice foil for the hair (which in turn also highlight the eyes).  Beyond that the only other thing that draw my eye negatively was an odd discoloration on her right eyebrow (possibly weird light glare?), doesn''t take away from the image, but it did catch my attention.  Excellent photo.  9', '2003-10-22 16:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(458639, 42819, 11923, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a great image!  I love the fluidness and the focus is fantastic.  Use of light is wonderful to.  I''m horrible at lighting using candles so this is great!  I really like how the light is being refracted all over, keeping the whole image bright.  The warm amber-like tones are great too.  I do wish there was a little more to the image size-wise.  Seems cropped a little too close for my tastes.  Great image!  7</td>', 'Oh this is a great image!  I love the fluidness and the focus is fantastic.  Use of light is wonderful to.  I''m horrible at lighting using candles so this is great!  I really like how the light is being refracted all over, keeping the whole image bright.  The warm amber-like tones are great too.  I do wish there was a little more to the image size-wise.  Seems cropped a little too close for my tastes.  Great image!  7', '2003-10-22 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(458644, 42947, 11923, '<td valign="top">Ah, how adorable!  Great lighting of course!  The subject is fun, humorous.  I like the fact that the lamp is what''s in greater focus rather than the cat.  Composition is great and I like the tonal differences between the left and right sides.  I do wish it was even on the left, but its not a preference so strong it affects my perception.  Very fun photo.  7</td>', 'Ah, how adorable!  Great lighting of course!  The subject is fun, humorous.  I like the fact that the lamp is what''s in greater focus rather than the cat.  Composition is great and I like the tonal differences between the left and right sides.  I do wish it was even on the left, but its not a preference so strong it affects my perception.  Very fun photo.  7', '2003-10-22 16:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458645, 42519, 11895, '<td valign="top">conveys the theme of the challenge well, the landing lights make it so cool</td>', 'conveys the theme of the challenge well, the landing lights make it so cool', '2003-10-22 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(458647, 42864, 13448, '<td valign="top">Very original light. I like it very much. Congrats!</td>', 'Very original light. I like it very much. Congrats!', '2003-10-22 16:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(458649, 42438, 13448, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2003-10-22 16:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(458657, 42993, 11895, '<td valign="top">makes my mouth water; not sure what the item in the upper right is, wish you had showed more of it - so I could know what it is - or cropped it out completely</td>', 'makes my mouth water; not sure what the item in the upper right is, wish you had showed more of it - so I could know what it is - or cropped it out completely', '2003-10-22 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458671, 42969, 4536, '<td valign="top">Wow, you really lucked out with the deer, she makes this shot a cut above. Can\''t tell where she\''s looking, it\''s probably at you, but I\''ll pretend she\''s enjoying the beautiful sunset :) I wish there was less room behind her and more in front, so she would be stepping into the frame instead of out of it.</td>', 'Wow, you really lucked out with the deer, she makes this shot a cut above. Can\''t tell where she\''s looking, it\''s probably at you, but I\''ll pretend she\''s enjoying the beautiful sunset :) I wish there was less room behind her and more in front, so she would be stepping into the frame instead of out of it.', '2003-10-22 16:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(458678, 42759, 11895, '<td valign="top">clever way to interpret the theme, I see no flaws in this one except for the too close crop n the left side</td>', 'clever way to interpret the theme, I see no flaws in this one except for the too close crop n the left side', '2003-10-22 16:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(458693, 42895, 11923, '<td valign="top">The composition of this image is great.  I love the colors and the way they are playing off the liquid.  The lighting is good, but I''m not sure what those things next to the glass is, are they the stones?  I admit the title isn''t readily apparent to me, but no matter.    Good focus, good interest.  Solid image.  6</td>', 'The composition of this image is great.  I love the colors and the way they are playing off the liquid.  The lighting is good, but I''m not sure what those things next to the glass is, are they the stones?  I admit the title isn''t readily apparent to me, but no matter.    Good focus, good interest.  Solid image.  6', '2003-10-22 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(458697, 43009, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the alignment of the elements, con trail, sun, flag, plane - very well composed</td>', 'I like the alignment of the elements, con trail, sun, flag, plane - very well composed', '2003-10-22 16:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(458701, 42185, 11923, '<td valign="top">Its amazing what some light and mist can do to make even a regular old factory a mysterious and interesting sight.  Very well captured.  The lighting is a bit harsh in the corner, but I''m not sure anything could really be done about that.  Good focus, I''d rather the bushes in the front were gone though, I think it would have a more powerful impact if it was all water to the edge of the picture, increases the feeling of space and distance.  Overall a very strong image.  7</td>', 'Its amazing what some light and mist can do to make even a regular old factory a mysterious and interesting sight.  Very well captured.  The lighting is a bit harsh in the corner, but I''m not sure anything could really be done about that.  Good focus, I''d rather the bushes in the front were gone though, I think it would have a more powerful impact if it was all water to the edge of the picture, increases the feeling of space and distance.  Overall a very strong image.  7', '2003-10-22 17:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(458704, 42600, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  I like the half lit look, the muted colors and darker tones fit the subject well, particularly the secretive nature.  Has an intimate feel/mood.  I think the darkness of the photo softens the focus a bit, which works in this instance.  A very nice photo.  7</td>', 'Very interesting image.  I like the half lit look, the muted colors and darker tones fit the subject well, particularly the secretive nature.  Has an intimate feel/mood.  I think the darkness of the photo softens the focus a bit, which works in this instance.  A very nice photo.  7', '2003-10-22 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(458708, 42887, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image!  I love the fact that the lighting seems to be the focus rather than the person walking.  Its very crisp and clear, particularly where its well light up ahead.  The perspective gives the feeling of a long walk ahead.  I like the way he/she looks to be emerging from darkness towards the light.  Is this using a sepia tone?  The colors don''t look completely natural but not in a negative way.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  10</td>', 'Fantastic image!  I love the fact that the lighting seems to be the focus rather than the person walking.  Its very crisp and clear, particularly where its well light up ahead.  The perspective gives the feeling of a long walk ahead.  I like the way he/she looks to be emerging from darkness towards the light.  Is this using a sepia tone?  The colors don''t look completely natural but not in a negative way.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  10', '2003-10-22 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(458711, 42987, 11923, '<td valign="top">The frenzy of the popcorn machine!  I really like the clean aspect of this image.  The light makes things nice and crisp and there''s good focus for the most part.  In fact, the brilliance of the machines caught my eye so well I didn''t realize there were people in the image for awhile.   This could be a boring image, but I think the perspective and lighting gives it that bit of oomph.  Nice job 7</td>', 'The frenzy of the popcorn machine!  I really like the clean aspect of this image.  The light makes things nice and crisp and there''s good focus for the most part.  In fact, the brilliance of the machines caught my eye so well I didn''t realize there were people in the image for awhile.   This could be a boring image, but I think the perspective and lighting gives it that bit of oomph.  Nice job 7', '2003-10-22 17:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(458719, 42503, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like the depth, just a little too bright on the right side</td>', 'I really like the depth, just a little too bright on the right side', '2003-10-22 17:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(458723, 42815, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  The lighting brings out the colors well and keeps it looking like it is set in a bar, instead of a stale light from a supermarket.  Very warm tones to it.  I like the clarity of the picture, good focus.  Fun image!  7</td>', 'Great subject!  The lighting brings out the colors well and keeps it looking like it is set in a bar, instead of a stale light from a supermarket.  Very warm tones to it.  I like the clarity of the picture, good focus.  Fun image!  7', '2003-10-22 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(458731, 42907, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good focus and lighting.  Fits the challenge well and I like the use of space.  Unfortunately I don''t find the subject terribly interesting.  Its missing a spark of something to take it up to a higher level for me.  I think it is technically sound though.  6 due to good technique, would''ve been higher if that spark was there.</td>', 'Good focus and lighting.  Fits the challenge well and I like the use of space.  Unfortunately I don''t find the subject terribly interesting.  Its missing a spark of something to take it up to a higher level for me.  I think it is technically sound though.  6 due to good technique, would''ve been higher if that spark was there.', '2003-10-22 17:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(458734, 42969, 11895, '<td valign="top">maybe compose it a bit differently to use the deer to get the Rule of Thirds effect, overall a very good picture</td>', 'maybe compose it a bit differently to use the deer to get the Rule of Thirds effect, overall a very good picture', '2003-10-22 17:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(458738, 42816, 11923, '<td valign="top">Shows lighting well, a different perspective, but it fails to capture my attention.  The focus seems a little off, but that could be because of the intense light from the flash.  Its an interesting idea, but the execution falls a little short for me.  4</td>', 'Shows lighting well, a different perspective, but it fails to capture my attention.  The focus seems a little off, but that could be because of the intense light from the flash.  Its an interesting idea, but the execution falls a little short for me.  4', '2003-10-22 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(458741, 42946, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image!  I like the color and feel of it.  Has a very cool tone.  Great lighting and focus is on target.  Just wish that you couldn''t see whatever that is behind the doors (the lights?).  Otherwise it holds together nicely and is a very nice photo.  7</td>', 'Interesting image!  I like the color and feel of it.  Has a very cool tone.  Great lighting and focus is on target.  Just wish that you couldn''t see whatever that is behind the doors (the lights?).  Otherwise it holds together nicely and is a very nice photo.  7', '2003-10-22 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458748, 42483, 11895, '<td valign="top">I love the way the sunlight shows both to have a foot in the air</td>', 'I love the way the sunlight shows both to have a foot in the air', '2003-10-22 17:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(458754, 43002, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and tones.  I love the texture visible on the jug/vase.  The focus is superb on the jug, I do wish it extended to the grain of wheat which looks a little soft to me.  I like the simplicity of the subject: both the vision and techincal aspects have been accomplished admirably.  Well done.  10</td>', 'Excellent lighting and tones.  I love the texture visible on the jug/vase.  The focus is superb on the jug, I do wish it extended to the grain of wheat which looks a little soft to me.  I like the simplicity of the subject: both the vision and techincal aspects have been accomplished admirably.  Well done.  10', '2003-10-22 17:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458758, 42087, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow I like this image!  It took me awhile to figure out its apple nature (even with the title)  It looks like a fist to me sort of.  Keeps my attention.  Use of light is great, I like that it has a bar effect on it, instead of the usual unbroken light.  Black and white really works for this, adds to the striking nature.  The harsh light spots are the only major downside I see, but even that isn''t too bad.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Wow I like this image!  It took me awhile to figure out its apple nature (even with the title)  It looks like a fist to me sort of.  Keeps my attention.  Use of light is great, I like that it has a bar effect on it, instead of the usual unbroken light.  Black and white really works for this, adds to the striking nature.  The harsh light spots are the only major downside I see, but even that isn''t too bad.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-22 17:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458767, 42884, 10869, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, nice details, and nice subject; congratz for the shot!</td>', 'nice lighting, nice details, and nice subject; congratz for the shot!', '2003-10-22 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(458773, 42539, 11895, '<td valign="top">what is the white thing in the lower left?  it distracts, otherwise very nice, light and airy feeling comes thru well, and the bright but soft background is nice</td>', 'what is the white thing in the lower left?  it distracts, otherwise very nice, light and airy feeling comes thru well, and the bright but soft background is nice', '2003-10-22 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(458839, 42759, 3279, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning!</td>', 'Simply stunning!', '2003-10-22 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458979, 42984, 10858, '<td valign="top">Funny one. :-) Nice composition and technics!</td>', 'Funny one. :-) Nice composition and technics!', '2003-10-22 19:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458981, 42693, 10858, '<td valign="top">The movement of stars are fantastic! Grats!</td>', 'The movement of stars are fantastic! Grats!', '2003-10-22 19:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(458987, 42759, 10858, '<td valign="top">Harmonic, just like a yin-yang! Congrats!</td>', 'Harmonic, just like a yin-yang! Congrats!', '2003-10-22 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458989, 42286, 10858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours!</td>', 'Beautiful colours!', '2003-10-22 19:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(459000, 42839, 10858, '<td valign="top">So this is called African Violet in English? Neat photo, I like the lighting and the greens very much!</td>', 'So this is called African Violet in English? Neat photo, I like the lighting and the greens very much!', '2003-10-22 19:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(459004, 43002, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, warm colours. I like the composition as well, gratulations!</td>', 'Wonderful, warm colours. I like the composition as well, gratulations!', '2003-10-22 19:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(459112, 42969, 11608, '<td valign="top"></td>', '', '2003-10-22 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(459374, 42955, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting when you look at it in the thumbnail, makes you wonder, "What the heck is that?"  Which is good, grabs my attention.  But once I''m here it''s wanting, the clarity is undefined in the overall shot and the light in the back gets lost or is it coming from underneath?  I can''t really tell.  Maybe a more powerful spotlight to define it more from behind and a bit more sharpness and this would have really punched up the shot for me.  I started with a 3 the first time through but am going to bump up to a 5 because it does grow on you :)</td>', 'This is very interesting when you look at it in the thumbnail, makes you wonder, "What the heck is that?"  Which is good, grabs my attention.  But once I''m here it''s wanting, the clarity is undefined in the overall shot and the light in the back gets lost or is it coming from underneath?  I can''t really tell.  Maybe a more powerful spotlight to define it more from behind and a bit more sharpness and this would have really punched up the shot for me.  I started with a 3 the first time through but am going to bump up to a 5 because it does grow on you :)', '2003-10-22 22:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(459378, 42546, 12448, '<td valign="top">The cropping is so tight on this it leaves no room for the light per say.  The goblet has a slight gold tone to it but with no space around it to help the black backdrop really define the glass it really looses a lot for me.  I started with a 3 but will go to a 4 for the overall clarity and clearness of the shot.</td>', 'The cropping is so tight on this it leaves no room for the light per say.  The goblet has a slight gold tone to it but with no space around it to help the black backdrop really define the glass it really looses a lot for me.  I started with a 3 but will go to a 4 for the overall clarity and clearness of the shot.', '2003-10-22 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(459386, 42410, 12448, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t read in that light! :)  Your poor eyes!   Okay, just kidding but the light does seem rather dark for reading and if it was bumped up a notch it would really add to the shot for me.  I like the subject matter you chose, very nice considering the recent breaking of some rule, even if by accident, myself being one of them! ;)  My first impression was a 3 vote, after coming back and looking more closely I''m going to a 6 for now, may be back again.</td>', 'I hope you don''t read in that light! :)  Your poor eyes!   Okay, just kidding but the light does seem rather dark for reading and if it was bumped up a notch it would really add to the shot for me.  I like the subject matter you chose, very nice considering the recent breaking of some rule, even if by accident, myself being one of them! ;)  My first impression was a 3 vote, after coming back and looking more closely I''m going to a 6 for now, may be back again.', '2003-10-22 22:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(459390, 42325, 12448, '<td valign="top">Where?  I''ve looked at this shot several times and each time I get a little dizzy from the way the circles go around but have yet been able to define the lightbulb itself, unless it''s a reflection of one and I''m missing that.  It''s also a bit on the small side, hard to really see what''s going on.  I started with a 3 but am going to bump to a 4 and will probably be back again.</td>', 'Where?  I''ve looked at this shot several times and each time I get a little dizzy from the way the circles go around but have yet been able to define the lightbulb itself, unless it''s a reflection of one and I''m missing that.  It''s also a bit on the small side, hard to really see what''s going on.  I started with a 3 but am going to bump to a 4 and will probably be back again.', '2003-10-22 22:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(459393, 42963, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the orange in this sky!  It''s so vibrant and rich!  But the rest of the shot really gets me, the dog and pond actually end up being a distraction for me, if the shot had been cropped higher and really concentrated on the sky and horizon this would have scored much higher with me.  Started with a 3 but bumping up to a 7 after another look :)</td>', 'I love the orange in this sky!  It''s so vibrant and rich!  But the rest of the shot really gets me, the dog and pond actually end up being a distraction for me, if the shot had been cropped higher and really concentrated on the sky and horizon this would have scored much higher with me.  Started with a 3 but bumping up to a 7 after another look :)', '2003-10-22 22:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(459432, 42958, 8610, '<td valign="top">Scary shit.... You got your point in a good and a straight way. Big plus for that - 9</td>', 'Scary shit.... You got your point in a good and a straight way. Big plus for that - 9', '2003-10-22 23:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(459465, 42819, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are bright and warm. The flow is also special. Because the background is the same color, it''s difficult to see all the lovely detail of the liquid.</td>', 'The colors are bright and warm. The flow is also special. Because the background is the same color, it''s difficult to see all the lovely detail of the liquid.', '2003-10-22 23:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(459477, 42717, 11800, '<td valign="top">Love the feeling of grace this offers. I would have been tempted to crop off the very low base and leave the flowers floating in space.</td>', 'Love the feeling of grace this offers. I would have been tempted to crop off the very low base and leave the flowers floating in space.', '2003-10-23 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(459486, 42842, 11800, '<td valign="top">They look like they are having fun. That''s a big plus and that''s what I like best about the picture.  There is so much happening, it''s hard to find something to focus on. So, to improve it, I would try to find one or two elements and work with them. Get in close maybe, to cut some of the surroundings out.</td>', 'They look like they are having fun. That''s a big plus and that''s what I like best about the picture.  There is so much happening, it''s hard to find something to focus on. So, to improve it, I would try to find one or two elements and work with them. Get in close maybe, to cut some of the surroundings out.', '2003-10-23 00:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(459515, 42383, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think the soft focus works perfectly here.  I love the colors and the lighting effect.  10.</td>', 'I think the soft focus works perfectly here.  I love the colors and the lighting effect.  10.', '2003-10-23 00:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(459516, 42963, 7350, '<td valign="top">I was going to give it a 9 until I stared a little longer and saw the dog.  That makes this a 10, hands down.  Beautiful colors, great composition!</td>', 'I was going to give it a 9 until I stared a little longer and saw the dog.  That makes this a 10, hands down.  Beautiful colors, great composition!', '2003-10-23 00:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459519, 42485, 7350, '<td valign="top">I know you can''t do anything about it, but the bar covering part of the statues head gets in the way.  Still, wonderful colors!  8.</td>', 'I know you can''t do anything about it, but the bar covering part of the statues head gets in the way.  Still, wonderful colors!  8.', '2003-10-23 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(459556, 42983, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image.  My thought here is that the lighting gives energy to this photo.  I almost feel as if I''m in the room hearing some loud music.  Very well shot - I like the composition and clarity is good.  I could almost see this in Rolling Stone magazine somewhere  :-)</td>', 'This is an excellent image.  My thought here is that the lighting gives energy to this photo.  I almost feel as if I''m in the room hearing some loud music.  Very well shot - I like the composition and clarity is good.  I could almost see this in Rolling Stone magazine somewhere  :-)', '2003-10-23 01:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(459559, 42985, 8125, '<td valign="top">This image just draws me in.  I almost feel like squinting when I look at it.  Composition, clarity and lighting - excellent.  Very well done!</td>', 'This image just draws me in.  I almost feel like squinting when I look at it.  Composition, clarity and lighting - excellent.  Very well done!', '2003-10-23 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(459565, 42986, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea for the challenge - but I wonder if the photo would be more profound with the pumpkins in focus.  I''m sure the look was intentional, I just think it detracts from the possibilities of the image.</td>', 'I really like this idea for the challenge - but I wonder if the photo would be more profound with the pumpkins in focus.  I''m sure the look was intentional, I just think it detracts from the possibilities of the image.', '2003-10-23 01:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(459566, 42954, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image!  My 2 favorite parts of this photo are the reflection in the lake and nice color of the sky.</td>', 'This is a very nice image!  My 2 favorite parts of this photo are the reflection in the lake and nice color of the sky.', '2003-10-23 01:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459568, 42677, 8125, '<td valign="top">A good macro image, but I can''t see much of the light.  Most of the image is ''shaded'' and your title lends itself to the cat laying in the sun.  I think I''d like to see more of that in the image.  I like how the whiskers seem to glow...</td>', 'A good macro image, but I can''t see much of the light.  Most of the image is ''shaded'' and your title lends itself to the cat laying in the sun.  I think I''d like to see more of that in the image.  I like how the whiskers seem to glow...', '2003-10-23 01:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(459569, 42884, 8125, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture.  Lighting, composition, clarity, colors - all excellent.  I like the color reflections in the water.  I can picture myself stopping the car to get out and take this scene in.  Very well shot - great work!  :-)</td>', 'A beautiful picture.  Lighting, composition, clarity, colors - all excellent.  I like the color reflections in the water.  I can picture myself stopping the car to get out and take this scene in.  Very well shot - great work!  :-)', '2003-10-23 01:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(459572, 42865, 8125, '<td valign="top">I can picture myself sitting on my sister''s porch in Northern Wisconsin looking at a scene such as this.  The colors of the sunset are beautiful.  The image seems a bit out of focus and there appears to be a slight tilt downwards to the left.</td>', 'I can picture myself sitting on my sister''s porch in Northern Wisconsin looking at a scene such as this.  The colors of the sunset are beautiful.  The image seems a bit out of focus and there appears to be a slight tilt downwards to the left.', '2003-10-23 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(459574, 42770, 8125, '<td valign="top">I find the frame a bit overwhelming and something in the bottom left is distracting my attention.  Great use of light on the pumpkin.</td>', 'I find the frame a bit overwhelming and something in the bottom left is distracting my attention.  Great use of light on the pumpkin.', '2003-10-23 01:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(459596, 42185, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture.  I would have loved to have seen it in B/W.</td>', 'Excellent picture.  I would have loved to have seen it in B/W.', '2003-10-23 01:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(459597, 42995, 7487, '<td valign="top">I''m really new to this.  You''re picture looks great.  I love the antique look to it.  I might have cropped a bit more on the right side.  It looks just a bit busy. Great pic overall!</td>', 'I''m really new to this.  You''re picture looks great.  I love the antique look to it.  I might have cropped a bit more on the right side.  It looks just a bit busy. Great pic overall!', '2003-10-23 01:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(459598, 42483, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture!</td>', 'Excellent picture!', '2003-10-23 01:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(459599, 42677, 7487, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, I love this pic!!!!!  Definitely says "Lazy day afternoon, and I ain''t budgin!!!!".  Great example of light, enhancing this picture overall!!!!</td>', 'Oh my gosh, I love this pic!!!!!  Definitely says "Lazy day afternoon, and I ain''t budgin!!!!".  Great example of light, enhancing this picture overall!!!!', '2003-10-23 01:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(459600, 42410, 13403, '<td valign="top">hehe .. humorous.</td>', 'hehe .. humorous.', '2003-10-23 01:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(459601, 42719, 13403, '<td valign="top">oh no.. this is creepy to me.    her listless eyes, gazing out at something off the picture.... it might be a pirate.. i''m scared.   hehe ;)</td>', 'oh no.. this is creepy to me.    her listless eyes, gazing out at something off the picture.... it might be a pirate.. i''m scared.   hehe ;)', '2003-10-23 01:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(459603, 43012, 13403, '<td valign="top">cooool ;)</td>', 'cooool ;)', '2003-10-23 01:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(459668, 42286, 7687, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the contrast between the orange and blue.  The veins in the leaf are so sharp, and the DOF is just right, great work!  The leaf in the foreground seems to be backlit by a white/blue light source, as well as lit by the sun.  Did you light this with a flash or two?</td>', 'Wow, I really like the contrast between the orange and blue.  The veins in the leaf are so sharp, and the DOF is just right, great work!  The leaf in the foreground seems to be backlit by a white/blue light source, as well as lit by the sun.  Did you light this with a flash or two?', '2003-10-23 03:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(459700, 42693, 12654, '<td valign="top">Its really great, i love the soft lighting on the picture.<br/>where are those light streaks coming from?</td>', 'Its really great, i love the soft lighting on the picture.where are those light streaks coming from?', '2003-10-23 06:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(459703, 42286, 12654, '<td valign="top">love the colours on this - great work.<br/>The detail is really good !<br/>looking at this pic I wished that autumn would have lasted longer here in russia  - coz soon its gonna -25 below zero.<br/>AAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/>cant wait to get back home to Sri Lanka.<br/></td>', 'love the colours on this - great work.The detail is really good !looking at this pic I wished that autumn would have lasted longer here in russia  - coz soon its gonna -25 below zero.AAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!cant wait to get back home to Sri Lanka.', '2003-10-23 06:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(459704, 42483, 12654, '<td valign="top">Thsi is really nice - please tell me how you achieved this effect.<br/></td>', 'Thsi is really nice - please tell me how you achieved this effect.', '2003-10-23 06:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(459706, 42822, 12654, '<td valign="top">I love it - very surrealistic - i was hoping to see a fairy in the background - hiding away.</td>', 'I love it - very surrealistic - i was hoping to see a fairy in the background - hiding away.', '2003-10-23 06:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(459745, 42325, 7304, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Almost doesn''t look like a lightbulb. Kind of looks like a shell. Great light and the color is very pleasing. I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Interesting. Almost doesn''t look like a lightbulb. Kind of looks like a shell. Great light and the color is very pleasing. I gave you a 7.', '2003-10-23 07:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(459747, 42286, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and color. DOF directs you to the main leaf and you have a directional where your three connect and your eye ends up there. Composition is great. I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Nice detail and color. DOF directs you to the main leaf and you have a directional where your three connect and your eye ends up there. Composition is great. I gave you a 7.', '2003-10-23 07:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(459748, 42607, 7304, '<td valign="top">When the bell tolls. Nice light and spooky. Nice clarity.</td>', 'When the bell tolls. Nice light and spooky. Nice clarity.', '2003-10-23 07:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459749, 42921, 7304, '<td valign="top">Love the feel of this shot. Great idea. Nice use of light and it is perfect for the season. I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Love the feel of this shot. Great idea. Nice use of light and it is perfect for the season. I gave you a 7.', '2003-10-23 08:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(459772, 42286, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm colour on the leaves but I find the left side of the frame a little too dark overall. Very evocative of Autumn though.</td>', 'Beautiful warm colour on the leaves but I find the left side of the frame a little too dark overall. Very evocative of Autumn though.', '2003-10-23 08:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(459773, 42537, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the bubbles in the liquid and the play of light and shadow on the different surfaces. Would prefer the spotlight to be more accurately centred.</td>', 'Like the bubbles in the liquid and the play of light and shadow on the different surfaces. Would prefer the spotlight to be more accurately centred.', '2003-10-23 08:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(459776, 42983, 3087, '<td valign="top">Superb composition using the lighting, singer and mike stand.<br/>The way one of the streams of lights backlights the mike and his face so well is excellent.</td>', 'Superb composition using the lighting, singer and mike stand.The way one of the streams of lights backlights the mike and his face so well is excellent.', '2003-10-23 08:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(459780, 42700, 3087, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes this feel like a painting. A touch harsh above her right breast, but just right on her face, torso and legs. I like the way the arms are in shadow.</td>', 'The lighting makes this feel like a painting. A touch harsh above her right breast, but just right on her face, torso and legs. I like the way the arms are in shadow.', '2003-10-23 08:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(459781, 42483, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette - I''d prefer them walking into rather than out of the frame though.</td>', 'Nice silhouette - I''d prefer them walking into rather than out of the frame though.', '2003-10-23 08:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(459782, 42902, 3087, '<td valign="top">Composition is really strong for me - I like the curved diagonal and the way it completely slices up the frame. I love the dark upper right corner. Although I like how the light spills out into the lower left area, I''d prefer the very lower left corner to be a richer black, to balance the top right corner. I like low DOF but feel it could have a touch more DOF in this case or possibly the same low DOF but the point of focus to be a touch further back along the tube.</td>', 'Composition is really strong for me - I like the curved diagonal and the way it completely slices up the frame. I love the dark upper right corner. Although I like how the light spills out into the lower left area, I''d prefer the very lower left corner to be a richer black, to balance the top right corner. I like low DOF but feel it could have a touch more DOF in this case or possibly the same low DOF but the point of focus to be a touch further back along the tube.', '2003-10-23 08:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(459784, 42893, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the limited colour palette and low light very much. I feel it could do with a very slight crop at the left or a touch more space on the right, but that''s minimal and based on "instinctive feeling" not anything concrete about composition "rules".</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the limited colour palette and low light very much. I feel it could do with a very slight crop at the left or a touch more space on the right, but that''s minimal and based on "instinctive feeling" not anything concrete about composition "rules".', '2003-10-23 08:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(459787, 42087, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is creative, unique, gritty, enigmatic. I like it very much. My only negative feeling is that composition is not as strong as it could be. Too much space at left and right and not enough below. Could do with a touch more above too. I think it would suit a slightly squarer frame ratio better.</td>', 'This is creative, unique, gritty, enigmatic. I like it very much. My only negative feeling is that composition is not as strong as it could be. Too much space at left and right and not enough below. Could do with a touch more above too. I think it would suit a slightly squarer frame ratio better.', '2003-10-23 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(459789, 42685, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the image, the pose, the high grain and the darkness of shadow. The direction of lighting is great. My main problem is the perspective - Floor boards and angle of wall to floor makes me feel like I want to take a step to the side. Would prefer to lose the socket on the wall too or to have it positioned elsewhere.</td>', 'I like the image, the pose, the high grain and the darkness of shadow. The direction of lighting is great. My main problem is the perspective - Floor boards and angle of wall to floor makes me feel like I want to take a step to the side. Would prefer to lose the socket on the wall too or to have it positioned elsewhere.', '2003-10-23 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(459796, 42855, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the color tones are so warm. I almost feel like putting my sunglasses on :-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the color tones are so warm. I almost feel like putting my sunglasses on :-)', '2003-10-23 09:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(459798, 43018, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now how did you get that background so dark and at the same time the colors on the balloons so bright?  Nice composition, love the color tones there.</td>', 'Now how did you get that background so dark and at the same time the colors on the balloons so bright?  Nice composition, love the color tones there.', '2003-10-23 09:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(459803, 42719, 5728, '<td valign="top">Like it, like it :-) Good lighting and I particularly like the perspective you chose. Were you up a ladder? Sonja?</td>', 'Like it, like it :-) Good lighting and I particularly like the perspective you chose. Were you up a ladder? Sonja?', '2003-10-23 09:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(459807, 42958, 11073, '<td valign="top">Sweet! - hope this one medals.  My suggestion is for Post Competition: Clone out the fire detector- maybe even the light fixture- to make the ceiling less busy.  Just a thought.  Really cool pic.  Nice work.</td>', 'Sweet! - hope this one medals.  My suggestion is for Post Competition: Clone out the fire detector- maybe even the light fixture- to make the ceiling less busy.  Just a thought.  Really cool pic.  Nice work.', '2003-10-23 09:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(459810, 42946, 5728, '<td valign="top">The blue and black work well together. I like this pic with its play of light and shadows.</td>', 'The blue and black work well together. I like this pic with its play of light and shadows.', '2003-10-23 09:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(459811, 43009, 11073, '<td valign="top">that''s really cool - nice to see a subject that most others can''t see/get to.  The trail in the sky is a nice bonus to the shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'that''s really cool - nice to see a subject that most others can''t see/get to.  The trail in the sky is a nice bonus to the shot.  Nice work.', '2003-10-23 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(459816, 42983, 11073, '<td valign="top">that''s freakin'' amazing.  nice work. I''d give you an eleven if they had it.</td>', 'that''s freakin'' amazing.  nice work. I''d give you an eleven if they had it.', '2003-10-23 09:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(459822, 42769, 12448, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot jumps out at you on the thumbnail shots and when you get here you need to put on your shades! :)  THe way it cuts into his face is very dramatic but a bit overpowering for me.  You can see the almost rapturous expression on his face, not as intense as the light.  Overall not a bad shot, just a bit overpowering for me.  I started at a 4 but am going up to a 6</td>', 'The lighting on this shot jumps out at you on the thumbnail shots and when you get here you need to put on your shades! :)  THe way it cuts into his face is very dramatic but a bit overpowering for me.  You can see the almost rapturous expression on his face, not as intense as the light.  Overall not a bad shot, just a bit overpowering for me.  I started at a 4 but am going up to a 6', '2003-10-23 09:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(459824, 42916, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot would have been perfect for the "All Alone" challenge.  The composition is well done, good cropping overall but I''m not sure I like the color in the shirt so much with the rest of the shot black and white.  I personally find it distracting and keep finding myself drawn to the shirt.  I started at a 4 the first time around but am going to a 7</td>', 'This shot would have been perfect for the "All Alone" challenge.  The composition is well done, good cropping overall but I''m not sure I like the color in the shirt so much with the rest of the shot black and white.  I personally find it distracting and keep finding myself drawn to the shirt.  I started at a 4 the first time around but am going to a 7', '2003-10-23 09:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(459831, 43011, 12448, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t really jump at me,  maybe if the cropping was a little tighter, too much space around the stack and it was reflecting even more.  A 4 for now</td>', 'The shot doesn''t really jump at me,  maybe if the cropping was a little tighter, too much space around the stack and it was reflecting even more.  A 4 for now', '2003-10-23 09:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(459921, 42805, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not the biggest fan of low-key/ darker images so take my comments with a pinch of salt... although that applies to all my comments anyway...<br/>I like the composition, the diagonal of the wood across the frame is interesting. The background black is rich, clean and really highlights the lighting on the wood itself. I like the textures of the wood but am straining to really see them in detail.</td>', 'I''m not the biggest fan of low-key/ darker images so take my comments with a pinch of salt... although that applies to all my comments anyway...I like the composition, the diagonal of the wood across the frame is interesting. The background black is rich, clean and really highlights the lighting on the wood itself. I like the textures of the wood but am straining to really see them in detail.', '2003-10-23 11:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459926, 42693, 6008, '<td valign="top">This certainly has a interesting visual/mood. I''m not sure what the building is, but it looks like there is a fire inside and the streaks are sparks and smoke. The orange inside the building are warm and appealing and sets the tone of the shot. The ''halo-like'' effect of the smoke makes it almost supernatural. I think the composition could have probably been improved slightly, although not sure how and this may have been the best angle, I dont really know. I''m not sure if you did the angle to get the sun/moon in just that spot or to try and hide it. Either way it has a good feel to it, certainly captured  a mood.</td>', 'This certainly has a interesting visual/mood. I''m not sure what the building is, but it looks like there is a fire inside and the streaks are sparks and smoke. The orange inside the building are warm and appealing and sets the tone of the shot. The ''halo-like'' effect of the smoke makes it almost supernatural. I think the composition could have probably been improved slightly, although not sure how and this may have been the best angle, I dont really know. I''m not sure if you did the angle to get the sun/moon in just that spot or to try and hide it. Either way it has a good feel to it, certainly captured  a mood.', '2003-10-23 11:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(459952, 42887, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone and mood of this. It''s not the clearest or sharpest pic out there, but I dont think it needs to be. Contrasts are good, visually it''s like a glimpse into a dream. I like it!</td>', 'I really like the tone and mood of this. It''s not the clearest or sharpest pic out there, but I dont think it needs to be. Contrasts are good, visually it''s like a glimpse into a dream. I like it!', '2003-10-23 11:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(459976, 42483, 9964, '<td valign="top">yes it is, nice job!</td>', 'yes it is, nice job!', '2003-10-23 12:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(459977, 42788, 9964, '<td valign="top">very cool!</td>', 'very cool!', '2003-10-23 12:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459979, 42759, 9964, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot!</td>', 'beautiful shot!', '2003-10-23 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459981, 42700, 9964, '<td valign="top">beautiful work and subject!</td>', 'beautiful work and subject!', '2003-10-23 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
