(460073, 42674, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect. Wonder what it would have looked like if we could see more of the front of the cat and the light reflecting off it from the Jackolantern.</td>', 'Very nice effect. Wonder what it would have looked like if we could see more of the front of the cat and the light reflecting off it from the Jackolantern.', '2003-10-23 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
