(460263, 42822, 5112, '<td valign="top">Looks like the sun reflecting on a pond on a cloudy day - is it?  It probably is something else ... I like it, though.  I like the silhouettes of the grasses, and the shine of the stuff floating on the water.  ~8</td>', 'Looks like the sun reflecting on a pond on a cloudy day - is it?  It probably is something else ... I like it, though.  I like the silhouettes of the grasses, and the shine of the stuff floating on the water.  ~8', '2003-10-23 16:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(460264, 42519, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette, nice clouds, good colour!  ~8</td>', 'Good silhouette, nice clouds, good colour!  ~8', '2003-10-23 16:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(460269, 42591, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pattern!  Is that a shade behind the palm leaf?</td>', 'Beautiful pattern!  Is that a shade behind the palm leaf?', '2003-10-23 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(460271, 42773, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I like this picture!  Have you tried it upside down?  For some reason I keep thinking it also would look really good upside down (maybe not :))  ~10</td>', 'Beautiful, I like this picture!  Have you tried it upside down?  For some reason I keep thinking it also would look really good upside down (maybe not :))  ~10', '2003-10-23 16:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(460274, 42871, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, where is this?  Beautiful blues (almost purple, a bit greenish in spots).</td>', 'Wow, where is this?  Beautiful blues (almost purple, a bit greenish in spots).', '2003-10-23 17:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(460285, 42597, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the scenery and I love the light rays, but the lens flares are a little distracting.  As I was scrolling down to see the whole piece, I found that I really liked the light effect if the sun part was cropped out with just the rays coming in and hitting the ground.  All in all it has a nice impact on me, did I mention I love the light rays?  ;)  7</td>', 'I like the scenery and I love the light rays, but the lens flares are a little distracting.  As I was scrolling down to see the whole piece, I found that I really liked the light effect if the sun part was cropped out with just the rays coming in and hitting the ground.  All in all it has a nice impact on me, did I mention I love the light rays?  ;)  7', '2003-10-23 17:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(460290, 42993, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice different subject.  I like the focus, great detail.  Corn looks mighty interesting all close up.  The lighting is great, really helps reflect the title.  Very nice.  7</td>', 'A nice different subject.  I like the focus, great detail.  Corn looks mighty interesting all close up.  The lighting is great, really helps reflect the title.  Very nice.  7', '2003-10-23 17:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(460313, 42843, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting really is beautiful here. It gives colour and warmth as well as light. The way it catches on the model''s hair is particularly appealing. However the content of the image doesn''t grab me. The pose of the girl feels unnatural, I''d prefer a (faked) walking position. The trees, trunks and shrubs within the frame are somewhat messy, the shapes they form don''t make for a particularly good composition, in terms of light, shadow and form. I do like the diagonal of the road surface but the actual colour of it feels out of place.<br/></td>', 'Lighting really is beautiful here. It gives colour and warmth as well as light. The way it catches on the model''s hair is particularly appealing. However the content of the image doesn''t grab me. The pose of the girl feels unnatural, I''d prefer a (faked) walking position. The trees, trunks and shrubs within the frame are somewhat messy, the shapes they form don''t make for a particularly good composition, in terms of light, shadow and form. I do like the diagonal of the road surface but the actual colour of it feels out of place.', '2003-10-23 17:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(460341, 42884, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love your shot - which instantly reminded me of mine: <br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=38467<br/> <br/>Your angle is good with a real feeling of the expanse of water, and of course Tower Bridge looks great as usual. The bright areas are ever so slightly over-exposed.</td>', 'I love your shot - which instantly reminded me of mine: //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=38467 Your angle is good with a real feeling of the expanse of water, and of course Tower Bridge looks great as usual. The bright areas are ever so slightly over-exposed.', '2003-10-23 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(460370, 43012, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cute! Well done, I like the warm orange tones in your image. This is fantastic. It strikes me as funny that I''ve hardly ever see a pumpkin before in a challenge and there are 4 or 5 of them in this one.</td>', 'Cute! Well done, I like the warm orange tones in your image. This is fantastic. It strikes me as funny that I''ve hardly ever see a pumpkin before in a challenge and there are 4 or 5 of them in this one.', '2003-10-23 18:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(460469, 42983, 3981, '<td valign="top">In the past, I have seen other images similar to this, but this one is better than any of them.  Superb composition! Clarity and color are also wonderful.  I even forgive the glare of the lights, because after all, that is what this image is all about. The overall presentation rates a 9 from me.  Well done!</td>', 'In the past, I have seen other images similar to this, but this one is better than any of them.  Superb composition! Clarity and color are also wonderful.  I even forgive the glare of the lights, because after all, that is what this image is all about. The overall presentation rates a 9 from me.  Well done!', '2003-10-23 20:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(460470, 42871, 3981, '<td valign="top">Winner, for sure.  Superb in every detail. I love the "other world-ly" feel of it.</td>', 'Winner, for sure.  Superb in every detail. I love the "other world-ly" feel of it.', '2003-10-23 20:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(460486, 42483, 10402, '<td valign="top">Silhouettes are always so flat, but there are enough clues on the beach to give this image some depth.</td>', 'Silhouettes are always so flat, but there are enough clues on the beach to give this image some depth.', '2003-10-23 20:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(460487, 42993, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, made dynamic by the diagonal lines. But those lines lead the eye to the bright spot and out of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting subject, made dynamic by the diagonal lines. But those lines lead the eye to the bright spot and out of the photo.', '2003-10-23 20:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(460493, 42918, 10402, '<td valign="top">The three rays are nice and lead the eye to the sun, which is nicely framed by the trees and clouds. So the sun is clearly the center of interest here, but you can''t really see it and it isn''t that interesting; it''s just bright. Of course, that is the main characteristic of the sun, and that is the main message I get from this image. Perfect for the challenge!</td>', 'The three rays are nice and lead the eye to the sun, which is nicely framed by the trees and clouds. So the sun is clearly the center of interest here, but you can''t really see it and it isn''t that interesting; it''s just bright. Of course, that is the main characteristic of the sun, and that is the main message I get from this image. Perfect for the challenge!', '2003-10-23 21:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(460501, 42110, 10402, '<td valign="top">The contours of the "landscape" draw my eye right to the darkish round object that looks like an acorn cap, but I don''t find it very interesting.</td>', 'The contours of the "landscape" draw my eye right to the darkish round object that looks like an acorn cap, but I don''t find it very interesting.', '2003-10-23 21:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(460505, 42981, 10402, '<td valign="top">The backlighting has a nice effect, but I''m glad you used fill lighting to keep the model from being a silhouette; that would have been rather boring. But the silhouette treatment of the bottom part of the photo works well. You''ve really controlled the light well, and that was the goal of this challenge! I think the branches at the top add a nice touch; the model is looking up and it shows that there is something up there to look at.</td>', 'The backlighting has a nice effect, but I''m glad you used fill lighting to keep the model from being a silhouette; that would have been rather boring. But the silhouette treatment of the bottom part of the photo works well. You''ve really controlled the light well, and that was the goal of this challenge! I think the branches at the top add a nice touch; the model is looking up and it shows that there is something up there to look at.', '2003-10-23 21:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(460507, 42815, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity and color...nice composition.</td>', 'wonderful clarity and color...nice composition.', '2003-10-23 21:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(460508, 42916, 9441, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I love the hues in the boy, contrasting with the background.  I like the mood of this photo.  Beautiful job!  10.</td>', 'Awesome!  I love the hues in the boy, contrasting with the background.  I like the mood of this photo.  Beautiful job!  10.', '2003-10-23 21:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(460509, 42759, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture of light, and shadow.  Nice texture and detail.  Good clarity...10</td>', 'wonderful capture of light, and shadow.  Nice texture and detail.  Good clarity...10', '2003-10-23 21:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(460510, 42325, 9441, '<td valign="top">cool shot...creates a very intriguing photo.</td>', 'cool shot...creates a very intriguing photo.', '2003-10-23 21:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(460515, 43012, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and a great use of lighting. The very soft shadow gives just the effect I''m sure you intended.</td>', 'Very creative, and a great use of lighting. The very soft shadow gives just the effect I''m sure you intended.', '2003-10-23 21:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(460517, 42717, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job.  Wonderful lighting, terrific subject chosen.  I love the setup.  The long, vertical lines of this photo are fabulous!  A 10.</td>', 'Beautiful job.  Wonderful lighting, terrific subject chosen.  I love the setup.  The long, vertical lines of this photo are fabulous!  A 10.', '2003-10-23 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(460540, 42503, 9441, '<td valign="top">This is such a pretty photo..the softness of it makes it appear as if it were a painting.  Beautiful landscape choice for this photo.  Terrific job.</td>', 'This is such a pretty photo..the softness of it makes it appear as if it were a painting.  Beautiful landscape choice for this photo.  Terrific job.', '2003-10-23 22:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(460543, 42921, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this "Jacko"-Lantern before!</td>', 'I''ve seen this "Jacko"-Lantern before!', '2003-10-23 22:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(460547, 42697, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice texture and detail in this photo.  The soft lighting is a plus.</td>', 'nice texture and detail in this photo.  The soft lighting is a plus.', '2003-10-23 22:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(460550, 42719, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting and noise work with the models expression and pose to give this a nice pensive mood. There is too much dynamic range for the camera to properly capture, but you''ve compensated very well, putting detail in the important shadow areas rather than the highlights.</td>', 'The lighting and noise work with the models expression and pose to give this a nice pensive mood. There is too much dynamic range for the camera to properly capture, but you''ve compensated very well, putting detail in the important shadow areas rather than the highlights.', '2003-10-23 22:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(460576, 42882, 8125, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture, this is a very peaceful scene.  My only wish would be that the sun had set just a tiny bit more and you might have avoided the slight ''flare''.  Although in some respects this really adds to the image also.  Very nice work.  :-)</td>', 'A beautiful picture, this is a very peaceful scene.  My only wish would be that the sun had set just a tiny bit more and you might have avoided the slight ''flare''.  Although in some respects this really adds to the image also.  Very nice work.  :-)', '2003-10-23 22:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(460582, 42958, 8125, '<td valign="top">This submission could also qualify well as a nightmare.  :-)  A well taken shot.  I like your composition and choice of light.  The red really adds to the mood and feeling.  Very well done!</td>', 'This submission could also qualify well as a nightmare.  :-)  A well taken shot.  I like your composition and choice of light.  The red really adds to the mood and feeling.  Very well done!', '2003-10-23 22:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(460586, 42991, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like your idea for this challenge.  I wish I couldn''t see what appears to be dividers between the glasses, althought that could have been intentional?  The shot is set up well and each glass is clearly defined with it''s own color.  Nicely done.  :-)</td>', 'I like your idea for this challenge.  I wish I couldn''t see what appears to be dividers between the glasses, althought that could have been intentional?  The shot is set up well and each glass is clearly defined with it''s own color.  Nicely done.  :-)', '2003-10-23 22:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(460591, 42991, 9441, '<td valign="top">cool setup...creates nice show of color.  Good lighting.</td>', 'cool setup...creates nice show of color.  Good lighting.', '2003-10-23 22:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(460595, 42864, 9441, '<td valign="top">cool effect...great colors.</td>', 'cool effect...great colors.', '2003-10-23 22:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(460597, 42483, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of shooting into the sun to create the silhouette.  This use of lighting gives the impression of a great day at the beach coming to a close... your younger subject seems happy and carefree.</td>', 'I like your choice of shooting into the sun to create the silhouette.  This use of lighting gives the impression of a great day at the beach coming to a close... your younger subject seems happy and carefree.', '2003-10-23 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(460603, 42483, 9441, '<td valign="top">terrific lighting!  I love the silhouettes, the sand looks wonderful, so sleek.</td>', 'terrific lighting!  I love the silhouettes, the sand looks wonderful, so sleek.', '2003-10-23 22:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(460609, 42185, 9441, '<td valign="top">Wow...I love the fog, such a wonderful mistiness.  Great reflection capture...wonderful soft lighting.</td>', 'Wow...I love the fog, such a wonderful mistiness.  Great reflection capture...wonderful soft lighting.', '2003-10-23 22:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(460612, 42918, 8125, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great image - I love the silhouette and flare from the sun - image clarity is strong - I can''t find anything I don''t like about it... Well done!  :-)</td>', 'I think this is a great image - I love the silhouette and flare from the sun - image clarity is strong - I can''t find anything I don''t like about it... Well done!  :-)', '2003-10-23 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(460620, 42816, 8125, '<td valign="top">I think the flash is far too bright and dominant in this image.  That may have been your intention - but I don''t think it''s a strong point.  It may have been better if you were further away from the subject and some of that bright light could have diffused a bit.</td>', 'I think the flash is far too bright and dominant in this image.  That may have been your intention - but I don''t think it''s a strong point.  It may have been better if you were further away from the subject and some of that bright light could have diffused a bit.', '2003-10-23 22:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(460629, 42925, 4338, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting building, great lighting</td>', 'this is a very interesting building, great lighting', '2003-10-23 22:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(460631, 42952, 8125, '<td valign="top">A very cool image indeed!  Very nice composition and I love the use of red lighting.  The silhouette is exceptional.</td>', 'A very cool image indeed!  Very nice composition and I love the use of red lighting.  The silhouette is exceptional.', '2003-10-23 22:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(460638, 42877, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture of your subject choice, I have spent some time studying it and I just don''t see how it applies to the use of lighting to create a mood tone.  I was hoping to use the title to help piece it together and that isn''t helping me either...</td>', 'This is an interesting picture of your subject choice, I have spent some time studying it and I just don''t see how it applies to the use of lighting to create a mood tone.  I was hoping to use the title to help piece it together and that isn''t helping me either...', '2003-10-23 22:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(460640, 42666, 8125, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting on your subject.  I like the composition.  I feel some energy from this shot as if a band member is going to pop out any second now and start singing.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting on your subject.  I like the composition.  I feel some energy from this shot as if a band member is going to pop out any second now and start singing.', '2003-10-23 22:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(460642, 42992, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice shot, this is a very cool looking bridge</td>', 'nice shot, this is a very cool looking bridge', '2003-10-23 22:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(460650, 42925, 9441, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, fabulous color!  Very cool photo.  I love the subject choice.  The people moving about give this a wonderful mood and create much interest''.....10 from me!</td>', 'Awesome lighting, fabulous color!  Very cool photo.  I love the subject choice.  The people moving about give this a wonderful mood and create much interest''.....10 from me!', '2003-10-23 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(460651, 42438, 8125, '<td valign="top">As I look at the photograph I smell my favorite candle scent, Cinnamon Vanilla.  This says to me serenity and solitude, although her face may have a slightly troubled look about it - I imagine her ready to blow the candle out before going to sleep.</td>', 'As I look at the photograph I smell my favorite candle scent, Cinnamon Vanilla.  This says to me serenity and solitude, although her face may have a slightly troubled look about it - I imagine her ready to blow the candle out before going to sleep.', '2003-10-23 22:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460658, 42916, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo - if it were someone I knew, I''d probably frame it.  I like the desaturation and leaving just his shirt color, it really makes him stand out as the subject and I''m not looking at his surroundings as much.  I am having some trouble seeing how the lighting is creating the mood tone though - the expression and posture of the boy is what is really creating that for me.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice photo - if it were someone I knew, I''d probably frame it.  I like the desaturation and leaving just his shirt color, it really makes him stand out as the subject and I''m not looking at his surroundings as much.  I am having some trouble seeing how the lighting is creating the mood tone though - the expression and posture of the boy is what is really creating that for me.  Nice work.', '2003-10-23 22:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(460662, 42887, 8125, '<td valign="top">There are many things about this photo that set the mood tone - not just the lighting.  The surroundings of your subject, his posture - he almost looks dejected, sad.  The lighting really helps pull that feeling in.  I do have 2 picks though - I wish the shadow weren''t so prominant at the bottom of the image and it seems a little too sharp.  Nice work creating an emotive feeling.  :-)</td>', 'There are many things about this photo that set the mood tone - not just the lighting.  The surroundings of your subject, his posture - he almost looks dejected, sad.  The lighting really helps pull that feeling in.  I do have 2 picks though - I wish the shadow weren''t so prominant at the bottom of the image and it seems a little too sharp.  Nice work creating an emotive feeling.  :-)', '2003-10-23 22:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(460678, 42719, 806, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful and interesting portrait. nice job on the lighting.. love the angle!</td>', 'this is a wonderful and interesting portrait. nice job on the lighting.. love the angle!', '2003-10-23 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(460680, 43014, 806, '<td valign="top">incredible shot! I could do without the watch.. but that is minor to the whole.</td>', 'incredible shot! I could do without the watch.. but that is minor to the whole.', '2003-10-23 23:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460722, 43018, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image!  I don''t really know what to say about it, except, I really like it!!  :-)</td>', 'This is an excellent image!  I don''t really know what to say about it, except, I really like it!!  :-)', '2003-10-23 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(460741, 43002, 772, '<td valign="top">is ''beeee-friggin-utiful'' a word? :) = 10</td>', 'is ''beeee-friggin-utiful'' a word? :) = 10', '2003-10-23 23:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(460748, 43002, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptional photo - I love the texture and color of the background.  I love the composition.  Lighting, colors, DOF - all great!  The only thing I''m bugged about is the wheat - but that''s just a personal choice.  I''ve pictured this in my mind without the wheat and it still looks great to me.  Good choice with the framing - all around and excellent shot - I definately see a ribbon on this one!  :-)</td>', 'This is an exceptional photo - I love the texture and color of the background.  I love the composition.  Lighting, colors, DOF - all great!  The only thing I''m bugged about is the wheat - but that''s just a personal choice.  I''ve pictured this in my mind without the wheat and it still looks great to me.  Good choice with the framing - all around and excellent shot - I definately see a ribbon on this one!  :-)', '2003-10-23 23:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(460780, 42438, 10402, '<td valign="top">The low-key treatment matches the candlelight and the models expression. Not too sharp and nice composition.</td>', 'The low-key treatment matches the candlelight and the models expression. Not too sharp and nice composition.', '2003-10-24 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(460788, 42666, 10402, '<td valign="top">Cropped a bit tighter than conventional wisdom would suggest, but I like it. The noise on the well-blurred background works well here.</td>', 'Cropped a bit tighter than conventional wisdom would suggest, but I like it. The noise on the well-blurred background works well here.', '2003-10-24 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(460806, 42161, 10402, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit too high key for the model''s hair. The contrast between face and hair is a bit stark. But the composition and soft focus are great.</td>', 'I think this is a bit too high key for the model''s hair. The contrast between face and hair is a bit stark. But the composition and soft focus are great.', '2003-10-24 00:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(460809, 42992, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting nicely shows the interesting shapes and textures of this bridge.</td>', 'The lighting nicely shows the interesting shapes and textures of this bridge.', '2003-10-24 00:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(460817, 43009, 10402, '<td valign="top">The different elements of this image work very well together.</td>', 'The different elements of this image work very well together.', '2003-10-24 00:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(460819, 43002, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting works very well here to backlight the plant, bring out the texture of the jug, and cast a nice shadow all at once.</td>', 'The lighting works very well here to backlight the plant, bring out the texture of the jug, and cast a nice shadow all at once.', '2003-10-24 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(460821, 42185, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the way the smokestack is lost in the glare.</td>', 'I like the way the smokestack is lost in the glare.', '2003-10-24 00:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(460824, 42607, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow on one side and reflection on the other.</td>', 'I like the shadow on one side and reflection on the other.', '2003-10-24 00:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(460874, 42286, 9441, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful, warm color.  Terrific lighting on the leaves.</td>', 'Such beautiful, warm color.  Terrific lighting on the leaves.', '2003-10-24 02:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(460909, 42693, 12902, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. I wish I could say better why, but I don''t know much. I just love the feeling that this picture gives me. It is a surrealistic looking imagine. I hope everybody will see what is obvious. It is a top 3 I will say now because I haven''t seen all the images yet. But even after I would have seen them all, the beauty of this one, will still remain unchanged.  :) Good luck!</td>', 'I love this picture. I wish I could say better why, but I don''t know much. I just love the feeling that this picture gives me. It is a surrealistic looking imagine. I hope everybody will see what is obvious. It is a top 3 I will say now because I haven''t seen all the images yet. But even after I would have seen them all, the beauty of this one, will still remain unchanged.  :) Good luck!', '2003-10-24 03:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
