(460912, 42717, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Neat image, awsome compositions. I will find it again in top ten, I am sure, maybe with a ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Neat image, awsome compositions. I will find it again in top ten, I am sure, maybe with a ribbon.', '2003-10-24 03:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
