(460935, 42539, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice and full of colour. Looks well focused and the image is clear.  Would look even better with a ribbon by the title.</td>', 'Nice and full of colour. Looks well focused and the image is clear.  Would look even better with a ribbon by the title.', '2003-10-24 03:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(460936, 42882, 12902, '<td valign="top">This should be available as a print after the challenge will be over. Really nice and clear. Excellent picture.</td>', 'This should be available as a print after the challenge will be over. Really nice and clear. Excellent picture.', '2003-10-24 04:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(460938, 42995, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the light! Nobody can''t complain this one is not on the subject. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice capture of the light! Nobody can''t complain this one is not on the subject. Good luck!', '2003-10-24 04:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(460939, 42666, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. The idea is also very good. I am sure the average will be very high.</td>', 'Nice picture. The idea is also very good. I am sure the average will be very high.', '2003-10-24 04:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(460942, 42950, 12902, '<td valign="top">This looks great and the model is simply beautiful. The backlight gives a surrealistic look to the picture. Will do good I am sure.</td>', 'This looks great and the model is simply beautiful. The backlight gives a surrealistic look to the picture. Will do good I am sure.', '2003-10-24 04:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(460945, 42982, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and gorgious looking model. :) Congratulations for both!</td>', 'Nice idea and gorgious looking model. :) Congratulations for both!', '2003-10-24 04:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(460947, 42719, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful looking star! She is a sweetheart! Was the grainy effect intended or you just sharpened it a bit too much?</td>', 'Wonderful looking star! She is a sweetheart! Was the grainy effect intended or you just sharpened it a bit too much?', '2003-10-24 04:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(460948, 42701, 12902, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea! I like it!</td>', 'This is a great idea! I like it!', '2003-10-24 04:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(460949, 42991, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture! It is running for the ribbons I think.</td>', 'Excellent picture! It is running for the ribbons I think.', '2003-10-24 04:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(460951, 42685, 12902, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy effect on it as well as the B/W choice.</td>', 'I like the grainy effect on it as well as the B/W choice.', '2003-10-24 04:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(460953, 42759, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and nice picture too. Looks like top ten to me.</td>', 'Excellent idea and nice picture too. Looks like top ten to me.', '2003-10-24 04:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(460955, 42981, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I like the use of the backlight. The rule of thirds is well used. Good luck with it!</td>', 'Nice picture. I like the use of the backlight. The rule of thirds is well used. Good luck with it!', '2003-10-24 04:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(460967, 42925, 13500, '<td valign="top">This photograph is absolutely beautiful. I like the blue hue that the grid illuminates onto the trees. And the building in the background is beautiful. I almost wish the people weren''t in the photo.</td>', 'This photograph is absolutely beautiful. I like the blue hue that the grid illuminates onto the trees. And the building in the background is beautiful. I almost wish the people weren''t in the photo.', '2003-10-24 05:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(461029, 42380, 7687, '<td valign="top">Normally, images that feature a blown out moon are not very appealing to me.  Your shot, on the other hand, is something entirely different.  In your image, the moon takes on a whole new life, it doesn''t look remind me of the moon at all, but rather a spaceship or SOMETHING very mysterious.  This whole image has an "other worldlieness" to it, from the ground (which appears to be sand?) to the sky, of which you''ve captured the stars quite nicely.  <br/> <br/>I''m assuming you used a larger aperture with a shorter shutter speed (no star trails and barely a hint of the star effect from the moon), which was a great choice in this case.  I like how the person''s hair is backlit by the moon, that really adds to the amount of detail in the image and gives it a bit more depth.  <br/> <br/>Overall I thought this was one of the better images in the contest.  Good work! <br/>-Quadrajet</td>', 'Normally, images that feature a blown out moon are not very appealing to me.  Your shot, on the other hand, is something entirely different.  In your image, the moon takes on a whole new life, it doesn''t look remind me of the moon at all, but rather a spaceship or SOMETHING very mysterious.  This whole image has an "other worldlieness" to it, from the ground (which appears to be sand?) to the sky, of which you''ve captured the stars quite nicely.   I''m assuming you used a larger aperture with a shorter shutter speed (no star trails and barely a hint of the star effect from the moon), which was a great choice in this case.  I like how the person''s hair is backlit by the moon, that really adds to the amount of detail in the image and gives it a bit more depth.   Overall I thought this was one of the better images in the contest.  Good work! -Quadrajet', '2003-10-24 08:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(461032, 42537, 7687, '<td valign="top">I think the thing that appeals to me most about this image is the color.  For some reason, the play of the color through the glass, the liquid and reflected off the...umm thing the glass is on is wonderful.  The second most appealing aspect of this image is the symmetry that''s occuring throughout the whole image...of course that doesn''t need explaining.  My only critique would be the fact that the image seems cropped a bit tighter on the right side than on the left.  Other than that, this image is simple, elegant and beautiful.</td>', 'I think the thing that appeals to me most about this image is the color.  For some reason, the play of the color through the glass, the liquid and reflected off the...umm thing the glass is on is wonderful.  The second most appealing aspect of this image is the symmetry that''s occuring throughout the whole image...of course that doesn''t need explaining.  My only critique would be the fact that the image seems cropped a bit tighter on the right side than on the left.  Other than that, this image is simple, elegant and beautiful.', '2003-10-24 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(461044, 42693, 200, '<td valign="top">wonderful effect. Cant wait to see how long the exposure was for this. This makes me want to play with the idea...nice work.</td>', 'wonderful effect. Cant wait to see how long the exposure was for this. This makes me want to play with the idea...nice work.', '2003-10-24 08:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(461058, 43012, 7014, '<td valign="top">:) excellent idea and well executed, the shadow play on the wall with the smiley face of the pumpkin is brilliant.</td>', ':) excellent idea and well executed, the shadow play on the wall with the smiley face of the pumpkin is brilliant.', '2003-10-24 09:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(461059, 42986, 7014, '<td valign="top">Nice seasonal photo and idea, just think the blur is little too strong .</td>', 'Nice seasonal photo and idea, just think the blur is little too strong .', '2003-10-24 09:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(461065, 42843, 7014, '<td valign="top">You captured good light, love the scene with the illuminated leaves and the pretty girl with long hair standing by the tree, well composed picture.</td>', 'You captured good light, love the scene with the illuminated leaves and the pretty girl with long hair standing by the tree, well composed picture.', '2003-10-24 09:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(461110, 42161, 7190, '<td valign="top">this was a nice shot but it is way over exposed. Try bracketing your shots and this is from one who doesn''t practice what I preach and then complains later.</td>', 'this was a nice shot but it is way over exposed. Try bracketing your shots and this is from one who doesn''t practice what I preach and then complains later.', '2003-10-24 10:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(461185, 42537, 13505, '<td valign="top">Sweet picture, I really like the colors and the refract of the glass.</td>', 'Sweet picture, I really like the colors and the refract of the glass.', '2003-10-24 13:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(461258, 42982, 6870, '<td valign="top">A very moody shot, with lots of interesting atmosphere. I love the colors in the fabric. 9</td>', 'A very moody shot, with lots of interesting atmosphere. I love the colors in the fabric. 9', '2003-10-24 15:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(461259, 42814, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice and vibrant colors, made manifest through light. Very nice work. 9</td>', 'Nice and vibrant colors, made manifest through light. Very nice work. 9', '2003-10-24 15:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(461260, 42788, 6870, '<td valign="top">QUirky and dynamic image. Simple, but effective. Composition and cropping are wonderful. 9</td>', 'QUirky and dynamic image. Simple, but effective. Composition and cropping are wonderful. 9', '2003-10-24 15:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(461261, 42818, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very well captured. Nice depth of field and the light is warm and interesting.9</td>', 'Very well captured. Nice depth of field and the light is warm and interesting.9', '2003-10-24 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(461262, 42918, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nearly perfect composition. The beams of light are so nice. The image is so well balanced. 9</td>', 'Nearly perfect composition. The beams of light are so nice. The image is so well balanced. 9', '2003-10-24 15:57:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(461263, 42954, 6870, '<td valign="top">Light DOES indeed make this photo work. Your capture of alpen glow is wonderful here. The symmetrical composition and dark to light from outside to inside work nicely. 9</td>', 'Light DOES indeed make this photo work. Your capture of alpen glow is wonderful here. The symmetrical composition and dark to light from outside to inside work nicely. 9', '2003-10-24 15:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(461264, 42983, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had a fun night getting this shot! The lights are just right--so fantastic point of view. I like the colored look to this. 9</td>', 'Looks like you had a fun night getting this shot! The lights are just right--so fantastic point of view. I like the colored look to this. 9', '2003-10-24 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(461266, 42693, 6870, '<td valign="top">The warm glowing light in the aisins contrast so nicely with the Northern Lights outside. Very striking and dynamic! 10</td>', 'The warm glowing light in the aisins contrast so nicely with the Northern Lights outside. Very striking and dynamic! 10', '2003-10-24 16:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(461267, 42717, 6870, '<td valign="top">I just love this composition and the lighting behind it. The roses are just a bit dark, but the drama and majesty of the photo work so nicely. 9</td>', 'I just love this composition and the lighting behind it. The roses are just a bit dark, but the drama and majesty of the photo work so nicely. 9', '2003-10-24 16:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(461268, 42969, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very  nice capture! Such a wonderful use of sillhouette! 9</td>', 'Very  nice capture! Such a wonderful use of sillhouette! 9', '2003-10-24 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(461269, 43018, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is very intriguing. The bold, bright colors are so strong and dynamic. Marvelous work! 9</td>', 'This is very intriguing. The bold, bright colors are so strong and dynamic. Marvelous work! 9', '2003-10-24 16:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(461284, 42539, 13491, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, ethereal</td>', 'Beautiful, ethereal', '2003-10-24 16:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(461329, 42600, 13511, '<td valign="top">I really the lighting used in this photo, very basic but still effective.  The photo can be interpreted in many ways!! well done!</td>', 'I really the lighting used in this photo, very basic but still effective.  The photo can be interpreted in many ways!! well done!', '2003-10-24 17:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(461335, 42600, 12332, '<td valign="top">mood set well - might be a tad dark - 9</td>', 'mood set well - might be a tad dark - 9', '2003-10-24 17:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(461336, 42805, 12332, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but I missed the "mood"</td>', 'nice picture, but I missed the "mood"', '2003-10-24 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(461337, 42884, 12332, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, mood is regal?</td>', 'beautiful shot, mood is regal?', '2003-10-24 17:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(461340, 42110, 12332, '<td valign="top">I wish you had removed to man-made objects</td>', 'I wish you had removed to man-made objects', '2003-10-24 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(461341, 42902, 12332, '<td valign="top">depth of field very narrow, interesting light patterns</td>', 'depth of field very narrow, interesting light patterns', '2003-10-24 17:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(461342, 42759, 12332, '<td valign="top">neat composition</td>', 'neat composition', '2003-10-24 17:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(461344, 42743, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent light usage, focus is perfect and the use of distance really furthers the photo''s interest level.  Black &amp; white was a great choice.  My only minor suggestion would be to crop the bottom up just a bit.  As it starts to blur out I think it isn''t necessary to the picture - still strong distance perspective available.  Very well done image - I could easily see it as a car ad in a magazine.  10</td>', 'Excellent light usage, focus is perfect and the use of distance really furthers the photo''s interest level.  Black & white was a great choice.  My only minor suggestion would be to crop the bottom up just a bit.  As it starts to blur out I think it isn''t necessary to the picture - still strong distance perspective available.  Very well done image - I could easily see it as a car ad in a magazine.  10', '2003-10-24 17:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(461346, 42993, 12332, '<td valign="top">beautiful close-up, very nice focus &amp; exposure - what mood?</td>', 'beautiful close-up, very nice focus & exposure - what mood?', '2003-10-24 17:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(461351, 42918, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!  I love the color of the sky it has a nice richness to it.  The sun rays/lighting is great - I like the rays coming outward, wish the sky was just a little brighter though.  Silhouettes are always a favorite of mine.  I think compositionally the photo is good, though I would suggest trying to get it with only the scraggly trees in it.  The leaf-filled tree in the bottom left pulls away from the pristine silhouette.  Other than that, I think its fantastic.  7</td>', 'Very nice image!  I love the color of the sky it has a nice richness to it.  The sun rays/lighting is great - I like the rays coming outward, wish the sky was just a little brighter though.  Silhouettes are always a favorite of mine.  I think compositionally the photo is good, though I would suggest trying to get it with only the scraggly trees in it.  The leaf-filled tree in the bottom left pulls away from the pristine silhouette.  Other than that, I think its fantastic.  7', '2003-10-24 17:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(461352, 42788, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image.  I like the vivid green against the black, and the letters chosen give an added interest because to me they do bring to mind the city L.A.  Was this taken with a filter of some kind on - I''m seeing strange color variations on the letters, similar to how heat readings look (solarize?).  Doesn''t detract for me, was just curious.  I do think the border is a little much, maybe half its size would be good.   Great focus, great photo.  8</td>', 'An interesting image.  I like the vivid green against the black, and the letters chosen give an added interest because to me they do bring to mind the city L.A.  Was this taken with a filter of some kind on - I''m seeing strange color variations on the letters, similar to how heat readings look (solarize?).  Doesn''t detract for me, was just curious.  I do think the border is a little much, maybe half its size would be good.   Great focus, great photo.  8', '2003-10-24 17:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(461353, 42607, 11923, '<td valign="top">The focus on this is excellent.  Its a simple composition but the clarity and lovely blue shade gives it a little something.  I think this would make a very nice stock photo, has a good general appeal in my opinion.  Lighting is great and I think the blue hue really helps make the piece.  Well done.  8</td>', 'The focus on this is excellent.  Its a simple composition but the clarity and lovely blue shade gives it a little something.  I think this would make a very nice stock photo, has a good general appeal in my opinion.  Lighting is great and I think the blue hue really helps make the piece.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-24 17:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(461356, 42830, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color, focus looks good.  I think the shot may be a little over exposed because of the intense glare on the cement piece (not sure if that''s the right terminology).  I had that problem when I did a shot with shadows &amp; light.    The light rays in this case detracts for me.  I like the concept, but it doesn''t get my attention fully engaged.  I do like the perspective.  6</td>', 'Great color, focus looks good.  I think the shot may be a little over exposed because of the intense glare on the cement piece (not sure if that''s the right terminology).  I had that problem when I did a shot with shadows & light.    The light rays in this case detracts for me.  I like the concept, but it doesn''t get my attention fully engaged.  I do like the perspective.  6', '2003-10-24 17:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461358, 42753, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image.  The lighting is good - I can see a connection between its harshness and the broken glass, but I''m not sure the two together give me that ''harsh'' feeling.  The focus looks great, the darker colors help the feeling of the piece.  I''m not sure I like the composition though - I keep wanting to see something along the bottom to help frame up the image of the glass.  Not sure why.  Nicely done.  6</td>', 'An interesting image.  The lighting is good - I can see a connection between its harshness and the broken glass, but I''m not sure the two together give me that ''harsh'' feeling.  The focus looks great, the darker colors help the feeling of the piece.  I''m not sure I like the composition though - I keep wanting to see something along the bottom to help frame up the image of the glass.  Not sure why.  Nicely done.  6', '2003-10-24 17:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(461359, 42372, 11923, '<td valign="top">A very nice, pretty image.  The colors are great as is the focus.  I like the use of light.  I think technically it is a sound image, however I feel there is something missing from it.  Feels kind of generic to me but I''m not sure why.  :\    7 for its overall appeal, had I connected better it''d be a 9</td>', 'A very nice, pretty image.  The colors are great as is the focus.  I like the use of light.  I think technically it is a sound image, however I feel there is something missing from it.  Feels kind of generic to me but I''m not sure why.  :\    7 for its overall appeal, had I connected better it''d be a 9', '2003-10-24 17:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(461360, 42958, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  The lighting really helps to promote the feeling of rage - great use of color as well.  The silhouette, even without an ax, gives a nice feeling of menace.  I think this image would''ve done very well in the dreams/nightmare category too.  Definte emotional connection visually.  My only issue is the figure doesn''t appear very crisp, and I wish he did.   I do think the soft focus fits the image well - this is just a personal preference.  Great job on the intense image.  10</td>', 'Fantastic image.  The lighting really helps to promote the feeling of rage - great use of color as well.  The silhouette, even without an ax, gives a nice feeling of menace.  I think this image would''ve done very well in the dreams/nightmare category too.  Definte emotional connection visually.  My only issue is the figure doesn''t appear very crisp, and I wish he did.   I do think the soft focus fits the image well - this is just a personal preference.  Great job on the intense image.  10', '2003-10-24 17:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(461363, 42380, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the stars in the back ground and the deep color of the sky.  I wish the figure was more in a silhouette though - the moonlight is so bright that I can see flesh tones of the face.   Also, the moonrays detract from the image for me, I''m not sure if it would''ve been possible to not have them - particularly from the perspective the photo was taken (which I like btw)  Good solid photo.  5</td>', 'I love the stars in the back ground and the deep color of the sky.  I wish the figure was more in a silhouette though - the moonlight is so bright that I can see flesh tones of the face.   Also, the moonrays detract from the image for me, I''m not sure if it would''ve been possible to not have them - particularly from the perspective the photo was taken (which I like btw)  Good solid photo.  5', '2003-10-24 18:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(461365, 42865, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, I love skies like these.  The composition is nice - I like the country feel of it.  The lighting is okay, my main dislike is the soft focus.  With the trees so close I wish they had a more stark look against that fabulous sky - clear deliniated lines, etc.  6</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, I love skies like these.  The composition is nice - I like the country feel of it.  The lighting is okay, my main dislike is the soft focus.  With the trees so close I wish they had a more stark look against that fabulous sky - clear deliniated lines, etc.  6', '2003-10-24 18:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(461366, 42948, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, though I do find the items on the counter and left wall a little distracting.  The color is nice, it has a warm hue to it.  Lighting is fantastic.  Focus is alright, would like it a touch sharper.    I''m not sure I''m following the title.. but that''s neither here nor there really.  Good solid image.  6</td>', 'Nice composition, though I do find the items on the counter and left wall a little distracting.  The color is nice, it has a warm hue to it.  Lighting is fantastic.  Focus is alright, would like it a touch sharper.    I''m not sure I''m following the title.. but that''s neither here nor there really.  Good solid image.  6', '2003-10-24 18:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(461369, 42383, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  I love the clouds behind, especially the range and tone of the blues.  The lighting is nice, gives it a slightly brooding atmosphere.  Nice clean lines, interesting shape interaction.  I do wish the overall image was a little sharper though.  Other than that, great job.  7</td>', 'Nice capture!  I love the clouds behind, especially the range and tone of the blues.  The lighting is nice, gives it a slightly brooding atmosphere.  Nice clean lines, interesting shape interaction.  I do wish the overall image was a little sharper though.  Other than that, great job.  7', '2003-10-24 18:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(461371, 42110, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the concept behind the image, I''m not sure its fully captured but I can get the essense from the photo.  I love the richness of the green and the focus looks good.  The dappled sunlight really works nicely.  Perspective is good, gives that size difference feel.  Well done.  7</td>', 'I like the concept behind the image, I''m not sure its fully captured but I can get the essense from the photo.  I love the richness of the green and the focus looks good.  The dappled sunlight really works nicely.  Perspective is good, gives that size difference feel.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-24 18:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(461373, 42843, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, the focus is excellent near your subject.  THe lighting is wonderful, gives a country feel to the piece as well as a freshness.  Lovely woman, very natural looking - fits the image well too.  Nice job!  8</td>', 'Very nice image, the focus is excellent near your subject.  THe lighting is wonderful, gives a country feel to the piece as well as a freshness.  Lovely woman, very natural looking - fits the image well too.  Nice job!  8', '2003-10-24 18:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(461374, 42818, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great detail, I like the perspective and use of distance.  Lighting is great, as is focus.  The title makes me believe the focus should be on the shadows but I find my eyes going to the tracks in the sand instead.  Feels a little contradictory.  Also, as a personal preference I would''ve cropped just above the tallest rock formation, keeping a bit of the pretty blue sky but pulling the image down a bit more to the tracks.  Great photo!  8</td>', 'Great detail, I like the perspective and use of distance.  Lighting is great, as is focus.  The title makes me believe the focus should be on the shadows but I find my eyes going to the tracks in the sand instead.  Feels a little contradictory.  Also, as a personal preference I would''ve cropped just above the tallest rock formation, keeping a bit of the pretty blue sky but pulling the image down a bit more to the tracks.  Great photo!  8', '2003-10-24 18:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(461385, 43011, 5038, '<td valign="top">Great photo!!!</td>', 'Great photo!!!', '2003-10-24 18:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(461403, 42677, 8833, '<td valign="top">Nice picture...</td>', 'Nice picture...', '2003-10-24 19:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(461445, 42960, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the window light and I like the composition.  I also like that it is in black and white.  As far as I am concerned it is a good picture.</td>', 'I like the use of the window light and I like the composition.  I also like that it is in black and white.  As far as I am concerned it is a good picture.', '2003-10-24 20:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(461451, 42161, 9387, '<td valign="top">On my screen the skin tone is all washed out and the lips are kind of faded.  The eyes are clear and the lashes are fine, but a lot of other parts just seem over exposed.</td>', 'On my screen the skin tone is all washed out and the lips are kind of faded.  The eyes are clear and the lashes are fine, but a lot of other parts just seem over exposed.', '2003-10-24 20:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(461453, 42759, 9387, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good techniques and light as a feather and the light that is shining on it.  Excellent.</td>', 'Good idea, good techniques and light as a feather and the light that is shining on it.  Excellent.', '2003-10-24 20:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(461455, 43017, 9387, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if my screen is going or my eyes are going but this photo seems not clear to me and a little pixelated.</td>', 'I don''t know if my screen is going or my eyes are going but this photo seems not clear to me and a little pixelated.', '2003-10-24 20:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(461463, 42884, 9387, '<td valign="top">This is a very good picture.  I like the composition, the subject matter and the overall feel.</td>', 'This is a very good picture.  I like the composition, the subject matter and the overall feel.', '2003-10-24 21:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(461464, 42286, 9387, '<td valign="top">This was the highest rated of my votes.  I love it!</td>', 'This was the highest rated of my votes.  I love it!', '2003-10-24 21:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(461465, 43002, 9387, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is excellent and so is the tone of the entire picture.</td>', 'The lighting on this is excellent and so is the tone of the entire picture.', '2003-10-24 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(461511, 42483, 13513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting effect.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting effect.', '2003-10-24 23:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(461517, 42380, 10402, '<td valign="top">The overexposed moon is somewhat distorted, but it nicely shows off the texture and contours of the land and casts a long shadow of the model. This photo has a good composition, but is technically poor.</td>', 'The overexposed moon is somewhat distorted, but it nicely shows off the texture and contours of the land and casts a long shadow of the model. This photo has a good composition, but is technically poor.', '2003-10-25 00:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(461539, 42884, 9441, '<td valign="top">Very striking image.  Wonderful lighting capture, it''s fabulous!  I love the color and the clarity.  Awesome photo...a perfect 10 from me!</td>', 'Very striking image.  Wonderful lighting capture, it''s fabulous!  I love the color and the clarity.  Awesome photo...a perfect 10 from me!', '2003-10-25 00:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(461540, 42922, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sun with its streaming rays. The soft colors and mistiness evoke feelings of beauty and peace. But the diagonal lines and sharp contrasts between the lighted and shaded areas make the image seem stark and restless. To me, today, the latter seems to be stronger; at another time or for someone else, it will be the opposite. Either way, the road is there beckoning, making the viewer wonder what is behind the curve. But to follow it at a swift run or a liesurely stroll, that is the question. Some art conveys the artists viewpoint to the viewers. Other art, like this, is a mirror for the viewer''s own feelings.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sun with its streaming rays. The soft colors and mistiness evoke feelings of beauty and peace. But the diagonal lines and sharp contrasts between the lighted and shaded areas make the image seem stark and restless. To me, today, the latter seems to be stronger; at another time or for someone else, it will be the opposite. Either way, the road is there beckoning, making the viewer wonder what is behind the curve. But to follow it at a swift run or a liesurely stroll, that is the question. Some art conveys the artists viewpoint to the viewers. Other art, like this, is a mirror for the viewer''s own feelings.', '2003-10-25 00:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461548, 42916, 10402, '<td valign="top">The model''s pose and expression along with composing the image with him at near the edge with a plethora of tones and textures in the rocks and water in front of him give this photo a mood of solitude, not really loneliness as the title suggests (but maybe that''s just me; I like being alone and rarely experience loneliness).  I think this is a great photo, although I don''t particularly like the colored shirt and would prefer it a little sharper. But I almost wonder if you entered it in the wrong challenge; the lighting here is rather neutral. I''m not saying it "doesn''t meet the challenge"; the lighting is certainly appropriate for the image. But it isn''t really a key factor either.</td>', 'The model''s pose and expression along with composing the image with him at near the edge with a plethora of tones and textures in the rocks and water in front of him give this photo a mood of solitude, not really loneliness as the title suggests (but maybe that''s just me; I like being alone and rarely experience loneliness).  I think this is a great photo, although I don''t particularly like the colored shirt and would prefer it a little sharper. But I almost wonder if you entered it in the wrong challenge; the lighting here is rather neutral. I''m not saying it "doesn''t meet the challenge"; the lighting is certainly appropriate for the image. But it isn''t really a key factor either.', '2003-10-25 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(461558, 42989, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting does help with the mood here, although there is some detail loss in the shadows. But the composition is lacking. The natural lines in the photo lead the eye to the tip of the ''V'' in the jacket, which is right where the "rule of thirds" says the center of interest should be. But that isn''t really very interesting. The parts of the photo that express the subject "crestfallen" are the face and clenched hand, and these are too close to the edges of the image. I think the photo would have been more effective cropped at about his chest (avoiding conflicting centers of interest) and with a little more face showing.</td>', 'The lighting does help with the mood here, although there is some detail loss in the shadows. But the composition is lacking. The natural lines in the photo lead the eye to the tip of the ''V'' in the jacket, which is right where the "rule of thirds" says the center of interest should be. But that isn''t really very interesting. The parts of the photo that express the subject "crestfallen" are the face and clenched hand, and these are too close to the edges of the image. I think the photo would have been more effective cropped at about his chest (avoiding conflicting centers of interest) and with a little more face showing.', '2003-10-25 01:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(461574, 42916, 12653, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photograph.... but it seems like it''d belong in the Alone contest.  I''d give it a 10 in that category.</td>', 'Brilliant photograph.... but it seems like it''d belong in the Alone contest.  I''d give it a 10 in that category.', '2003-10-25 02:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(461575, 43009, 12653, '<td valign="top">Wow......  *speechless* ...</td>', 'Wow......  *speechless* ...', '2003-10-25 02:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(461576, 42564, 12653, '<td valign="top">It''s *almost* a 10...  except for the leftmost sunflare.  Great shot!  Congrats :)</td>', 'It''s *almost* a 10...  except for the leftmost sunflare.  Great shot!  Congrats :)', '2003-10-25 02:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(461578, 42843, 12653, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  Very... dreamlike.</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  Very... dreamlike.', '2003-10-25 02:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(461579, 43009, 13384, '<td valign="top">Being an C141 (Qtr Pounder) pilot in my time, I am naturally partial to the Big Mac, the C5.  I love the flag and good frame.</td>', 'Being an C141 (Qtr Pounder) pilot in my time, I am naturally partial to the Big Mac, the C5.  I love the flag and good frame.', '2003-10-25 02:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(461580, 42992, 13384, '<td valign="top">Now this is some great depth of exposure and field for a night shot.  good work!</td>', 'Now this is some great depth of exposure and field for a night shot.  good work!', '2003-10-25 02:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(461581, 42539, 13384, '<td valign="top">Now this is Beautiful</td>', 'Now this is Beautiful', '2003-10-25 02:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(461582, 42286, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting here - the blues in the background provide a nice backdrop to cool down the image and provide some nice color contrast for the leaves.  There is a weird shadow line accross the top half of the leaf that is distracting, but fairly minor.</td>', 'Great use of lighting here - the blues in the background provide a nice backdrop to cool down the image and provide some nice color contrast for the leaves.  There is a weird shadow line accross the top half of the leaf that is distracting, but fairly minor.', '2003-10-25 02:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(461583, 42770, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  What is going on in the lower left?  Very distracting.  Shapes, lines and color are so rich.</td>', 'Nice image.  What is going on in the lower left?  Very distracting.  Shapes, lines and color are so rich.', '2003-10-25 02:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(461584, 42087, 5767, '<td valign="top">Excellent abstract.  Great tonal values here and the shapes created by the shadows are fantastic.</td>', 'Excellent abstract.  Great tonal values here and the shapes created by the shadows are fantastic.', '2003-10-25 02:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
