(461586, 42993, 5767, '<td valign="top">Like no corn I''ve seen lately.  Nice perspective and fun use of shadows to accent the surface shapes.</td>', 'Like no corn I''ve seen lately.  Nice perspective and fun use of shadows to accent the surface shapes.', '2003-10-25 02:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
