(461597, 42983, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great capture - intense, edgy and excellent composition.</td>', 'Great capture - intense, edgy and excellent composition.', '2003-10-25 03:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(461636, 42564, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and unusual but pleasing golden color...the lens reflection spot in lower left distracts a little.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and unusual but pleasing golden color...the lens reflection spot in lower left distracts a little.', '2003-10-25 08:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(461637, 42380, 8637, '<td valign="top">Seems  little soft and fuzzy...might be better to have full silhouette rather than features that are visible but unfocused.</td>', 'Seems  little soft and fuzzy...might be better to have full silhouette rather than features that are visible but unfocused.', '2003-10-25 08:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(461638, 42997, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great capture...only improvement might be to have removed the other chair.  Very nice colors and lighting.</td>', 'Great capture...only improvement might be to have removed the other chair.  Very nice colors and lighting.', '2003-10-25 08:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(461640, 42364, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light for the challenge.  Unusual, artistic, and very well framed.</td>', 'Nice use of light for the challenge.  Unusual, artistic, and very well framed.', '2003-10-25 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(461731, 42995, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has a nice moody feel to it. Perhaps the only suggestion would be to crop the bushes on the left, but then you would lose some of the light so probably better this way. I also like the toning. It looks almost supernatural.</td>', 'This has a nice moody feel to it. Perhaps the only suggestion would be to crop the bushes on the left, but then you would lose some of the light so probably better this way. I also like the toning. It looks almost supernatural.', '2003-10-25 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(461735, 42504, 10691, '<td valign="top">Is this an aerial photograph? So pretty!</td>', 'Is this an aerial photograph? So pretty!', '2003-10-25 13:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(461737, 42969, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is quite a wonderfully peaceful shot, and the colors also make it interesting. The gradient sky is wonderful, meeting the ocean with a sort of misty feel. I''m also a sucker for silhouettes, and the woodland foreground is nicely sharp and detailed even though it is a silhouette. The contrast between foreground and background almost looks unreal.</td>', 'This is quite a wonderfully peaceful shot, and the colors also make it interesting. The gradient sky is wonderful, meeting the ocean with a sort of misty feel. I''m also a sucker for silhouettes, and the woodland foreground is nicely sharp and detailed even though it is a silhouette. The contrast between foreground and background almost looks unreal.', '2003-10-25 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(461738, 42990, 6008, '<td valign="top">The candle seems very over exposed and the rose appears pixelated. It almost looks like photoshop effects have been added to it. Compositionally it is fine, and the folds in the fabric are a nice touch.</td>', 'The candle seems very over exposed and the rose appears pixelated. It almost looks like photoshop effects have been added to it. Compositionally it is fine, and the folds in the fabric are a nice touch.', '2003-10-25 13:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(461742, 42816, 6008, '<td valign="top">I assume this was taken in a mirror? The concept is interesting, but I think the picture quality is a little low. It has quite a lot of noise, probably from the low light prior to the flash. And as one expects from a flash in the face, it is a little blinding too.</td>', 'I assume this was taken in a mirror? The concept is interesting, but I think the picture quality is a little low. It has quite a lot of noise, probably from the low light prior to the flash. And as one expects from a flash in the face, it is a little blinding too.', '2003-10-25 13:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(461744, 42364, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen some really interesting photographs done with a laer/light pen, but I think in this instance the subject doesnt really work well. On my monitor the background still shows up as a very faint image, and there are quite a number of stray red dots floating around too. The idea was good, the execution not bad, the subject matter probably not the best.</td>', 'I''ve seen some really interesting photographs done with a laer/light pen, but I think in this instance the subject doesnt really work well. On my monitor the background still shows up as a very faint image, and there are quite a number of stray red dots floating around too. The idea was good, the execution not bad, the subject matter probably not the best.', '2003-10-25 13:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(461745, 42110, 6008, '<td valign="top">Are those mushrooms? I understand the reference and the dappled light over the ground is good, but I dont feel there is enough of a focal point to keep attention. The hue of green is good, I just dont really know what I''m suppose to be looking for or seeing.</td>', 'Are those mushrooms? I understand the reference and the dappled light over the ground is good, but I dont feel there is enough of a focal point to keep attention. The hue of green is good, I just dont really know what I''m suppose to be looking for or seeing.', '2003-10-25 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(461747, 42865, 6008, '<td valign="top">The color of the sunset is good, although I think there is a little too much tree on the left that masks the sunset. I would have liked to have seen a little more sky. The image also seems a little out of focus, possibly due to camera shake. In low light conditions it''s best to use a tripod, assuming you didnt.</td>', 'The color of the sunset is good, although I think there is a little too much tree on the left that masks the sunset. I would have liked to have seen a little more sky. The image also seems a little out of focus, possibly due to camera shake. In low light conditions it''s best to use a tripod, assuming you didnt.', '2003-10-25 13:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(461748, 42762, 6008, '<td valign="top">The highlight on the block is good, I could see this as being something seen on a stage, however, I''m not a fan of the carpet/fabric beneath it. It has texture but I think that distracts a little, making it look a lot more softer than it probably is, also the red blends in. I think a slightly different angle and a white or black ''background'' would helped the image immensely. The concept itself is great.</td>', 'The highlight on the block is good, I could see this as being something seen on a stage, however, I''m not a fan of the carpet/fabric beneath it. It has texture but I think that distracts a little, making it look a lot more softer than it probably is, also the red blends in. I think a slightly different angle and a white or black ''background'' would helped the image immensely. The concept itself is great.', '2003-10-25 14:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(461813, 42895, 9287, '<td valign="top">wow, cool effect. how was this done?</td>', 'wow, cool effect. how was this done?', '2003-10-25 18:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(461815, 42759, 9287, '<td valign="top">love the shadow, good job. 9</td>', 'love the shadow, good job. 9', '2003-10-25 18:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(461817, 42822, 8637, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!  Very nice effect...might have cropped a little more off the right...but very nice mood.</td>', 'Oh yeah!  Very nice effect...might have cropped a little more off the right...but very nice mood.', '2003-10-25 18:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(461818, 42719, 8637, '<td valign="top">Seems a little grainy...if not effect intended.  Pretty little lady and nice capture.</td>', 'Seems a little grainy...if not effect intended.  Pretty little lady and nice capture.', '2003-10-25 18:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(461819, 42969, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette...would it improve a little to offset the deer more to the right?<br/></td>', 'Very nice silhouette...would it improve a little to offset the deer more to the right?', '2003-10-25 18:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(461820, 42918, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture and very sharp focus.  Might have cropped more of  the shrubby looking trees out on the left.</td>', 'Beautiful capture and very sharp focus.  Might have cropped more of  the shrubby looking trees out on the left.', '2003-10-25 18:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(461821, 42539, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful effect...excellent composition but would have preferred the dark reddish image in the back left were not present and perhaps crop little more off the bottom?.  Excellent image though.</td>', 'Beautiful effect...excellent composition but would have preferred the dark reddish image in the back left were not present and perhaps crop little more off the bottom?.  Excellent image though.', '2003-10-25 18:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
