(461825, 42948, 8637, '<td valign="top">Simple but very effective approach to the challenge...the dark jacket on the wall (out of focus?) distracts a little, but very neat idea.</td>', 'Simple but very effective approach to the challenge...the dark jacket on the wall (out of focus?) distracts a little, but very neat idea.', '2003-10-25 18:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
