(462007, 42994, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like photographing low sunlight on trees/leaves. This looks a little dark, but it could be my monitor or intentional. If not, I''d have boosted the contrast a bit more.</td>', 'I like photographing low sunlight on trees/leaves. This looks a little dark, but it could be my monitor or intentional. If not, I''d have boosted the contrast a bit more.', '2003-10-26 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
