(462023, 42880, 4648, '<td valign="top">looks like a doll.  Great dof.  Love the colors and the tint.  Like the tight crop.  A solid 9.</td>', 'looks like a doll.  Great dof.  Love the colors and the tint.  Like the tight crop.  A solid 9.', '2003-10-26 00:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(462026, 42566, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the title.  Shot ok by itself.  Would have liked to see one of the shoes laying on its'' side - the one on the right.    Focus on back shoe should be in focus in my opinion.  still a 6</td>', 'Not sure I get the title.  Shot ok by itself.  Would have liked to see one of the shoes laying on its'' side - the one on the right.    Focus on back shoe should be in focus in my opinion.  still a 6', '2003-10-26 00:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(462061, 42865, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how we can peek through the trees to see the sunset here! I wish the trees were more in focus though, and that the sky were a little more brilliant, but subtle skies happen too!</td>', 'I like how we can peek through the trees to see the sunset here! I wish the trees were more in focus though, and that the sky were a little more brilliant, but subtle skies happen too!', '2003-10-26 01:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(462063, 42916, 6870, '<td valign="top">Is this your boy, Anna? He''s a good little actor! The composition is very nice here; I love the way he is in a ''third'', and the waterfall adds a nice variety of texture and form. I''m not sure what your exclusive saturation is supposed to be doing, though. It certainly brings attention to the boy, but I don''t find that it adds much mood or communicates anything. There is also a clarity issue here; the photo looks almost sharp--but not quite. Still, I like the image a lot. Overall, a wonderful mood is build, and the tones of the rocks and water and model are really marvelous; good luck!</td>', 'Is this your boy, Anna? He''s a good little actor! The composition is very nice here; I love the way he is in a ''third'', and the waterfall adds a nice variety of texture and form. I''m not sure what your exclusive saturation is supposed to be doing, though. It certainly brings attention to the boy, but I don''t find that it adds much mood or communicates anything. There is also a clarity issue here; the photo looks almost sharp--but not quite. Still, I like the image a lot. Overall, a wonderful mood is build, and the tones of the rocks and water and model are really marvelous; good luck!', '2003-10-26 01:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(462069, 42887, 13498, '<td valign="top">To Dark</td>', 'To Dark', '2003-10-26 01:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(462092, 42539, 10260, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is so attractive.   Colors are alluring and detail is great.  I can''t wait to see what camera you have.  I want it.  Of course, I''d need your gift for photography too. lol     10</td>', 'The lighting here is so attractive.   Colors are alluring and detail is great.  I can''t wait to see what camera you have.  I want it.  Of course, I''d need your gift for photography too. lol     10', '2003-10-26 02:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
