(462096, 42969, 10260, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  I think I would have liked to see some post editing to enhance the sunset colors.   You  captured a beautiful nature-filled shot, though, and I hope it scores well.</td>', 'This is really nice.  I think I would have liked to see some post editing to enhance the sunset colors.   You  captured a beautiful nature-filled shot, though, and I hope it scores well.', '2003-10-26 02:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(462098, 42762, 10260, '<td valign="top">This is so clever!  Composition is perfect for this image and lighting is wonderful. 10</td>', 'This is so clever!  Composition is perfect for this image and lighting is wonderful. 10', '2003-10-26 02:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(462109, 42887, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Moody. I might crop some of the dark area in the foreground out. An atmospheric shot.</td>', 'Nice. Moody. I might crop some of the dark area in the foreground out. An atmospheric shot.', '2003-10-26 04:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(462111, 42519, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Pretty lighting in the clouds. Composition is a bit off though, I think - it looks like the clouds have been chopped off. Also, might have been nice to spot meter on the plane (if you could).</td>', 'Nice catch. Pretty lighting in the clouds. Composition is a bit off though, I think - it looks like the clouds have been chopped off. Also, might have been nice to spot meter on the plane (if you could).', '2003-10-26 04:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462112, 42902, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, though could use more DOF I think - I''d like to see the foreground sharp with the focus dropping off to the rear.</td>', 'Nice effect, though could use more DOF I think - I''d like to see the foreground sharp with the focus dropping off to the rear.', '2003-10-26 04:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(462113, 42871, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot, and great choice of subject. They do look like spacecraft. I assume they''re gas/liquid tanks of some sort? Never seen ones quite like this before.</td>', 'Nice night shot, and great choice of subject. They do look like spacecraft. I assume they''re gas/liquid tanks of some sort? Never seen ones quite like this before.', '2003-10-26 04:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(462114, 43018, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great composition. This is a very nice shot - well done.</td>', 'Great composition. This is a very nice shot - well done.', '2003-10-26 04:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(462144, 42921, 7810, '<td valign="top">very cool idea. excellent job with direction of lighting 9</td>', 'very cool idea. excellent job with direction of lighting 9', '2003-10-26 08:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(462145, 42958, 7810, '<td valign="top">love  this shot...good luck with it</td>', 'love  this shot...good luck with it', '2003-10-26 08:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(462148, 42666, 7810, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, really like this shot</td>', 'Meets the challenge, really like this shot', '2003-10-26 08:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(462157, 42893, 13048, '<td valign="top">This photo would be great except more lighting needs to be on the subject. The subject isn''t illuminated enough to stand out.</td>', 'This photo would be great except more lighting needs to be on the subject. The subject isn''t illuminated enough to stand out.', '2003-10-26 08:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(462186, 42759, 5112, '<td valign="top">Funny (but not "lighting" :)))  Good shot.</td>', 'Funny (but not "lighting" :)))  Good shot.', '2003-10-26 09:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(462217, 42989, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great crop and detail.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great crop and detail.', '2003-10-26 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(462218, 42983, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love the green/yellows and the "halo" around the person.  ~9</td>', 'Love the green/yellows and the "halo" around the person.  ~9', '2003-10-26 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(462219, 42998, 5112, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling!  Beautiful use of light (lamp and screen); I also like the reflection (you have clean windows!).  ~8</td>', 'I know the feeling!  Beautiful use of light (lamp and screen); I also like the reflection (you have clean windows!).  ~8', '2003-10-26 10:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(462220, 42839, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good detail, beautiful greens.</td>', 'Good detail, beautiful greens.', '2003-10-26 10:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(462223, 42952, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouette!!!  Great subdued red light.  I like it very much.  ~10</td>', 'Excellent silhouette!!!  Great subdued red light.  I like it very much.  ~10', '2003-10-26 10:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(462224, 42997, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great moment.  I like the movement in the stick she''s swinging.  Where are the marshmallows?</td>', 'Great moment.  I like the movement in the stick she''s swinging.  Where are the marshmallows?', '2003-10-26 10:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(462227, 43015, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great detail, I like how "clean" the books look :)  ~8</td>', 'Great detail, I like how "clean" the books look :)  ~8', '2003-10-26 10:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462228, 42865, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love the pinks and purples in the sky.</td>', 'Love the pinks and purples in the sky.', '2003-10-26 10:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(462239, 42773, 11800, '<td valign="top">So delicate and beautiful. The shot is perfect. The frame detracts. This needs some just a delicate as the image is, imo<br/>I''m back. The score is still the same 10. I''m rethinking the frame. Works good for an art print, so I guess it''s right for this one. Wanted to let you know that you inspired me to try some like this. They aren''t as nice!</td>', 'So delicate and beautiful. The shot is perfect. The frame detracts. This needs some just a delicate as the image is, imoI''m back. The score is still the same 10. I''m rethinking the frame. Works good for an art print, so I guess it''s right for this one. Wanted to let you know that you inspired me to try some like this. They aren''t as nice!', '2003-10-26 11:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(462272, 42928, 1031, '<td valign="top">I might have made it even a little darker.</td>', 'I might have made it even a little darker.', '2003-10-26 12:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(462273, 42770, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a good sign that I didn''t notice your complex border until after I''d checked out the photo itself.</td>', 'I think it''s a good sign that I didn''t notice your complex border until after I''d checked out the photo itself.', '2003-10-26 12:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(462274, 42864, 1031, '<td valign="top">I just remembered what I was going to use for this challenge, but forgot to. I want to see what you used to make this.</td>', 'I just remembered what I was going to use for this challenge, but forgot to. I want to see what you used to make this.', '2003-10-26 12:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(462277, 42773, 1031, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of DOF and lighting to create the "abstract" background.</td>', 'Beautiful use of DOF and lighting to create the "abstract" background.', '2003-10-26 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(462282, 42700, 9504, '<td valign="top">I wonder why the term "American Beauty"?  The irony of it is that most Americans are no where near as thin as this woman.  This woman is too thin -- painfully thin.  Most Americans are overweight...though the advertising companies are constantly trying to sell deathly thin, they don''t succeed.</td>', 'I wonder why the term "American Beauty"?  The irony of it is that most Americans are no where near as thin as this woman.  This woman is too thin -- painfully thin.  Most Americans are overweight...though the advertising companies are constantly trying to sell deathly thin, they don''t succeed.', '2003-10-26 12:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(462283, 42558, 1031, '<td valign="top">I look forward to seeing how you made this. Very subtle and effective.</td>', 'I look forward to seeing how you made this. Very subtle and effective.', '2003-10-26 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(462290, 42383, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Almost very nice indeed. The blue of the ambient light contrasts well with the light from the setting(?) sun. But it''s a little too dark, I think and also seems a tad soft round the top of the tower. Nice shot neverlheless.</td>', 'Nice. Almost very nice indeed. The blue of the ambient light contrasts well with the light from the setting(?) sun. But it''s a little too dark, I think and also seems a tad soft round the top of the tower. Nice shot neverlheless.', '2003-10-26 13:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(462291, 42815, 3290, '<td valign="top">:-) Nice idea and a good effect. Perhaps just a tad brighter would be better? Then again, this way it portrays the atmosphere in a bar well. One other thing: there''s no focal point for the eye to fix on.</td>', ':-) Nice idea and a good effect. Perhaps just a tad brighter would be better? Then again, this way it portrays the atmosphere in a bar well. One other thing: there''s no focal point for the eye to fix on.', '2003-10-26 13:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(462292, 43012, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very clever photo trick! A treat for us.</td>', 'Very clever photo trick! A treat for us.', '2003-10-26 13:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(462294, 42483, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Simple and effective.</td>', 'Nice. Simple and effective.', '2003-10-26 13:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(462297, 42685, 3290, '<td valign="top">A shot like this has to have the details right - rotate to level the floor and lose the wall socket. Otherwise, I like the grain and shading, although the legs are a little dark.</td>', 'A shot like this has to have the details right - rotate to level the floor and lose the wall socket. Otherwise, I like the grain and shading, although the legs are a little dark.', '2003-10-26 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(462299, 42981, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, but would work much better IMHO without the clutter lower left, so it''s just the model and the sky (and perhaps the leaves at the top). Like the ''halo'' around the head and the graduated sky.</td>', 'Nice, but would work much better IMHO without the clutter lower left, so it''s just the model and the sky (and perhaps the leaves at the top). Like the ''halo'' around the head and the graduated sky.', '2003-10-26 13:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(462301, 42759, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like photos which meet the challenge in multiple ways. I''ve used a similar diagonal black/white composition myself; I might have cropped it to the edge of the shadow on the right as it seems just a touch unbalanced now.<br/> <br/>If it''s cropped so tightly on the left because the feather''s actually suspended instead of falling, I have an idea for doing that which might allow more background on the left. If the feather''s falling, then never mind ... I don''t think I can do that.</td>', 'I like photos which meet the challenge in multiple ways. I''ve used a similar diagonal black/white composition myself; I might have cropped it to the edge of the shadow on the right as it seems just a touch unbalanced now. If it''s cropped so tightly on the left because the feather''s actually suspended instead of falling, I have an idea for doing that which might allow more background on the left. If the feather''s falling, then never mind ... I don''t think I can do that.', '2003-10-26 13:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(462303, 42855, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - great use of silhouette and lovely sky colours. Nice one.</td>', 'I like this a lot - great use of silhouette and lovely sky colours. Nice one.', '2003-10-26 13:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(462304, 42600, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very good picture, a wee bit dark though.  But good use of light!</td>', 'Very good picture, a wee bit dark though.  But good use of light!', '2003-10-26 13:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(462305, 42954, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Great setting and use of reflection. Perhaps a little dark in the shade but that''s a bit nitpicky. Nice shot.</td>', 'Very pretty. Great setting and use of reflection. Perhaps a little dark in the shade but that''s a bit nitpicky. Nice shot.', '2003-10-26 13:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(462306, 42914, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.</td>', 'Cool effect.', '2003-10-26 13:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(462307, 42876, 10883, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don´t see how light sets the tone for the image...</td>', 'Sorry but I don´t see how light sets the tone for the image...', '2003-10-26 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(462308, 42954, 1031, '<td valign="top">As the cliche goes, you''d have to get up mighty early in the morning to beat that. Pretty much feels like being there.</td>', 'As the cliche goes, you''d have to get up mighty early in the morning to beat that. Pretty much feels like being there.', '2003-10-26 13:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(462309, 42380, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting. But what are the vertical lines down it - they do spoil it somewhat.</td>', 'Interesting. But what are the vertical lines down it - they do spoil it somewhat.', '2003-10-26 13:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(462310, 43015, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  I would have used something else than the floor for background, it distracts a bit from the picture.</td>', 'Nice idea!  I would have used something else than the floor for background, it distracts a bit from the picture.', '2003-10-26 13:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(462312, 42954, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture!  Love the scenery and how the sun shines on the top of the mountain.  Good reflection too!</td>', 'Excellent picture!  Love the scenery and how the sun shines on the top of the mountain.  Good reflection too!', '2003-10-26 13:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(462313, 42993, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like it. Nice use of texture in the corn kernels, I think it would work  better without the bright bit top right, though.</td>', 'I like it. Nice use of texture in the corn kernels, I think it would work  better without the bright bit top right, though.', '2003-10-26 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(462314, 42852, 10883, '<td valign="top">It is a bit too dark for my taste, could have used a bit more light.</td>', 'It is a bit too dark for my taste, could have used a bit more light.', '2003-10-26 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(462316, 42087, 10883, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the color version of the picture, would have worked better IMHO.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the color version of the picture, would have worked better IMHO.', '2003-10-26 13:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(462317, 42983, 1031, '<td valign="top">Exceptional detail considering the amount of backlight and a dynamic subject -- I look forward to reading what settings it took to do this.</td>', 'Exceptional detail considering the amount of backlight and a dynamic subject -- I look forward to reading what settings it took to do this.', '2003-10-26 13:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(462318, 42788, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I think the empty space on the right dilutes the impact. I think it would work better in a portrait format.</td>', 'I like it, but I think the empty space on the right dilutes the impact. I think it would work better in a portrait format.', '2003-10-26 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(462319, 42773, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture!</td>', 'Very cool picture!', '2003-10-26 13:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(462320, 42546, 10883, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  But the crop is too tight for my taste, no breathing room in the picture.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  But the crop is too tight for my taste, no breathing room in the picture.', '2003-10-26 13:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(462321, 42719, 1031, '<td valign="top">Effective use of unusual perspective for a portrait. Flesh-tones look a little grainy to me; I might try either smoothing them, or (post-challenge) running a Canvas (or similar) texture filter to give it a painted look and make the grain more "acceptable" to the average viewer.</td>', 'Effective use of unusual perspective for a portrait. Flesh-tones look a little grainy to me; I might try either smoothing them, or (post-challenge) running a Canvas (or similar) texture filter to give it a painted look and make the grain more "acceptable" to the average viewer.', '2003-10-26 13:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462322, 42693, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice effect - what is producing the light behind the building? The quality of the light makes the building look unreal - like it''s been CGI rendered (I''m not suggesting it has been :-) The cool steely blue of the sky contrasts well with the warm lighting in the building.</td>', 'Nice effect - what is producing the light behind the building? The quality of the light makes the building look unreal - like it''s been CGI rendered (I''m not suggesting it has been :-) The cool steely blue of the sky contrasts well with the warm lighting in the building.', '2003-10-26 13:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(462324, 42916, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice melancholy mood. Good use of colour vs. b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice melancholy mood. Good use of colour vs. b&w.', '2003-10-26 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(462325, 42434, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, love the cloud formation and how the sun is trying to break through!</td>', 'Excellent picture, love the cloud formation and how the sun is trying to break through!', '2003-10-26 13:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(462327, 42984, 3290, '<td valign="top">Yum. Can you send me some? :-) Would like tosee this again in simpler dishes and without the ambient light.</td>', 'Yum. Can you send me some? :-) Would like tosee this again in simpler dishes and without the ambient light.', '2003-10-26 13:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(462328, 42770, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, good lighting.  What is this in the lower left corner?  It detracts from the quality of the whole picture.</td>', 'Nice picture, good lighting.  What is this in the lower left corner?  It detracts from the quality of the whole picture.', '2003-10-26 13:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(462330, 42882, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very very nice indeed. Beautifully tranquil shot with just the right mix of light and dark. Nice one.</td>', 'Very very nice indeed. Beautifully tranquil shot with just the right mix of light and dark. Nice one.', '2003-10-26 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(462332, 42539, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely warm tones in this and the fibres give a tactile quality to the picture which is very pleasing. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely warm tones in this and the fibres give a tactile quality to the picture which is very pleasing. Well done.', '2003-10-26 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
