(462471, 42564, 806, '<td valign="top">I like how the sunspots in this image become leading lines. terrific warm glow.</td>', 'I like how the sunspots in this image become leading lines. terrific warm glow.', '2003-10-26 17:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(462472, 43002, 806, '<td valign="top">beautiful dramatic lighting done here.</td>', 'beautiful dramatic lighting done here.', '2003-10-26 17:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(462474, 42963, 806, '<td valign="top">though beautiful, I think the sky could have been cropped to just above the single white cloud above the tree line. It would add enough light to the image, but would accentuate the dog silouette. As it is now, the light and dark sections of the photo create a visual split - creating 2 images to the viewer.<br/>Gosh.. just scrolling down and eliminating the sky altogether creates a beautiful negative space image. You really have 2 fantastic images out of this one photo.<br/>Nice work!</td>', 'though beautiful, I think the sky could have been cropped to just above the single white cloud above the tree line. It would add enough light to the image, but would accentuate the dog silouette. As it is now, the light and dark sections of the photo create a visual split - creating 2 images to the viewer.Gosh.. just scrolling down and eliminating the sky altogether creates a beautiful negative space image. You really have 2 fantastic images out of this one photo.Nice work!', '2003-10-26 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(462475, 42672, 806, '<td valign="top">I think you are a bit too brave to have gone inside....<br/>that said :P ...<br/>I like how you handled the exposure to pick up both the light and the dark areas without losing detail.</td>', 'I think you are a bit too brave to have gone inside....that said :P ...I like how you handled the exposure to pick up both the light and the dark areas without losing detail.', '2003-10-26 17:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
