(462497, 42954, 8860, '<td valign="top">And your ribbon colour is...<br/> <br/>Fantastic shot - very evocative. Not much more to add really - it speaks for itself.</td>', 'And your ribbon colour is... Fantastic shot - very evocative. Not much more to add really - it speaks for itself.', '2003-10-26 18:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(462498, 42773, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very unusual choice of subject - intriguingly done. Good composition and mesmerising effects of the refraction. [9]</td>', 'Very unusual choice of subject - intriguingly done. Good composition and mesmerising effects of the refraction. [9]', '2003-10-26 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(462499, 42969, 8860, '<td valign="top">Enjoy your blue ribbon - you deserve it!  Cracking shot in every way. My only criticism is that there are some little RGB jaggies around the silhouettes - but who cares with a sumptouous capture like this? [10]</td>', 'Enjoy your blue ribbon - you deserve it!  Cracking shot in every way. My only criticism is that there are some little RGB jaggies around the silhouettes - but who cares with a sumptouous capture like this? [10]', '2003-10-26 18:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(462501, 42185, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very evocative - excellent timing and capture.</td>', 'Very evocative - excellent timing and capture.', '2003-10-26 18:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(462505, 42087, 8860, '<td valign="top">This looked like a fist at first. Very unusual choice of subject and lighting - good, rich textures. Composition is too central for me but it''s a memorable piece.</td>', 'This looked like a fist at first. Very unusual choice of subject and lighting - good, rich textures. Composition is too central for me but it''s a memorable piece.', '2003-10-26 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
