(462552, 43016, 12223, '<td valign="top">8. Very classic. Nice clarity. Would prefer a little more uniformity in this particular shot.  As in both headlight trim fins being equally represented in length.  Would like to see a version of this with the bottom of the grill in view as well.</td>', '8. Very classic. Nice clarity. Would prefer a little more uniformity in this particular shot.  As in both headlight trim fins being equally represented in length.  Would like to see a version of this with the bottom of the grill in view as well.', '2003-10-26 19:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
