(463087, 42558, 11843, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone!<br/>This was done using a small Maglight stuffed into a shot glass, shining out the thick glass at the bottom. The blues were boosted just a bit to get the light to be more blue than yellow. Thats it! Oh,,,and then shoot it twenty million times until my focus was just right!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone!This was done using a small Maglight stuffed into a shot glass, shining out the thick glass at the bottom. The blues were boosted just a bit to get the light to be more blue than yellow. Thats it! Oh,,,and then shoot it twenty million times until my focus was just right!', '2003-10-27 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
