(463135, 42982, 5112, '<td valign="top">I wanted to comment on this picture during the challenge, and I ran out of time (we''re moving, we''re getting the house ready for selling, we''re packing, life is crazy).  It was one of my favourite shots in this challenge, it''s so good to look at.  I suspected it might be your shot (or your husband''s), I thought I recognized the girl.  The composition is very good.  The tone (not in the sense of colour tone, but mood tone) is excellent.  And I just love the colours and the shaping of the fabric on the girl''s face.  You should have ended up much higher!<br/> <br/>Ursula</td>', 'I wanted to comment on this picture during the challenge, and I ran out of time (we''re moving, we''re getting the house ready for selling, we''re packing, life is crazy).  It was one of my favourite shots in this challenge, it''s so good to look at.  I suspected it might be your shot (or your husband''s), I thought I recognized the girl.  The composition is very good.  The tone (not in the sense of colour tone, but mood tone) is excellent.  And I just love the colours and the shaping of the fabric on the girl''s face.  You should have ended up much higher! Ursula', '2003-10-27 10:07:47.000000', NULL, 0),
