(468174, 42719, 714, '<td valign="top">JasonPR~ you are right on with what I was going for with this photo.  Thanks!<br/> <br/>Thank you, heida!<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone else for the comments.  I know I should have went without the grain, but I liked it.   Oh well. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the tip, dsidwell!</td>', 'JasonPR~ you are right on with what I was going for with this photo.  Thanks! Thank you, heida! Thanks to everyone else for the comments.  I know I should have went without the grain, but I liked it.   Oh well.  Thanks for the tip, dsidwell!', '2003-10-31 13:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(468402, 42717, 2667, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote this challenge, but I love this image, especially the background. The photo overall is lovely, but the hot spots on the bottom of the vase are distracting, as is the hot spot on the right hand side. Just cropping the right-hand hot spot would crowd the flowers too much, I think, so they would need to be moved a titch. If you ever try a reshoot, I''d love to see it in your portfolio. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Didn''t vote this challenge, but I love this image, especially the background. The photo overall is lovely, but the hot spots on the bottom of the vase are distracting, as is the hot spot on the right hand side. Just cropping the right-hand hot spot would crowd the flowers too much, I think, so they would need to be moved a titch. If you ever try a reshoot, I''d love to see it in your portfolio.  ', '2003-10-31 18:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
